<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MAT" style="id">- Mbunga Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Matayu</para>
  <para style="toc1">Habali Maha handa iyandikilwi na Matayu</para>
  <para style="toc2">Matayu</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mata</para>
  <para style="mt2">Habali Maha handa iyandikilwi na</para>
  <para style="mt1">Matayu</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongulelu wa Matayu</para>
  <para style="ip">Habali Maha handa iyandikilwi na Matayu ni imonga gha vihitabu vinjechi kulilaghano lihyonu vyeni kulongelela ngalilu gha Yesu Kilisito. Kila kihitabu kimonga kingukemwa Injili ingumaanisa Habali Maha. Vihitabu havi viyandikilwi kuulongolo gha kihu kya Yesu Kilisito na weni kuyandika ni Matayu na Maliku na Lukasi na Yohana. Na wasoma wangumanya ng'ogha yiwa ni ligha nesu Matayu ayandikile Habali Maha hai. Ila inguwesekana kiyandikilwi paghati gha machuva gha isitini kuulongolo gha kihu kya Kilisito. Hila hila ingumanyika ng'ogha yiwa kugha kiyandikilwi, ila watangala wangukisila kiyandikilwi ku Palesitina na inguwesa kuwela kummbwani wa Yelusalemu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Myandika wa Habali Maha hai ni Matayu yula mweni kuwela mkungukula usulu pambila gha Yesu kumkema aweli mvulwa ghaki. Hilahila awelili akimanyikana kwa lihina lya Lawi. Matayu awelili mmonga wa wandumindumi ikumi na ivili na awayandikilili Habali hai wasoma wa Kiyahudi. Hai inguhighilisa lipala vila katumila mtindu wa kuhuyila huyila vifungu kupiti isitini kuhuma ku Lilaghano lya dahile. lukani lwa hai liwelili kulangiha yiwa Yesu ni masiha na hayu ni Kilisito, Mkombola ahaghulililwi na Sapanga, mweni kulongelelwa habali zyaki. Matayu hilahila ayandikili mighalu matangala gha Unkosi wa Sapanga. Wayahudi waliwachilili masiya atewela nkosi wa unkosi wa siasa. Matayu angungingama kwa umaha mawachilo hagha kwa kulongelela Unkosi wa Kimpumulo wa Sapanga.</para>
  <para style="ip">Habali Maha handa iyandikwa na Matayu ni kihitabu maheli kutumbula kulilaghano hyonu kwaikiva gha kutumila vifungu kuhuma kulilaghanu lya dahile. Kihitabu haki kingukonganisa malaghanu maivili. Wasomi wanguwachila yiwa Matayu ayesili kukovekela mtindu wa vihitabu vya Musa, vila vihitabu vimhano vya mtumbulo kulilaghano lya dahile. Matangaso gha Yesu kulitumbi (Matayu 5-7) yanguwesa kulandaniswa na lipindi pala Sapanga ampeghili Musa malaghililo (Ngumbungumbu 19:3-23:33).</para>
  <para style="iot">Gha mghati:</para>
  <para style="io">Matayu angutumbula Habali Maha kwa kulongela kuwelekwa kwa yesu Kilisito na vila Yesu katumbula lihengu lyaki kuwusu 1-4</para>
  <para style="io">Hinu angulongela lihengu lya Yesu na mavulo ghaki matangala avulile kuwusu 5-25</para>
  <para style="io">Matayu anguyomola kwa kulongelela Habali ngulu nesu gha utumikila wa Yesu kuhuma kukihu kyaki mbaka uhinduko ghaki hai inguwoneka kuwusu 26-28.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MAT 1" />
  <para style="s">Ukolu wa Yesu Kilisito</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 3:23-38">Luka 3:23-38</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 1:1" />Yesu Kilisito awelili kiwelekwa kya Daudi, ukolu wa Abulahamu. Hau ndiwa uwelile ukolu ghaki.<verse eid="MAT 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 1:2" />Abulahamu amlelili Isaka, na Isaka akamlela Yakobu, na Yakobu akamlela Yudasi na walongo ghaki, <verse eid="MAT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 1:3" />Yudasi hilahila akamlela Pelesi na Zela hagha nyongo ghao awelili Tamali, na Pelesi akamlela Heziloni, na Heziloni akamlela Rami, <verse eid="MAT 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 1:4" />Lami akamlela Aminadabu, na Aminadabu akamlela Nashoni, na Nashoni, akamlela Selemani, <verse eid="MAT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 1:5" />Selemani akamlela Boazi, na nyongo ghaki Boazi awelili Lahabu, Boazi na Lutu wakamlela Obedi, na Obedi akamlela Yese.<verse eid="MAT 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 1:6" />Na mweni Yese akamlela Nkosi Daudi, na Daudi akamlela Selemani, nyongo ghaki Selemani awelili mhumbu wa Ulia kwa lipindi lila, <verse eid="MAT 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 1:7" />Selemani akamlela Lehoboamu, na Lehoboamu akamlela Abiya na Abiya akamlela Asa, <verse eid="MAT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 1:8" />Asa akamlela Yehoshafati, na Yohoshafati akamlela Yolamu, na Yolamu akamlela Uzia, <verse eid="MAT 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 1:9" />Uzia akamlela Yosamu, na Yosamu akamlela Ahazi, na Ahazi akamlela Hezekia, <verse eid="MAT 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 1:10" />Hezekia akamlela Manase, na Manase akamlela Amoni, na Amoni akamlela Yosia. <verse eid="MAT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 1:11" />Yosia akamlela Yekonia na walongo ghaki, lipindi lya kuhamisilwa haku ku Babeli.<verse eid="MAT 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 1:12" />Badili gha Wayahudi kuhamisilwa Babeli, Yekonia akamlela Shealitieli na Shealitieli akamlela Zelubabeli, <verse eid="MAT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 1:13" />Zelubabeli akamlela Abiudi na Abiudi akamlela Eliakimu na Eliakimu akamlela Azoli, <verse eid="MAT 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 1:14" />Azoli akamlela Sadoki na Sadoki akamlela Akimu na Akimu akamlela Eliudi, <verse eid="MAT 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 1:15" />Eliudi akamlela Eliazali na Eliazali akamlela Matani na Matani akamlela Yakobu, <verse eid="MAT 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 1:16" />Yakobu akamlela Yusufu mngwana wa Malia nyongo ghaki Yesu, na Yesu ndiwa angukemwa Kilisito.<verse eid="MAT 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 1:17" />Hinu, kuwelili na viwelekwa ikumi na njechi kuhuma Abulahamu mbaka Nkosi Daudi, kangi kuhuma lipindi lya Daudi mbaka lipindi lya Wayahudi pawahamisilwa ku Babeli kuwelili na viwelekwa vighangi ikumi na njechi. Na lipindi lya Wayahundi mbaka lipindi lya kuwelekwa Kilisito kangi kuwelili na viwelekwa vighangi ikumi na njechi.<verse eid="MAT 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuwelekwa kwa Yesu Kilisito</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 2:1-7">Luka 2:1-7</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 1:18" />Hinu, kuwelekwa kwa Yesu kilisito kuwelili nagha, Malia nyongo ghaki paawelili kumalongelelo gha kuhetwa na Yusufu, ila pambila gha weni kuwonja handa mngwana na mhumbu, Malia akawoneka yiwa kana ndumbu kwa uwesa wa Mpumulo wa Sapanga. <verse eid="MAT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 1:19" />Kwaikiva Yusufu awelili mundu mmaha, akapala kughola luhala kwa kuhyeta kumpughanyisa Malia kuulongolo gha wandu, hinu akalamula kuleka kumposa kwa kifisu. <verse eid="MAT 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 1:20" />Paawelili akali anguuwachilila mghalu hau, Mpumulo wa Sapanga akamuhumila kundotu, akamlongela, “Yusufu, mwana wa Daudi, ukotoho kutila kumposa Malia aweli mhumbu ghako, kwaikiva kumila mata haku ni kwa uwesa wa Mpumulo wa Sapanga, <verse eid="MAT 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 1:21" />hayu ateliwopola Mwana mlumi, kwaikiva mweni ndiwa atewalokola wandu ghaki kuhuma kusambi syauna wenga utempegha lihina Yesu”.<verse eid="MAT 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 1:22" />Hinu, hagha hyogha yahumilili ili litimili lila lilando Bambu alongelili kwa kupitila mlota wa Sapanga. <verse eid="MAT 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 1:23" />Mlota ailongile, “Uloli, bikila atewela na ndumbu, atemlela mwana mlumi, na mweni atekemwa Emanueli,” imanyisa, “Sapanga pamonga na twenga.”<verse eid="MAT 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 1:24" />Hinu Yusufu paayimukili mlughonu akaghola handa vila mtumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga kamlongela, akamtola Malia aweli mhumbu ghaki. <verse eid="MAT 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 1:25" />Ila mweni akaleka kuwonjana nayu mbaka paiwopola mwana ghaki, na Yusufu akampegha mwana hayu lihina lya Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MAT 2" />
  <para style="s">Wahenja kuhuma kulihumila lijuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 2:1" />Yesu awelekili kummbwani Betelehemu gha Uyahudi, lipindi lya ulongosi wa nkosi Helodi, wandu wamanya ndondwa kuhuma kuhumila lijuwa wakahika haku mbwani Yelusalemu, <verse eid="MAT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 2:2" />wakakonya, “Kakugha hayu mwana kaweleka aweli Nkosi wa Wayahudi? Kwaikiva tulola ndondwa ghaki ikihumila kulihumila lijuwa, hinu twenga tuhika kumuyupa.”<verse eid="MAT 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 2:3" />Nkosi Helodi pakayughanila hagha, mweni pamonga na wandu ghaki wakayingilwa na holu na wandu wogha wa Yelusalemu. <verse eid="MAT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 2:4" />Hinu, Helodi akawakema pamonga watambika wakulu wogha na wavula wa malaghililo lya Sapanga ampeghili Musa akiwakonya, “Kugha hayu Kilisito ateweleka?”<verse eid="MAT 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 2:5" />Weni wakamyanga, “Ateweleka ku Betelehemu gha Uyahudi,” wakayanga. “Handa iyandikilwi na Mlota wa Sapanga,<verse eid="MAT 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 2:6" />Na wenga Betelehemu kumlima gha Yudasia,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:6">ni mkulu paghati gha mimbwani imanyika Kuyudea,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:6">na atewela kilongosi wa Waizilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:6">na mweni atelongosa wandu ghangu.”<verse eid="MAT 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 2:7" />Hinu, Helodi akawakema kwa kifisu wala wamanya ndondwa, akawakonya apati kumanya lipindi ligha chakaka lya hila ndondwa ihumila. <verse eid="MAT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 2:8" />Hinu akawalaghila wayendi ku Betelehemu akiwalongela, “Myendi mkalolese kwa umaha habali gha mwana hayu. Na mwenga pamumlola, mniyegheli habali ili na nenga mbati kuyenda kumyupa.”<verse eid="MAT 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 2:9" />Badili gha kumuyughanila nkosi, wala wamanya ndondwa wakayendela njila, na bwitu wakalikangasa kulola hila ndondwa ikiwalongosa, na weni wakaikovekela mbaka pala paaweleka Mwana. <verse eid="MAT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 2:10" />Hila ndondwa paigholoka kulila lighuta luheku lwao lukayongeseka. <verse eid="MAT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 2:11" />Hinu, wakayingila mghati lighuta, na wakamlola Mwana yula pamonga na Malia nyongo ghaki, wakatova manung'una na kumuyupa Mwana Yesu. Kuulongolo wakawoposola hupo zyau na kumtolela, hupo hazi, zahabu na uvumba na mtela kwa wana.<verse eid="MAT 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 2:12" />Sapanga awakanisili kundotu yiwa wakotoho kuhuya kwa Helodi, wakahuya kuyenda kumlima ghao kwa kupitila njila ighangi.<verse eid="MAT 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kutuwilila ku Misili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 2:13" />Wamanyi wa ndondwa pawahuka, Mtumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga akamuhumila Yusufu kundotu akamlongela, “Uhuki, umtoli Mwana na nyongo ghaki mtuwilile ku Misili. Mlikali haku mbaka pala nitewalongela, kwaikiva Helodi angupala amkomi Mwana hayu.”<verse eid="MAT 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 2:14" />Hinu, Yusufu akatandamuka, akamtola Mwana pamonga na nyongo ghaki, akahuka uhiku, akiyendela ku Misili. <verse eid="MAT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 2:15" />Akatama kula mbaka Helodi pakahova. Hali lihumila, ili litimili lila lilongelilwi na Bambu kwa mlomo wa mlota ghaki akilonga, “Nimkemili Mwana ghangu ahuki ku Misili.”<verse eid="MAT 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wana wangukomwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 2:16" />Helodi pamanyili yiwa wala wamanya ndondwa wawelili wamlulunganya, akahyoma nesu. Hinu akalaghila kukomwa wana wogha walumi wala weni kuwelekwa machuva maivili kuhyetu kumlima wa Betelehemu na mahala kula kungutindila mlima hula. Agholile nagha badili gha kulongelwa na wala wamanya ndondwa.<verse eid="MAT 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 2:17" />Mghalu hau ukaghola kuwoneka yiwa milando ailongelili Yelemia mwenekuwela mlota wa Sapanga itimila.<verse eid="MAT 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 2:18" />“Lilowi likayughanika haku Lama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:18">kililo na malumbililo ghatangala. Laheli anguwalilila wana ghaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:18">kalema kunyamaliswa kwaikiva wogha wahova.”<verse eid="MAT 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhuma ku Misili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 2:19" />Badili gha kihu kya Helodi, mtumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga akamuhumila Yusufu haku Misili kundotu, <verse eid="MAT 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 2:20" />na kumlongela, “Umtoli, nyongo na Mwana muhuki, mhuyi kumlima wa Izilaili kwaikiva wala wawelili wakihakula kumkoma mwana wahova kala.” <verse eid="MAT 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 2:21" />Hinu, Yusufu akatandamuka, akamtola mwana pamonga na nyongo ghaki, akahuya kumlima Izilaili.<verse eid="MAT 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 2:22" />Ila Yusufu pakahyoghanila yiwa Alikelao, mwana wa Helodi, kawela nkosi wa haku Yudasia akitola fwasi gha tati ghaki, akatila kuyenda kula. Na mweni badili gha kukaniswa kundotu kwa lihanja lya ipili, akayenda mbandi gha Galilaya, <verse eid="MAT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 2:23" />Akahamila kummbwani waukema Nazaleti. Ndiwa itimilile milando ilongelilwi na walota wa Sapanga, “Atekemwa mundu wa Nazaleti.”<verse eid="MAT 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MAT 3" />
  <para style="s">Yohanaanguwatangasila wandu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 1:2-8">Maliku 1:2-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luka 3:1-18</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 3:1" />Lipindi Yesu akiyendelela kulikala haku ku Nazaleti, Yohanambatisa akawela kuluvagha lwa Uyahudi akawatangasila wandu Habali Maha gha Sapanga. <verse eid="MAT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 3:2" />Kwa kuwalongela Wayahudi, “Mleki sambi na mumhuyili Sapanga, kwaikiva Unkosi wa kundumba upabehi.” <verse eid="MAT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 3:3" />Yohanandiwa mundu mweni kutimilisa kila akilongilile mlota Isaya paailongile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 3:3">“Lilowi lya mundu lingulongela kuluvagha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 3:3">‘Mliyandali kwaikiva gha Bambu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 3:3">Mlikali vila angupala.’”<verse eid="MAT 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 3:4" />Yohanambatisa avalili lihabiti ligholilwi kwa mipuku gha ngamiya, na luhunga lwa ngosi kukibulibulilo kyaki, mulyo ghaki uwelili nzige na bhuche. <verse eid="MAT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 3:5" />Hinu, wandu kuhuma Yelusalemu, Yudasia hyogha na milima hyogha gha mmbalimbali gha lweni Yoludani, <verse eid="MAT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 3:6" />Naweni wakalongela sambi syau, hinu Yohanaakawabatisa mulweni Yolidani.<verse eid="MAT 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 3:7" />Ila paailolile Mafalisayo na Masadukayu wakihika kwa mweni ili awabatisi. Yohanaakalonga, “Mwenga , kiwelekwa kya njoka! Ni ghani mweni kuwapwepwela mwenga mutuwi lung'ai lula lutehika? <verse eid="MAT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 3:8" />Hinu, mlangihi kwa matendu yiwa mleka sambi na mumhyukila Sapanga. <verse eid="MAT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 3:9" />Kangi mkotoho kuliwachila na kujilongelela tati wa twenga ni Ibulahimu! Ninguwalongela chakaka, Sapanga anguwesa kughola maganga hagha yaweli wana wa Ibulahimu. <verse eid="MAT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 3:10" />Hinu, liwao liwela kala kumikegha gha kila libiki, kila libiki lilela ng'ogha matungula maha litedumulwa na kudangwa kulyoto. <verse eid="MAT 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 3:11" />Nenga ninguwabatisa kwa masi kulangigha mleka sambi na kumhyukila Sapanga. Ila yula mweni kuhika badili gha nenga kana makakala kupiti nenga, na nenga nipalwa ng'ogha hata kupapa hilatu ghaki. Mweni atewabatisa kwa Mpumulo wa Sapanga na lyoto lyaki. <verse eid="MAT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 3:12" />Luselu lwaki kalukola kumawoku, ili apyahili mahala pakupukutulila nganu ghaki na kuvika weka miyeyu, na kangi atevika nganu maha kungoku ghaki, na hinu atenyanya miyeyu kwa lyoto lyeni kujimika ng'ogha.” <figure style="fig" file="06 Threshing.jpg" size="col" ref="3:12">Mundu anguyeyesa nganu</figure><verse eid="MAT 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angubatiswa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Maliku 1:9-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21-22">Luka 3:21-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 3:13" />Lipindi lila Yesu akahuma kumbwani wa Galilaya akahika kulweni Yoludani, akamyendela Yohanaili abatiswi. <verse eid="MAT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 3:14" />Ila Yohanaayesili kumkanisa akilonga, “Na wenga unguhika ubatiswi na nenga! Nenga mweni ningupalwa kubatiswa na wenga.”<verse eid="MAT 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 3:15" />Ila Yesu akamyanga, “Kwa lipindi hali, ugholi lila ningukulongela uligholi, kwaikikiva tungupalwa tutimilisi mapalo gha Sapanga kwa njila hai” Hinu Yohanaakaghola kila alongelilwi na Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 3:16" />Badili gha Yesu kubatiswa, akahuka mmasi, na bwitu kundumba kukagubutuka akamlola Mpumulo wa Sapanga akihuluka handa ngunda, akihika kunani kwa mweni. <verse eid="MAT 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 3:17" />Na lilowi kuhuma kundumba likalonga, “Hayu ni Mwana wa nenga ningumpala. Angunihekelesa nesu.”<verse eid="MAT 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MAT 4" />
  <para style="s">Yesu anguyeswa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">Maliku 1:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">Luka 4:1-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 4:1" />Hinu Yesu akilongoswa na Mpumulo wa Sapanga kuyenda kuluvagha ili ayeswi na Lihyukana. <verse eid="MAT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 4:2" />Akawopa kulyegha mulyo machuwa ialobaini pamuhi na uhiku, na kumwihu ghaki akawela na njala nesu. <verse eid="MAT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 4:3" />Hinu, Lihyukana likamuhikila na kumlongela, “Ikiva wenga ndiwa Mwana wa Sapanga, ulaghili maganga hagha yaweli mibumunda.”<verse eid="MAT 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 4:4" />Yesu akamyanga, “Iyandikwa kumayandiko gha Sapanga, Mundu kanguwesa ng'ogha kulama kwa libumunda hela, ila kwa kila lilando lyeni kuhuma kwa Sapanga.”<verse eid="MAT 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 4:5" />Hinu Lihyukana likamtola Yesu mbaka ku Yelusalemu na kumvika kunani gha kindangawala kulighuta lya Sapanga, <verse eid="MAT 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 4:6" />Akamlongela, “Ikiva wenga ni mwana wa Sapanga, ulidangi pahi, kwaikiva iyandikwa kumayandiko gha Sapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:6">Sapanga atewalaghila watumikila ghaki wa kundumba na weni watekupokela mumawoko ghao.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:6">Ili ukotoho likwala mliganga.”<verse eid="MAT 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 4:7" />Yesu akamlongela, “Iyandikwa, Ukotoho kumyesa Bambu Sapanga ghako.”<verse eid="MAT 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 4:8" />Hinu Lihyukana likamtola mbaka kunani gha litumbi litali, likamlangiha, mahala kogha unkosi wa kumlima wogha na umaheli ghaki. <verse eid="MAT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 4:9" />Akamlongela, “Havi vyogha nitekupegha ikiva utenitundamila na kuniyupa.”<verse eid="MAT 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 4:10" />Hinu Yesu akamlongela, “Uhuki, kuulongolo gha nenga, Lihyukana! Kwaikiva iyandikwa kumayandiku gha Sapanga, Umtundamili Bambu Sapanga ghako na umyupi mweni weka yaki.”<verse eid="MAT 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 4:11" />Hinu, Lihyukana likamleka, watumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga wakahika na wakamtumikila.<verse eid="MAT 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angutumbula lihengu ku Galilaya</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">Maliku 1:14-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:14-15">Luka 4:14-15</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 4:12" />Yesu pakayughanila yiwa Yohanakavikwa mlighuta lya wawopwa akayenda ku Galilaya. <verse eid="MAT 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 4:13" />Akahuka Nazaleti, akayenda Kapelinaumu mmbwani weni kuwela pabehi na lihiwa Galilaya, kumimbaka gha mlima wa Zabuloni na wa Nafutali, <verse eid="MAT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 4:14" />Yagholikili nagha ili litimilili lila lilando lilongelilwi na mlota Isaya,<verse eid="MAT 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 4:15" />“Mlima wa Zabuloni na mlima wa Nafutali.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:15">Iwela kunjila gha kuyendela kulihiwa mwambu gha lweni Yoludani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:15">Ku Galilaya, Mlima wa wandu weni kummanya ng'ogha Sapanga!<verse eid="MAT 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 4:16" />Wandu watamili mlwisa waulolili mhana mkulunga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:16">Na wala walikalili ku holu gha kuhwegha.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:16">Mhana uwalangasila.”<verse eid="MAT 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 4:17" />Kuhuma lipindi lila Yesu akatumbula kutangasa akilonga, “Mleki sambi na mumhuyili Sapanga, kwaikiva unkosi wa Kundumba upabehi.”<verse eid="MAT 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anguwakema walopola homba wanjechi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Maliku 1:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">Luka 5:1-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 4:18" />Yesu paawelili akityanga mmbali gha lihiwa Galilaya, akawalola walongu waivili walopola homba, Simoni mwenikukemwa Petelo na Andelea mlongo ghaki. Wawelili wakitagha nyafu zyao mlihiwa kwaikiva weni wawelili walopola. <verse eid="MAT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 4:19" />Hinu Yesu akawalongela, “Mnikovikeli, na nenga nitewavula ndambu gha kukungula wandu handa walopola vila wangukungula na kuyegha homba ukaya.” <verse eid="MAT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 4:20" />Bahala, wakaleka nyafu zyao, wakamkovekela.<verse eid="MAT 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 4:21" />Pawayendili kuulongolu mayaghani. akawalola walongo ghangi waivili, Yakobu na Yohana, wana wa Zebedayu. Wawelili mghati gha whatu pamonga na tati ghao Zebedayu, wanguhonjola nyafu zyao. Hinu, Yesu akawakema. <verse eid="MAT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 4:22" />Bahala wakaleka whatu ghao, pamonga na tati ghao, wakamkovekela.<verse eid="MAT 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anguwavula wandu na kuwalamisa wavina</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 6:17-19">Luka 6:17-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 4:23" />Yesu awelili akiyenda kila mahali kumbwani Galilaya, akivula kumighuta gha kukonganika Wayahudi na kutangasa Habali Maha zya Unkosi wa Sapanga, akilamisa mavina wekaweka na kila kulwala kwa wandu. <verse eid="MAT 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 4:24" />Habali zyaki zikalandala mbandi zyoha zya Siliya. Wavina wogha weni kuwela na kulwala wekaweka na wala waghasilwi na uhakili wekaweka, na weni kukolwa na mahoka na weni kihinduhindu na wala wapolili vikongonu, wakayeghwa kwa Yesu, akawalamisa wogha. <verse eid="MAT 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 4:25" />Mapinga yatangala ya wandu kuhuma Galilaya, na mimbwani ikumi gha Dekapoli, na Yelusalemu, Yudasia na kumwambu gha lweni Yoludani, yamkovekelili.<verse eid="MAT 4:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MAT 5" />
  <para style="s">Yesu anguwavula wandu kulitumbi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 5:1" />Na mweni Yesu pakalola lipinga lya wandu, akakwela kulitumbi, na weni wavulwa ghaki wakamuhikila, <verse eid="MAT 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 5:2" />Hinu akatumbula kuwavula, akilonga,<verse eid="MAT 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Luheku lwa chakaka</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 6:20-23">Luka 6:20-23</ref></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 5:3" />“Watewela na luheku wandu wogha wangupala kummanya Sapanga kungalilu ghao.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:3">Kwaikiva unkosi wa kundumba ni kwaikiva gha weni!” <verse eid="MAT 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 5:4" />“Watewela na luheku wala wogha weni kunyengemala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:4">Kwaikiva watahekeleswa.” <verse eid="MAT 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 5:5" />“Watewela na luheku wala weni kuyitikila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:5">Kwaikiva watelihi mlima.”<verse eid="MAT 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 5:6" />“Watewela na luheku wala wogha weni kuwela na njala pamonga na kuyumilila kwaikiva gha kumuyitikila Sapanga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:6">Kwaikiva wateyukutiswa.” <verse eid="MAT 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 5:7" />“Watewela na luheku wala wogha weni luhungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:7">Kwaikiva watewonelwa luhungu.”<verse eid="MAT 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 5:8" />“Watewela na luheku wala wogha weni mioyu maha.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:8">Kwaikiva watemlola Sapanga.”<verse eid="MAT 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 5:9" />“Watewela na luheku wala wogha weni kuyegha kuponga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:9">Kwaikiva hagha watekemwa wana wa Sapanga.”<verse eid="MAT 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 5:10" />“Watewela na luheku wala wogha weni kughola vila angupala Sapanga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:10">Kwaikiva unkosi wa kundumba ni waweni,”<verse eid="MAT 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 5:11" />“Mtewela na luheku mwenga wandu pawawalighu, pawawapokola na kuwakupikila kila ndambu gha uhakata kwaikiva gha nenga.” <verse eid="MAT 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 5:12" />Mhekeleli na mkuwi na kilulu kwaikiva hupo zyenu ni ngulu kundumba. Havi ndiwa wawahakilile walota wa Sapanga haku dahile.<verse eid="MAT 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Munyu na mhana</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 9:50">Maliku 9:50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:34-35">Luka 14:34-35</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 5:13" />Yesu akalonga, “Mwenga ni munyu wa mlima wogha. Ila munyu pauyalamisa unogha ghaki, mteghola niki inoghi? Utetutanga ng'ogha chochosi, ila kutagha panji na itimbangwi na wandu.”<verse eid="MAT 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 5:14" />“Mwenga ni mhana wa mlima wogha! Mmbwani uchengilwi kunani gha litumbi uwesa ng'ogha kuhighwa.” <verse eid="MAT 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 5:15" />Kwahela wandu wanguwesa kukosa taa na kugubika kwa lidebi, ila wanguvika kunani kindu kya kuvikila taa ili iwesi kuwalangasila wogha wa mlighuta. <verse eid="MAT 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 5:16" />Hilahila, mhana wa mwenga ulangasi kuulongolo gha wandu, ili wapati kulola matendu gha mwenga maha na wawesi kumyinula Tati wa mwenga wa kundumba.<verse eid="MAT 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mavulo gha malaghililo gha Sapanga ampeghili Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 5:17" />“Mkotoho kuiwachila yiwa nihika kuhumisa malaghililo na mavulo gha walota. Nenga nihika ng'ogha kuhumisa ila kutimilisa.” <verse eid="MAT 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 5:18" />Kundumba na mlima wogha vitehuka. Ila ninguwalongela yiwa kwahela hata mbandi imonga gha lilando lya laghililo litehuka. Kila kindu kyeni kuyandikwa kitehumila. <verse eid="MAT 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 5:19" />Hinu, yeyosi atetenyula malaghililo hagha yenikuwela masokombi, na kuwavula wandu nagha, hayu atekemwa mnung'una nesu kuunkosi wa kundumba, ila mundu yula ateghola na kuvula, hayu atekemwa mkulu kuunkosi wa kundumba. <verse eid="MAT 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 5:20" />Hinu ninguwalongela, mngupalwa muyitikili laghililo lya Sapanga kwa umaha kupiti vila wagholile Wavula wa laghililo na Mafalisayo. Kihyetu na kughola nagha mtewesa ng'ogha kuyingila kuunkosi wa Sapanga.<verse eid="MAT 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuwakanisa wandu waleki lilaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 5:21" />“Mhyoghanila kala yiwa wandu wa dahile walongelilwi, Ukotoho kukoma mundu. Yula atekoma mundu atepalwa atoswi.” <verse eid="MAT 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 5:22" />Ila nenga ninguwalongela, yeyosi angumhyomela mlongu ghaki, angupaliwa alamulwe. Na yula angumpughanya mlongu ghaki ateyeghwa kuulamuli. Na yula atemkema mlongo ghaki, “Wenga mndyungi,” atepalwa kuyingila kulyoto lya kujimika ng'ogha. <verse eid="MAT 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 5:23" />Hinu, pauyegha mapegho ghako kuulongolo gha kihanja na bahala ukakumbwike yiwa mlongo ghako kana magombi na wenga, <verse eid="MAT 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 5:24" />uleki mapegho ghako kuulongolo gha kighanja, utumbuli kuyenda mkalaghani na mlongo ghako, ndiwa uhuyi uyeghi mapegho ghako.<verse eid="MAT 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 5:25" />“Handa mundu mmonga Ulaghani na msitaki ghako kwa kuloposela mkiva mnjila pambila gha kuhika kuulamuli. Ili msitaki ghako akotoho kukuvika mumawoko gha mlamula, na mweni mlamula akakuvika mumawoko gha watovangondo, na wenga ukawopwa mlighuta lya wawopwa.” <verse eid="MAT 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 5:26" />Chakaka ningukulongela, utehuka ng'ogha muuwopwa mbaka uhipi mapesa hyogha.<verse eid="MAT 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mavulo gha kukanisa ngongola</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 5:27" />Yesu akalonga, “Mhyoghanila yiwa wandu walongelilwi, Mkotoho kughola ngongola.” <verse eid="MAT 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 5:28" />Ila nenga ninguwalongela, yula atemlola mdala kwa luhujulu, hayu kaghola kala ngongola mmoyu. <verse eid="MAT 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 5:29" />Hinu, paikawela lisu lyako lya kuliyila lingukughola ugholi mahakata ulitupuli ukalitagha kutali. Mbaha wenga kuyaghamila kikongonu kimonga kya higha ghako, kupiti higha ghako hyogha kutaghwa kulyoto lyeni kujimika ng'ogha. <verse eid="MAT 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 5:30" />Na ikiva liwoku lyako lya kuliyila lingukughola ugholi uhakata, ulidumuli na ukalitagha kutali. Mbaa kwa wenga kuyaghamila kikongonu kyako kimonga kya higha ghako, kupiti higha ghako hyogha iyendi kulyoto lijimika ng'ogha.<verse eid="MAT 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Makaniso wandu wakotoho kulekana</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 19:9">Matayu 19:9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Maliku 10:11-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luka 16:18</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 5:31" />“Sapanga kalonga kala, Mundu mweni kumleka mhumbu ghaki, ingupalwa ampeghi mayandiko gha kulekana.” <verse eid="MAT 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 5:32" />Ila nenga ninguwalongela, mundu yoyosi kapalwa ng'ogha kumleka mhumbu kwa uhakata wowosi, pangi kwa kughola ngongola, paumleka mhumbu kwa uhakata wowosi ungumghola aweli mngongola. Na mundu yoyosi mweni kumposa hayu mdala alekilwi angughola ngongola.<verse eid="MAT 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lukasini lwa malaghano kwa Sapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 5:33" />“Kangi myughanila yiwa wandu wa dahile walongililwi, mundu akotoho kulapa kwa uhwangi, ila utimilisi kila ulaghanili na Bambu.” <verse eid="MAT 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 5:34" />Ila nenga ninguwalongela, katu mkotoho kulapa, hata kwa kundumba kwaikiva ndiwa kikalilo kya unkosi wa Sapanga, <verse eid="MAT 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 5:35" />au kulapa kwa mlima, kwaikiva ndiwa mahala ghaki Sapanga anguvikila maghulu, au kwa Yelusalemu, kwaikiva ndiwa mmbwani wa Nkosi Mkulu. <verse eid="MAT 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 5:36" />Na mwenga mkotoho kulapa kwa mutu kwaikiva muwesa ng'ogha kughola hata hwila imonga kuwela mbulete au mbile. <verse eid="MAT 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 5:37" />“Hina” mwenga, iweli “Hina” na “Katu” iweli “Katu” Kyokyosi kipiti hagha kinguhuma kwa yula mhakata.<verse eid="MAT 5:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mavulo gha kukanisa kuhuyisila</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 6:29-30">Luka 6:29-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 5:38" />“Mhyoghanila yiwa ilongilwi, lisu kwa lisu, linu kwa linu.” <verse eid="MAT 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 5:39" />Ila nenga ninguwalongela, mkotoho kumuhuyisila mundu mahakata. Na mundu paakubakula nganja lya kuliyila, umghalambulile na lya kushotu. <verse eid="MAT 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 5:40" />Handa mundu angupala kukuyegha kunjenga kaya kwaikiva gha lishati hinu umpeghi hilahila na likoti lyako. <verse eid="MAT 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 5:41" />Mundu paakupala wenga umyegheli mhighu ghaki pabehi, wenga umyegheli patali. <verse eid="MAT 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 5:42" />Mundu paangukuluwa kindu wenga ungupalwa umpeghi, ukotoho kuwela mwimi.<verse eid="MAT 5:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mavulo gha upalo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 6:27-28">Luka 6:27-28</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 6:32-36">32-36</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 5:43" />“Mhyoghanila yiwa ilongilwi, umpali ghanja ghako, na kumyomelela mhakata ghako.” <verse eid="MAT 5:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 5:44" />Ila nenga ninguwalongela, muwapali wahakata wa mwenga na kuwayupila wahakata wa mwenga na wala wanguwahakila mwenga, <verse eid="MAT 5:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 5:45" />ili mpati kuwela wana wa Tati gha mwenga wa kundumba. Kwaikiva mweni Kanguwalangasila lijuwa lyaki wandu wahakata na walungwana, na kuwatonyela ndonya wandu wa maha na wahakata. <verse eid="MAT 5:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 5:46" />Ikiva munguwapala wala wanguwapala mwenga hela, mtepokela hupo liki? Kwaikiva hata wakungula usulu wangughola handa havi. <verse eid="MAT 5:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 5:47" />Kangi pamuwagholela umaha walongo wa mwenga hela, mtewela mghola kindu kya kukangasaa? Hata wandu wamkwinila ng'ogha Sapanga wangughola nagha. <verse eid="MAT 5:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 5:48" />Hinu, mngupalwa machuwa hyogha muweli mtimila handa Tati wa mwenga wa kundumba vila kahela ulepelelo wowosi .<verse eid="MAT 5:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MAT 6" />
  <para style="s">Mavulo gha kuwatanga wandu wakapuku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 6:1" />“Mkali mihu mkotoho kughola matendu maha kuulongolo gha wandu lli wawaloli. Kwaikiva pamghola nagha mtewela ng'ogha na hupo kuhuma kwa Tati wa mwenga wa kundumba.”<verse eid="MAT 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 6:2" />Hinu paumtanga mundu mkapuku, ukotoho kulitangasa. Ukotoho kughola handa wambindingu wangughola kumaghuta gha kukonganika Wayahudi. Chakaka ninguwalongela, wandu hagha wapokela kala hupo ghao. <verse eid="MAT 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 6:3" />Ila wenga paumtanga mundu kapuku, ugholi kwa kifisu, hata mundu yoyosi akotoho kumanya, <verse eid="MAT 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 6:4" />umtangi mundu bila wandu kumanya, na Tati wa wenga yula angulola ghala gha mkifisu, atekupegha hupo.<verse eid="MAT 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mavulo gha kuyupa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 11:2-4">Luka 11:2-4</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 6:5" />“Pamyupa, mkotoho kughola handa wambindingu. Weni wangupala kuyupa wakiwela wagholoka kumalighuta gha kukonganika Wayahudi na kumbembi zya mnjila ili wandu wawaloli. Chakaka ninguwalongela, hagha wapokela kala hupo ghao. <verse eid="MAT 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 6:6" />Ila wenga pauyupa, uyingili mkyumba kyaku, utati mlyango, na hinu umluwi Tati ghako wa mkifisu, na mweni atekupegha hupo ghako.”<verse eid="MAT 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 6:7" />Mwenga pamyupa, mkotoho kulongela milando yenikuwela ng'ogha gha maha handa wandu wammanya ng'ogha Sapanga. Weni wanguliwachila yiwa wateyughanilwa kwaikiva gha milando itangala wailonga. <verse eid="MAT 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 6:8" />Mkotoho kuwela handa weni. Kwaikiva Tati wa mwenga angumanya kila mngukipala pambila gha kumuyupa. <verse eid="MAT 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 6:9" />Hinu, nagha ndiwa mngupalwa kuyupa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:9">“Tati wa twenga mweni kulikala kundumba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:9">lihina lyako lisifilwi.”<verse eid="MAT 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 6:10" />Unkosi ghako uhike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:10">yala unguyapala ndiwa yagholeki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:10">kundumba hilahila haku kumlimawogha.<verse eid="MAT 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 6:11" />Utupeghi lelo mulyo wa kila lelo.<verse eid="MAT 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 6:12" />Utulekiseli sambi tusighola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:12">handa na twenga vila tungulekesela mahakata ghala wangutugholela wandu waghangi.<verse eid="MAT 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 6:13" />Ukotoho kututaya mmayesu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:13">ila utulokoli na yula mhakata,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:13">Kwaikiva unkosi ni wa wenga, na makakala na ukulu hata machuwa hyogha bila mwihu.<verse eid="MAT 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 6:14" />“Kwaikiva pamuwalekesela wandu mahakata ghao, Tati wa mwenga wa kundumba hilahila atewalekesela na mwenga.” <verse eid="MAT 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 6:15" />Ila pamleka kuwalekesela waghangi weni kuwakosela, na mweni Tati wa mwenga atewalekesela ng'ogha sambi sya mwenga.<verse eid="MAT 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malaghilo kukuwopa kulyegha mulyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 6:16" />“Pamuwopa kulyegha mulyo, mkotoho kulangiha handa vila wangughola wambindingu, weni kughalambula wuso wawoneki wangulumbilila. Wapati kuloleka na wandu yiwa wawopa. Chakaka ninguwalongela yiwa weni wapata kala hupo ghao.” <verse eid="MAT 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 6:17" />Ila wenga pauwopa, upakali mutu ghako mahuta, na kukula wusu ghako, <verse eid="MAT 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 6:18" />ili mundu yeyosi akotoho kumanya yiwa unguwopa, ila umanyiki na Tati ghako wa mkifisu hela na mweni atekupegha hupo.<verse eid="MAT 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngoko gha kundumba</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 12:33-34">Luka 12:33-34</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 6:19" />“Mkotoho kujivikila ngoko haku kumlimawogha haku kweni sondu na kutu weni kuwesa kukongonyola, na mwihi kuyingila na kuhija.” <verse eid="MAT 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 6:20" />Mjivikili ngoko kundumba haku sondu na kutu wanguwesa ng'ogha kukongonyola, wala wahija wanguwesa ng'ogha kuyingila na kuhija. <verse eid="MAT 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 6:21" />kwaikiva pala ngoko ghako iwela, ndiwa na moyu ghako utewela.<verse eid="MAT 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mhana wa higha</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 11:34-36">Luka 11:34-36</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 6:22" />“Limbamba lya mhigha ni lisu, hinu lisu lya wenga paliwela likomu, mhigha ghako wogha utewela na mhana.” <verse eid="MAT 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 6:23" />Ila paikawela lisu lyako likomu ng'ogha, na higha ghako hyogha itewela kulwiha. Hinu ikiva mhana weni kuwela mhigha ghako ni lwisa, hinu hali lwisa litewela totolo.<verse eid="MAT 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kumpala Sapanga na kupala unaisa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 16:13">Luka 16:13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:22-31">12:22-31</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 6:24" />“Kwahela mundu anguwesa kutumikila mabambu waivili. Kwaikiva atemhyomela mmonga na kumpala hayu waivili, au atekonganika na mmonga na kumpughanya yula ghangi. Muwesa ng'ogha kumtumikila Sapanga na unaisa pamonga.”<verse eid="MAT 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 6:25" />Kwa nagha, ninguwalongela yiwa mkotoho kughasikila ngalilu gha mwenga, yiwa mtelyegha niki au kunywegha niki, au mtevala niki, ghuli, ngalilu ni gha kughasikilwa ng'ogha kupiti mulyo, na mhigha wa kughasikilwa kupiti nguu? <verse eid="MAT 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 6:26" />Muwaloli mbongu wa kunani, hagha wangukulila ng'ogha na kubena au kuvika ngoko, ila Tati wa twenga wa kundumba anguwapegha mulyo. Ghuli, mwenga wakughasikilwa ng'ogha kupiti hagha wambongu? <verse eid="MAT 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 6:27" />Ni ghani paghati gha mwenga kwa kughasika nesu anguwesa kuyongesa lipindi lya ukomu ghaki?<verse eid="MAT 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 6:28" />“Na kwa kyani mghasikili nguu? Mloli ulua wa kumihitu vila ungunemulila. Na ungughola ng'ogha mahengu au kuisonelela nguu zyaki.” <verse eid="MAT 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 6:29" />Ila ninguwalongela, hata nkosi Selemani mweni na unaisa ghaki wogha apatili ng'ogha kuvwaliswa maha handa mamonga gha uluwa hau. <verse eid="MAT 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 6:30" />Hinu ikiva Sapanga anguyavwalisa nagha manyahi gha mlitawa, yala tunguyalola lelo na kilau yangudangwa kulyoto, ghuli, atewavwalisa ng'ogha mwenga weni ukwinila msokombi?<verse eid="MAT 6:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 6:31" />“Hinu, mkotoho kughasikila, tutelyegha kyani? Na tutenywegha niki? Au tutevwala niki?” <verse eid="MAT 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 6:32" />Wandu wammanya ng'ogha Sapanga wangughasikila hagha hyogha. Tati wa mwenga wa kundumba angumanya yiwa mngupala vindu havi vyogha. <verse eid="MAT 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 6:33" />Hinu, mhakuli huti unkosi wa Sapanga na kulikala kwa kukovekela vila angupala na hagha hyogha mteyongeselwa. <verse eid="MAT 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 6:34" />Hinu mkotoho kughasikila kilau, kwaikiva kilau itewela na maghaso ghaki gha kilau, kila lichuwa linguwela na maghaso ghaki.<verse eid="MAT 6:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MAT 7" />
  <para style="s">Wandu wakotoho kuwalongela wayau yiwa waghola uhakata.</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 6:37-38">Luka 6:37-38</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 6:41-42">41-42</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 7:1" />Yesu akalonga, “Ukotoho kulonga kwa yeyosi yiwa kamhakata, paughola nagha Sapanga atekulongela wenga ni mundu mhakata.” <verse eid="MAT 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 7:2" />Kwaikiva vila mngulonga wandu ni wahakata, ndiwa na mwenga mtelongelwa na Sapanga yiwa ni wahakata, kwa laghililo lilalila mtetumila ndiwa litetumilwa kwa mwenga. <verse eid="MAT 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 7:3" />Kwa kyani unguwesa kukilola likapi liwela kulisu lya mlongo ghako, kunu unguwesa ng'ogha kulola liyeyu liwela mlisu lyako? <verse eid="MAT 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 7:4" />Au unguwesaghuli kumlongela mlongo ghako, “Unileki nihumisi likapi kulisu lyako kunu kuwela na liyeyu kulisu lyako mweni?” <verse eid="MAT 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 7:5" />Mmbindingu wenga! Utumbuli kuhumisa likapi liwela mlisu lyaku na hinu utewesa kulola maha vila utehumisa liyeyu liwela mlisu lya mlongo ghako.<verse eid="MAT 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 7:6" />“Mkotoho kuwapegha ghalu hindu gha Sapanga wakotoho kuwahyukila na kuwalakatula mwenga, hata kuwataghila mighuluwi hindu gha maha nesu. Ikiva mteghola nagha weni watewatimbanga na kangi watewahyukila na kuwalakatula.”<verse eid="MAT 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mluwi, mhakuli, mkuwi mlyango</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 11:9-13">Luka 11:9-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 7:7" />“Mluwi, na mwenga mtepeghwa, mhakuli, na mwenga mtepokela, mkuwi mlyango, namwenga mtewoposolelwa.” <verse eid="MAT 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 7:8" />Kwaikiva, yeyosi mweni kuluwa angupeghwa, mweni kuhakula angupokela na yula angukuwa mlyango atewoposwelela. <verse eid="MAT 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 7:9" />Au ni ghani paghati gha mwenga, paikawela mwana ghaki kamluwa libumunda atempegha liganga? <verse eid="MAT 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 7:10" />Ghuli, mwana ghaki pakamluwa homba, utempegha njoka? <verse eid="MAT 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 7:11" />Hinu ikiva mwenga, mwawahakata, mngumanya kuwapegha wana wa mwenga hindu gha maha, ghuli, Tati wa mwenga wa kundumba ateghola ng'ogha kupiti hagha kwa kuwapegha hindu maha wala weni kumluwa?<verse eid="MAT 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 7:12" />Hyogha mnguyapala wandu wawagholeli mwenga, muwagholeli na weni nagha. Kwaikiva hai ndiwa iyandikwa kulaghililo lya Sapanga ampeghili Musa na walota.<verse eid="MAT 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Njila ikombala na njila ngulu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 13:24">Luka 13:24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 7:13" />“Myingili kwa kupitila njila ikombala. Kwaikiva njila ilongosa kukihu ni ngulu, na njila gha kuyingila mula ni ngulu, na weni ni watangala wala wayingila kupitila njila hai.” <verse eid="MAT 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 7:14" />Ila njila ilongosa kuukomu ni ikombala, na njila wa kuyingilila hamu ni mkombala, ni wandu wamayaghani hela wanguwesa kuimanya njila hila.<verse eid="MAT 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Libiki lingumanyika kwa matungula ghaki</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 6:43-44">Luka 6:43-44</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 7:15" />“Mlikali mihu na walota wa uhwangi. Weni wanguhika kwa mwenga wakiwoneka handa kondolu kwa panji, ila kwa mghati ni ghalu mwitu wakalipa.” <verse eid="MAT 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 7:16" />Mtewamanya kwa matendu ghao handa vila tungumanya libiki kukovekelana na matungula ghaki. Kwaikiva iwesekana ng'ogha kukonyola matungula gha sabibu kumibiki gha mbighili. <verse eid="MAT 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 7:17" />Hinu, libiki lya maha lingulela matungula gha maha, na libiki lihakata lingulela matungula mahakata. <verse eid="MAT 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 7:18" />Libiki lya maheli linguwesa ng'ogha kulela matungula mahakata, na hata libiki lihakata linguwesa ng'ogha kulela matungula maheli. <verse eid="MAT 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 7:19" />Kila libiki lyeni kulela ng'ogha matungula gha maha litedumulwa na kutaghwa kulyoto. <verse eid="MAT 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 7:20" />Hinu, kwa matungula ghao mtewamanya.<verse eid="MAT 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Niwamanya ng'ogha mwenga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 13:25-27">Luka 13:25-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 7:21" />Waghangi wa wandu mweni kunikema Bambu, ateyingila kuunkosi wa kundumba. Ila wala weka weni kumtundamila Tati ghangu wa kundumba. <verse eid="MAT 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 7:22" />Kulichuwa lya ulamulo wandu watangala watelongela kwa nenga, “Bambu tutangasili kwa lihina lyako, na kwa lihina lyako tuwawingili mahoka na hilahila tukaghola makangaso matangala.” <verse eid="MAT 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 7:23" />Ila nenga nitewalongela, “Niwamanyili ng'ogha mwenga, muhuki haku, mwenga waghola mahakata!”<verse eid="MAT 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wachenga waivili</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 6:4-49">Luka 6:4-49</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 7:24" />“Hinu, kila mundu yula atehyoghanila milando gha nenga na kuighola, angulandana na mundu mweni luhala maha, achengili lighuta lyaki kunani gha mghomba.” <verse eid="MAT 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 7:25" />Ndonya paikatonya, milweni ikamema, liyegha likulunga likahika na kuhukumula lighuta lila. Ila liteguwa ng'ogha, kwaikiva lichengwili kunani gha mghomba maha.<verse eid="MAT 7:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 7:26" />“Ila mundu yeyosi mweni kuyughanila milando ghangu na akaleka kuighola, hayu angulandana na mundu mndyungi mweni kuchenga lighuta lyaki kweni mhanga. <verse eid="MAT 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 7:27" />Ndonya paitonya, milweni ikamema, liyegha likulunga likalihukumula lighuta lila, na lyeni likaguwa, hinu ngindilu ghaki ikawela ngulu.”<verse eid="MAT 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uweso wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 7:28" />Yesu pakayomola kulonga milando hila, lipinga lya wandu likakangaswa na mavulo ghaki. <verse eid="MAT 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 7:29" />Kwaikiva mavulo ghaki yalandanili ng'ogha handa vila waivulile wavula wa laghililo, mweni awonekanili handa mundu mweni uweso.<verse eid="MAT 7:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MAT 8" />
  <para style="s">Yesu angumlamisa mundu mweni ukalawa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Maliku 1:40-45</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:12-16">Luka 5:12-16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 8:1" />Yesu paaghulukili mlitumbi, mapinga yatangala ya wandu yamkovekelili. <verse eid="MAT 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 8:2" />Hinu, akahika mundu mmonga mweni ukalawa, akahika na akamtundamila manung'una na akalonga, “Bambu, paupala unguwesa kunighulula!”<verse eid="MAT 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 8:3" />Yesu akamyavisa kwa liwoku lyaki na kulonga, “Ningupala! Ughululiki.” lipindi lilalila yula mundu akalama ukalawa ghaki. <verse eid="MAT 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 8:4" />Hinu Yesu akamlongela, “Mghalu hau ukotoho kumlongela mundu yeyosi, ila uyendi ukajilangihi kwa watambika, na kuwapegha litambiku lilaghililwi na Musa kuwahighilisila yiwa ulama.”<verse eid="MAT 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angumlamisa mtumikila wa mkulu wa watovangondo mlumi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 7:1-10">Luka 7:1-10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 8:5" />Yesu paawelili anguyingila kummbwani wa Kapelinaumu, mtovangondo mkulu mmonga akamyendela, akamluwa mtanga, <verse eid="MAT 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 8:6" />akilonga, “Bambu, mtumikila ghangu kawonja mukindanda ukaya, kana uvina wa kupola vikongonu na kangulwala nesu.”<verse eid="MAT 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 8:7" />Yesu akamlongela, “Niteyenda nimlamisi.”<verse eid="MAT 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 8:8" />Hayu mtovangondo mkulu akamlongela, “Bambu, nenga ningupaliwa ng'ogha wenga ukayingila ukaya kwa nenga kwa ukulu ghako, ila ulonge hela lilando, na mtumikila wa nenga atewela mkomu. <verse eid="MAT 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 8:9" />Kwaikiva, hata nenga ni mundu wa pahi gha ulongosi wa mlongosa ghangi, na niwela na watovangondo pahi ghangu. panimlongela mmonga, ‘Uyendi!’ na mweni kanguyenda, na ghangi, ‘Uhiki!’ mweni kanguhika na mtumikila wa nenga, ‘Ugholi kindu haki!’ na mweni kangughola.”<verse eid="MAT 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 8:10" />Yesu paayughanilili ghala, akalikangasa, akawalongela wandu weni kuwela wakimkovekela, “Chakaka ninguwalongela, mbata ng'ogha kulola mundu yoyosi ku Izilaili mweni ukwinila handa hau. <verse eid="MAT 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 8:11" />Hinu, ninguwalongela yiwa wandu watangala watehika kuhuma kula kuhumila lijuwa na kula kuhongela lijuwa, weni watelikala na kulyegha pamonga na Ibulahimu na Isaka na Yakobu ku Unkosi wa Sapanga. <verse eid="MAT 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 8:12" />Ila Waizilaeli watangala wenikupalwa kuwela kweni hau Unkosi wa kundumba watedangwa panji, mlwisa, haku kutewela na kililo na kuhyagha malinu.” <verse eid="MAT 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 8:13" />Hinu Yesu akamlongela yula mtovangondo mkulu mlumi, “Uyendi ukaya, na iweli handa ukwinilile.” Na mtumikila ghaki akawela mkomu lipindi lilalila.<verse eid="MAT 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anguwalamisa wandu watangala</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Maliku 1:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:38-41">Luka 4:38-41</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 8:14" />Yesu akahika ukaya kwa Petelo, na akamlola nyongo mkwahanu wa Petulo kawonja mkindanda, anguhemka nesu. <verse eid="MAT 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 8:15" />Hinu, Yesu akamyavisa yula nyongo liwoku, na ulwala ukamleka akatandamuka na akagholoka, na akatumbula kuwatelekela.<verse eid="MAT 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 8:16" />Palihongili lijuwa, wandu watangala wenikukolwa na mihoka, wakayeghwa kwa Yesu na mweni akawahumisa wala mihoka kwa kulongela weka, na kulamisa wavina wogha. <verse eid="MAT 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 8:17" />Hagha hyagha yagholekili ili litimile lila lilongeliwi na Isaya mwenikuwela mlota wa Sapanga, “Mweni baha atolili ulepelelu wa twenga, na kupapa mavina gha twenga.”<verse eid="MAT 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wala wangupalwa kumkovekela Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 9:57-62">Luka 9:57-62</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 8:18" />Yesu paalolili lipinga lya wandu limtindila, akawalongela wakovekela ghaki wahubhuki kumwambu gha lihiwa. <verse eid="MAT 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 8:19" />Mvula mmonga wa laghililo lya Musa akamyendela, Yesu akamlongela, “Mvula, nenga nitekukovikela kokosi kula unguyenda.”<verse eid="MAT 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 8:20" />Yesu akamyanga, “Mbweha wawela na mbangu, na mbongu wawela na fijaka, ila Mwana wa Mundu kahela mahali pakupumulilila.”<verse eid="MAT 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 8:21" />Hinu mkovekela ghangi paghati gha wavulwa ghaki akamlongela, “Bambu, unileki huti nikamsiki tati ghangu.”<verse eid="MAT 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 8:22" />IIa Yesu akamlongela, “Unikovikeli! Uwaleki wahovili wawasiki wandu ghao wahovile.”<verse eid="MAT 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anguliponga liyegha likalipa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Maliku 4:35-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Luka 8:22-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 8:23" />Yesu akakwela whatu mkulu, na wavulwa ghaki wakayenda pamonga na mweni. <verse eid="MAT 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 8:24" />Pawawelili wakiyenda bwitu liyegha likulunga likahumila mlihiwa, hata mawimbi ghakatumbula kugubika whatu. IIa Yesu awelili kawonja lughonu. <verse eid="MAT 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 8:25" />Wavulwa ghaki wakamyendela, wakamyimusa wakilonga, “Bambu, utulokoli, tunguyaghamila!”<verse eid="MAT 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 8:26" />Yesu akawalongela, “Mwenga wandu weni kukwinila mayaghani, kwa kyani mngutila?” Hinu, akayimuka, akalikalipila liyegha na lila lihiwa, likaponga nesu.<verse eid="MAT 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 8:27" />Wandu wakalikangasa, wakalonga, “Mundu hayu ni wa ghuli? Hata lihoka na mawimbi vingumyitikila!”<verse eid="MAT 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anguwalamisa wandu waivili weni kuwela na mahoka</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Maliku 5:1-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Luka 8:26-39</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 8:28" />Yesu pahikili mlima wa Wagelasi, kumwambu gha lihiwa galilaya, wandu waivili weni kukolwa na mahoka wakihuma kumamambi wakakongine na mweni. Wandu hagha wawelile wakalipa nesu mbaka ikawaghola amonga gha wandu watili kutyanga kunjila hila. <verse eid="MAT 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 8:29" />Hinu hagha wandu pawamlolile Yesu wakatumbula kutova lilovi, “Ungupala kyani kwa twenga, wenga Mwana wa Sapanga? Ghuli, uhika kutuhakili pambila gha lipindi livikilwi?”<verse eid="MAT 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 8:30" />Pabehi na mahala pala pawelili na lipinga likulunga lya mighuluwi likihungwa. <verse eid="MAT 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 8:31" />Hinu, wala mahoka wakamluwa Yesu, “Pautuhumisa hamu, hinu utuleki tuyingili kwa mighuluwi hila.”<verse eid="MAT 8:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 8:32" />Yesu akawalongela, “Myendi!” Hinu wakawahuka wandu wala, wakawayingila mighuluwi. Lipinga lyogha lya mighuluwi likahuluka mbaka kula kumghuluko mkali, likadubukila mlihiwa, hinu mighuluwi hyogha ikahova mmasi.<verse eid="MAT 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 8:33" />Ila wala wawelili wakiwahunga wala mighuluwi wakabhutukila mmbwani. Haku wakalonga habali zyogha na mighalu hila iwakolili wala wandu wawelili wakolwa na mihoka. <verse eid="MAT 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 8:34" />Hinu, wandu wogha kummbwani hula wakahuma, wakamyendela Yesu, na pawamlola, wakamluwa ahuki kumlima ghao.<verse eid="MAT 8:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MAT 9" />
  <para style="s">Yesu angumlamisa mundu mweni kupola</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Maliku 2:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Luka 5:17-26</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 9:1" />Yesu akayingila muwhatu, akahubhuka lihiwa Galilaya na kuhika kummbwani ghaki Kapelnaumu. <verse eid="MAT 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 9:2" />Lipindi lila lila wakamyeghela mundu mmonga mweni kupola higha, akiwela kawonjeswa mlihinda. Yesu paalolili kukwinila kwau, akamlongela yula mundu mweni kupola, “Ujipeghi moyu mwana ghangu, sambi syako silekeselwa.”<verse eid="MAT 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 9:3" />Wamonga wa wavula wa laghililo wakatumbula kulongelana, ghuli, “Mundu hayu angumlighu Sapanga ng'ogha?”<verse eid="MAT 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 9:4" />Ila Yesu amanyili mawachilo ghao, akalonga, “Kwakyani mnguwachila mahakata? <verse eid="MAT 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 9:5" />Ni kyani kivile kiyuyuhu nesu. Kulonga, ‘Ulekeselwa sambi syako,’ au kulonga, ‘ugholoki, utyangi?’ <verse eid="MAT 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 9:6" />Hinu, ningupala mmanyi yiwa Mwana wa Mundu kanauweso kumlima wogha wa kuwalekesela wandu sambi.” Na hinu akamlongela yula mundu mweni kupola, “Ugholoki, utoli lihinda lyako, uyendi ukaya ghako.”<verse eid="MAT 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 9:7" />Mundu yula akagholoka, akayenda ukaya ghaki. <verse eid="MAT 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 9:8" />Wandu wogha kulila lipinga pawalola ghala, wakalikangasa na kutila, wakamtundamila Sapanga mweni kuwapegha wandu uweso wa ndambu hila.<verse eid="MAT 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angumkema Matayu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Maliku 2:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Luka 5:27-32</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 9:9" />Yesu ahukili pala, na paawelili akiyenda zyaki, akamlola mundu mmonga akemilwi Matayu, katama kumahala wangutumila kukungula usulu. Hinu, Yesu akamlongela, “Unikovekeli.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 9:9">Mweni Matayu akagholoka, akamkovekela.<verse eid="MAT 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 9:10" />Yesu paawelili ukaya katama kulyegha mulyo, wakungula usulu watangala na weni sambi wakahika wakatama pamonga na mweni na wavulwa ghaki. <verse eid="MAT 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 9:11" />Mafalisayo pawayalola ghala, wakawalongela wavulwa ghaki, “Kwa kyani mvula wa mwenga angulyegha pamonga na wakungula usulu na weni sambi?”<verse eid="MAT 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 9:12" />Ila Yesu paayughanila ghala, akalonga, “Wandu wakomu wangupala ng'ogha mlamisa, ila wala weni kumpala mlamisa ni wala wavina. <verse eid="MAT 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 9:13" />Myendi mkajivuli hai milando ingumanisa nini, ‘Ningupala umaha, na ng'ogha hupo.’ nihika ng'ogha kuwakema wandu wa maha, ila weni sambi.”<verse eid="MAT 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wandu wangumkonya Yesu mghalu wa kuwopa mulyo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Maliku 2:18-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Luka 5:33-39</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 9:14" />Hinu wavulwa wa Yohana Mbatisa wakamyendela Yesu, wakamkonya, “Twenga na Mafalisayo tunguwopa lipindi litangala, kwa kyani wavulwa ghako wanguwopa ng'ogha?”<verse eid="MAT 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 9:15" />Yesu akawayanga, “Ghuli, wakemilwi kumhambu wangupalwa kulumbilila lipindi Bambu wa mhambu kapamonga na weni? Ila lipindi litehika pala bambu wa mhambu atehusiwa kwa weni, na baha ndiwa lipindi watewopa mulyo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 9:15">
    <figure style="fig" file="11 Unshrunk Patch.jpg" size="col" ref="9:17">Kinyakunyaku kunguu</figure> <verse eid="MAT 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 9:16" />Kwahela mundu kangusonela kinyakunyaku kya hyonu kunguu ihakala, kwaikiva kila kinyakunyaku kitelakatuka kuhuma kuhai nguu na kulakatuka kwa nguu hai kutewela kukulu nesu kupiti haku mtumbulo. <verse eid="MAT 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 9:17" />Kangi kwahela wandu wanguvika divai hyonu kumhaku wa ngosi uhakalili. Pawaghola nagha, mhaku hau utebaluka na divai hai iteyitika, na mhaku hau uteyalamika, ila wandu wanguvika divai hyonu mumhaku wa hyonu, na vyogha viivili divai na mhaku vitebaluka ng'ogha na divai iteyitika ng'ogha.<verse eid="MAT 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mhinja wa mkulu na nyongo mmonga wangulamiswa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Maliku 5:21-43</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Luka 8:40-56</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 9:18" />Hinu Yesu pawelili akilonga hagha, mkulu mmonga Myahudi akahika, akamtundamila na kulonga, “Mhinja ghangu kahova hinaa Bambu. Pepayi tuyende ukamvikili liwoko lyako na mweni atelama.”<verse eid="MAT 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 9:19" />Yesu akahuka pamonga na wavulwa ghaki, na mweni akamkovekela.<verse eid="MAT 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 9:20" />Lipindi lilalila nyongo mmonga, mvina wa ligholovela kwa lipindi lya machuva ikumi na ivili, akamkovekela Yesu kuhyetu, na akayavisa luviniku lya nguu ghaki. <verse eid="MAT 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 9:21" />Agholili nagha kwaikiva aliwachilili mmoyu ghaki, “Paniyavisa hela lihabiti lyaki nitelamiswa.”<verse eid="MAT 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 9:22" />Hinu, Yesu akaghalambuka akamlola, akamlongela, “Ujipeghi moyu biti ghangu! Ukwinila ghako ukulamisa.” Nyongo yula akawela mkomu lipindi lilalila.<verse eid="MAT 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 9:23" />Hinu Yesu akayingila ukaya kwa yula mkulu. Na paawalola walumbilila wakikuwa filimbi, <verse eid="MAT 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 9:24" />akalonga, “Mhuki baha! Mhinja hayu kahova ng'ogha kawonja hela.” Na weni wakamheka. <verse eid="MAT 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 9:25" />Hinu lipinga lya wandu palihumisilwi, Yesu akayingila mghati, akamkola yula mhinja liwoko, na mweni akayimuka. <verse eid="MAT 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 9:26" />Mghalu hula ukalandala nesu kumlima hula wogha.<verse eid="MAT 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anguwalamisa wangalikulola waivili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 9:27" />Yesu akahuka mahala pala, na paawelili anguyenda, wangali kulola waivili wakawela wakimkovekela kunu wakitova lilowi wakulonga, “Mwana wa Daudi, utuwoneli luhungu!”<verse eid="MAT 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 9:28" />Yesu pakayingila ukaya, wala wandu waivili wakamyendela, na mweni akawakonya, “Ghuli, mngunikwinila yiwa ninguwesa kuwagholela mghalu hau?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 9:28">Na weni wakamyanga “Hina, Bambu.”<verse eid="MAT 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 9:29" />Bahala Yesu akawayavisa mihu ghao, akalonga, “Na iweli nagha kwa mwenga handa kukwinila kwa mwenga.” <verse eid="MAT 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 9:30" />Na mihu ghao ikawoposolewa. Mweni Yesu akawavikila mkasu, “Mkotoho kumlongela mundu yeyosi mhalu hau.”<verse eid="MAT 9:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 9:31" />Ila weni wakahuka, wakatangasa habali zya Yesu kumlima hula wogha.<verse eid="MAT 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angumlamisa mundu kanguwesa ng'ogha kulongela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 9:32" />Wandu pawawelili wanguhuka, wamonga wakamyeghela Yesu mundu mmonga awelili kanguwesa ng'ogha kulongela na mwenikuwela na lihoka. <verse eid="MAT 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 9:33" />Ila bahala yula lihoka paahumisilwi, mundu yula mwenikuwela kanguwesa ng'ogha kulonga akatumbula kulonga kangi. Wandu wakalikangasa na kulonga, “Mghalu handa hau tuulola ng'ogha ku Izilaeli!”<verse eid="MAT 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 9:34" />Ila Mafalisayo wakawela wakilonga, “Anguwawinga mahoka kwa uwesa wa mkulu wa mahoka.”<verse eid="MAT 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anguwawonela wandu luhungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 9:35" />Yesu akatyangila mimbwani na vimbwani vyogha, akavula kumaghuta gha kukonganika Wayahudi akilongela Habali Maha gha Unkosi wa Sapanga, na kulamisa wavina wogha na ulepelelu wa ndambu wekaweka. <verse eid="MAT 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 9:36" />Hinu, paawalolili wandu, mapinga kwa mapinga, awawonilili luhungu kwaikiva wawelili wavina na wawelili wamanya ng'ogha kya kughola handa kondolu wenikuwela ng'ogha na mhungaji. <verse eid="MAT 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 9:37" />Pala akawalongela wavulwa ghaki, “Kuwela na mabeno matangala gha kuyayegha, ila waghola lihengu ni mayaghani. <verse eid="MAT 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 9:38" />Hinu mumluwi Bambu wa mabenu awayeghi waghola lihengu wabeni mabenu ghaki.”<verse eid="MAT 9:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MAT 10" />
  <para style="s">Yesu anguwalaghila wavulwa ghaki ikumi na ivili.</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Maliku 3:13-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Luka 6:12-16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 10:1" />Hinu Yesu akawakema wavulwa ghaki ikumi na ivili, akawapegha uweso wa kuwawinga mahoka na kulamisa mavina wekaweka. <verse eid="MAT 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 10:2" />Mahina gha wala wandumindumi ikumi na ivili ni hagha; wamtumbulo ni Simoni akemilwi Petelo na Andeleya mlongo ghaki, na Yakobu mwana wa Zebedayu na Yohanamlongo ghaki; <verse eid="MAT 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 10:3" />Filipu na Batulumayu na Tomaso na Matayu awelili mkungula usulu na Yakobu mwana wa Alifayu na Tadei; <verse eid="MAT 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 10:4" />Simoni mkola mlima wa kanani, na Yudasi Isikalioti yula amhyukili Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lihengu lya wandumindumi ikumi na ivili</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Maliku 6:7-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Luka 9:1-6</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 10:5" />Yesu akawalaghila wala wandu ikumi na ivili na kuwalongela nagha, “Mkotoho kuyenda kwa wandu Wayahudi ng'ogha, na kangi mkotoho kuyingila kummbwani wa Samaliya.” <verse eid="MAT 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 10:6" />Ila myendi kwa wandu wa Izilaili wayaghamilile handa kondolu. <verse eid="MAT 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 10:7" />Pamyenda mkatangasi nagha, “Unkosi wa Kundumba wa pabehi.” <verse eid="MAT 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 10:8" />Muwalamisi wavina, na muwahinduli wahovili, na muwaghululi wenikuwela na ukalawa, muwawingi mahoka. Mpeghwa yaghi hela, na mwenga mpeghi yaghi hela. <verse eid="MAT 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 10:9" />Mkotoho kutola zahabu na lidini lya feza na hata saba, <verse eid="MAT 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 10:10" />mkotoho kukola mhaku wa mwanja, hilahila likoti lya nyongesa, na hata hilatu, hata hyatu. Kwaikiva mghola lihengu angupalwa apeghwi hupo ghaki.<verse eid="MAT 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 10:11" />Pamuyingila kummbwani wowosi au kimbwani, mumuhakuli mundu mweni kupala kuwapokela, na mtami haku mbaka lipindi lya kuhuka. <verse eid="MAT 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 10:12" />Pamyingila ukaya muwajambusi nagha, “Sapanga awahighili mwenga.” <verse eid="MAT 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 10:13" />Na paikawela kuwela na wandu wamaha Sapanga atewahighila. Ila paikawela kwahela wandu wamaha Sapanga ateleka kuwahighila. <verse eid="MAT 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 10:14" />Handa mundu kuwapokela ng'ogha au kalema kuwayughanila, hinu pamuhuka kulighuta hali au mmbwani hau, myapundi malifu mmaghulu. <verse eid="MAT 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 10:15" />Chakaka ninguwalongela, lichuwa lya utoso mmbwani hau utepokela uhakili mkulunga kupiti yawakolile wandu wa mimbwani gha Sodoma na Gomola.<verse eid="MAT 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mahakilo yenikuhika</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 13:9-13">Maliku 13:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:12-17">Luka 21:12-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 10:16" />“Hinu, nenga ninguwayegha mwenga handa kondolu paghati gha wa ghalumhitu. Muweli na umanyi handa njoka na wanyali nyali handa ngunda.” <verse eid="MAT 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 10:17" />Mkali mihu na wandu, kwaikiva watewayegha mwenga kunjenga kaya na kuwatova hyatu kumighuta ghao gha kukonganila Wayahudi. <verse eid="MAT 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 10:18" />Mteyeghwa kuulongolo gha vilongosi na wankosi kwaikiva mngunikwinila nenga, kukamulwa kwa mwenga kutewela njila gha mwenga kuwalaongela habali zyangu hagha wankosi na wandu Wayahudi ng'ogha. <verse eid="MAT 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 10:19" />Hinu, pawawayegha mwenga kutoso, mkotoho kutila mtelonga kyani, kwaikiva mtepeghwa lya kulongela lipindi lila lila. <verse eid="MAT 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 10:20" />Kwaikiva ng'ogha mwenga mtelongela, ila Mpumulo wa Tati wa mwenga mwenikulongela mghati gha mwenga,<verse eid="MAT 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 10:21" />na mlongo atemhyuka mlongu ghaki akomwi, na tati hilahila ateghola nagha kwa mwana ghaki, na wana watewahyuka walela ghao na kuwaghola wahovi. <verse eid="MAT 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 10:22" />Wandu wogha watewapala ng'ogha mwenga kwaikiva gha kunikwinila nenga. Ila yula ategangamala mbaka mwihu, atekombolwa. <verse eid="MAT 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 10:23" />Pamgholelwa mahakata na wandu wa mmbwani mmonga, mtuwili kummbwani mghangi. Chakaka ninguwalongela, pambila gha kuyomola kutangasa kumimbwani hyogha gha Izilaili Mwana wa Mundu nitewela nihika kala kuwatanga.<verse eid="MAT 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 10:24" />“Mvulwa kanguwesa ng'ogha kuwela mkulunga kupiti mvula ghaki, hilahila na mtumikila kanguwesa ng'ogha kuwela mkulu kupiti Bambu ghaki.” <verse eid="MAT 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 10:25" />Hinu ingukwila mvulwa kuwela handa mvula ghaki, hila hila mtumikila aweli handa bambu ghaki. Paikawela nenga mkulu wa lighuta wangunikema, “Mkulu wa mahoka,” handa wanikema nenga nagha, ghuli, watewakema ng'ogha mwenga mahina mahakata nesu?<verse eid="MAT 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yula wa kutilwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 12:2-7">Luka 12:2-7</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 10:26" />“Hinu mkotoho kuwatila wandu hagha. Kwaikiva kwehela kyeni kulihigha kikasindwa kugubutulwa, wala kwahela kifisu kyeni kusindwa kumanyika.” <verse eid="MAT 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 10:27" />Lila ninguwalongela mkiwela weka yenu, mwenga mkalilongeli palwagha, na lila mnguliyoghanila likitangaswa kwa kupwepwa mwenga mlitangasi kwa lilowi. <verse eid="MAT 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 10:28" />Mkotoho kuwatila wala wenikukoma higha, ila wanguwesa ng'ogha kukoma upumulo. Mwenga mngupalwa kumtila Sapanga mwenikuwesa kukoma higha pamonga na upumulo hinu akatagha mpumulo kulyoto lya kujimika ng'ogha. <verse eid="MAT 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 10:29" />Mbalama waivili wanguwuswa kwa sendi imonga hela. Ila kwahela hata mmonga wa weni akaguwa pahi na Tati wa mwenga akasindwa kumanya. <verse eid="MAT 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 10:30" />Hata hwila kumutu gha mwenga Sapanga angumanya utangala ghaki. <verse eid="MAT 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 10:31" />Hinu mkotoho kutila kwaikiva mwenga ni wamaheli nesu kuulongolo gha Sapanga kupiti hagha mbalama watangala.<verse eid="MAT 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kumjumila na kumlema Kilisito</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 12:8-9">Luka 12:8-9</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 10:32" />“Ila mundu mweni kulonga kuulongolo gha wandu yiwa mweni ni mvulwa wa nenga, na nenga nitemlongela handa nahagha kuulongolo gha Tati ghangu mwenikuwela kundumba.” <verse eid="MAT 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 10:33" />Ila yeyosi mweni kunikanila kuulongolo gha wandu, na nenga nitemkanila kulongolo gha Tati ghangu mwenikuwela kundumba.<verse eid="MAT 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Niwayeghela ng'ogha kuponga bali lipanga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 12:51-53">Luka 12:51-53</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:26-27">14:26-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 10:34" />“Mkotoho kuliwachila yiwa nihika kuyegha kuponga mumlima wogha. Ila nihika ng'ogha kuyegha kuponga bali niyegha lipanga. <verse eid="MAT 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 10:35" />Kwaikiva nihika kuyegha makologhanyo paghati gha mwana na tati ghaki, paghati gha biti na nyongo ghaki, paghati gha mkamwana na nyongo mkwahanu ghaki, <verse eid="MAT 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 10:36" />Na wandu weni kukupala ng'ogha ni wandu wa ukaya ghako.<verse eid="MAT 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 10:37" />Yoyosi mweni kumpala tati au nyongo ghaki kupiti nenga hayu kanguwesa ng'ogha kuwela mvulwa ghangu, na hata yula mweni kumpala mwana au biti kupiti nenga hilahila kanguwesa ng'ogha kuwela mvulwa ghangu. <verse eid="MAT 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 10:38" />Mundu yula katola ng'ogha lipingika lyaki na kunikovikela, hayu kanguwesa ng'ogha kuwela mvulwa ghangu. <verse eid="MAT 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 10:39" />Yula mwenikupala kulamisa ukomu ghaki ateuyalamisa, ila yula ateyalamisa ukomu ghaki kwaikiva gha nenga, ateulola.<verse eid="MAT 10:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Watepokela hupo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 9:41">Maliku 9:41</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 10:40" />Mundu yeyosi mweni kuwajumila mwenga, hayu kanijumila nenga na yula angunijumila nenga kamjumila yula anilaghilili. <verse eid="MAT 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 10:41" />Mundu yeyosi angumpokela mlota wa Sapanga kwaikiva ni mlota, atepokela hupo hilahila kavikilwa mlota, na mundu kangumpokela mundu mwenikughola ghala angupala Sapanga atepeghwa hupo hilahila atepeghwa mundu yula mweni kughola ghala angupala Sapanga. <verse eid="MAT 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 10:42" />Mundu yeyosi paampegha hata kikombi kya masi mmonga wa hayu mnung'una kwaikiva ni mvulwa ghangu, hayu atepokela hupo.”<verse eid="MAT 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MAT 11" />
  <para style="s">Ujumbi kuhuma kwa Yohana Mbatisa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 7:18-35">Luka 7:18-35</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 11:1" />Yesu paayomolili kuwapegha malaghililo wala wavulwa ghaki ikumi na waivili, akahuka kula, akayenda kuvula na kutangasa kumimbwani gha Galilaya.<verse eid="MAT 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 11:2" />Yohana Mbatisa paawelili mlighuta lya wawopwa ahyoghanilili matendu yeni kugholwa na Kilisito. Hinu, Yohana akawalaghila wavulwa ghaki, <verse eid="MAT 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 11:3" />wakamkonya, “Ghuli, wenga ndiwa yula atehika, au tumlindili mundu ghangi?”<verse eid="MAT 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 11:4" />Yesu akawayanga, “Myendi mkamlongeli Yohanamighalu muiyughanila na kuilola. <verse eid="MAT 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 11:5" />Wandu wangali kulola wangulola, na walemafu wa maghulu wangutyanga, wenikuwela na ukalawa wangughululwa, majogu wanguyoghanila, wenikuhova wanguhinduliwa pamonga na wandu wenikuwela wakapuku wangulongelwa Habali Maha. <verse eid="MAT 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 11:6" />Kahighilwa mundu yula kahela holu gha kunijumila nenga.”<verse eid="MAT 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 11:7" />Hinu wala wajumbi wa Yohanapawawelile wanguyenda zyau, Yesu akatumbula kuyalongela mapinga gha wandu mighalu gha Yohana, “Myendili kulola kyani kula kuluvagha? ghuli, myendili kulola lunyahi lungutikanyika kula na haku kwa liyegha?” <verse eid="MAT 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 11:8" />Paikawela ng'ogha nagha? Ghuli, mundu mwenikuvala nguu zya maheli? Ninguwalongela wandu wenikuvala nguu zya maheli wangulikala kumaghuta gha kinkosi. <verse eid="MAT 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 11:9" />Hinu, myendili kulola kyani? Ghuli ni kumlola mlota wa Sapanga? Hina, ninguwalongela chakaka, myendili kumlola mundu mkulu nesu kupiti mlota. <verse eid="MAT 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 11:10" />Yohanandiwa yula kangulongelwa kumayandiku gha Sapangama yayandikilwi, “Uloli, nenga ningumyegha mjumbi wa nenga akulonguleli, mweni atekuyandalila njila ghako.” <verse eid="MAT 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 11:11" />Chakaka ninguwalongela paghati gha wana wogha wa wandu kahumila ng'ogha mkulu apiti Yohana Mbatisa. Hata nagha, yula mwenikuwela mnung'una nesu kuunkosi wa kundumba, kamkulu kupiti Yohana. <verse eid="MAT 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 11:12" />Kuhuma lipindi lya Yohana Mbatisa mbaka lelu hai, Unkosi wa kundumba ungulandala kwa makakala, na wala wenikuwela na makakala wanguyesa kuhakila watumikila wa Sapanga. <verse eid="MAT 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 11:13" />Kwaikiva pambila gha kuhika Yohana mavulo hyogha gha laghililo na walota wa Sapanga yalongelelili mighalu gha lipindi hali. <verse eid="MAT 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 11:14" />Na paikawela mnguwesa kujumila hali, hinu Yohanandiwa Eliya yula atehika. <verse eid="MAT 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 11:15" />Yula mweni mapulukilo na ahyoghanile!<verse eid="MAT 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 11:16" />“Hinaa nitekilandanisa kiwelekwa haki na kindu kyani? Ni handa wasongolo wawelili walikala paluvagha, wakilongelana kipinga kimonga kwa kipinga kighangi.” <verse eid="MAT 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 11:17" />“Tuwakuwila ngoma ila mhina ng'ogha! Tukayimba uyimbo wa kulumbilila mhika ng'ogha kulumbilila!” <verse eid="MAT 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 11:18" />Kwaikva Yohanaahikili, akawopa mulyo na hata kunywegha divai, na weni wakalonga, “Hayu kakolwa na lihoka.” <verse eid="MAT 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 11:19" />Mwana wa Mundu akahika, angulyegha na kunywegha, na weni wakalonga, “Mumloli hayu angupala kulyegha lyegha na mlowela, ghanja wa wakungula usulu na weni sambi! Hata nagha luhala lwa Sapanga lunguwoneka yiwa lwa maheli kupitila matendu ghaki.”<verse eid="MAT 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mimbwani gha wandu wakwinila ng'ogha</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 10:13-15">Luka 10:13-15</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 11:20" />Hinu Yesu akatumbula kuilonga mimbwani hila, pamonga na yiwa agholile makangaso matangala mula, ila wandu ghaki wapalile ng'ogha kuleka sambi. <verse eid="MAT 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 11:21" />“Mtepata mahakilo mwenga wandu wa kolazini! Mtepata mahakilo mwenga wandu wa Betisaida! Kwaikiva, makangaso yagholekili kwa mwenga yangaligholeka ku Tilo na Sidoni, wandu ghaki wangalivala kala nguu zya migunila na kupakala malifu kulangiha yiwa waleka sambi na kumuhuyila Sapanga lipindi litali. <verse eid="MAT 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 11:22" />Hata nagha, ninguwalongela lichuwa lya kutoswa, mwenga mtepeghwa mnyokolu mkulunga nesu kupiti wandu wa Tilo na Sidoni. <verse eid="MAT 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 11:23" />Hilahila mwenga wandu wa Kapelinaumu, mkotoho kuliwachila yiwa Sapanga atewayinula kula kundumba. Ila atewahulusa mbaka kulyoto lijimika ng'ogha! Kwaikiva, vila makangaso yagholekili kwa mwenga yangaligholeka kwa wandu wa Sodoma, wandu hagha wa Sodoma wangalikala mbaka lelo. <verse eid="MAT 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 11:24" />Ila ninguwalongela, lichuwa lya kulamula, mwenga mtepokela unyokolu mkulunga kupiti hula wa wandu wa Sodoma.”<verse eid="MAT 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mhiki kwa nenga mpumulili</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 10:21-22">Luka 10:21-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 11:25" />Lipindi lila Yesu ailongile, ningukushukwile wenga Tati, Bambu wa kundumba na mlima wogha, kwaikiva uwahigha weni luhala na weni kumanya mighalu hai, ukatugubutulila twenga weni kuwela na malangu mayaghani. <verse eid="MAT 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 11:26" />Hina, Tati, kwaikiva nagha ndiwa ikupalile.<verse eid="MAT 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 11:27" />“Tati ghangu kambegha vindu vyogha. kwahela mweni kummanya Mwana ila Tati, kangi kwahela mweni kummanya Tati ila Mwana, na yeyosi yula Mwana angupala kumgubutulila hayu atemmanya Tati.<verse eid="MAT 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 11:28" />Mhiki kwa nenga mwenga wogha weni kutoka kwa kupapa mihigo mitopa, na nenga nitewaghola mpumulili <verse eid="MAT 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 11:29" />Mjumili kulongoswa na nenga handa vila ng'ombi mlumi paanguwopilwa nila lipindi lya kutukutula, na mwenga mhakuli mavulo ghangu kwaikiva nenga na myalinyali na mnyenyekela. Kwa nagha mutepumlila. <verse eid="MAT 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 11:30" />Hai itewela yuyughu kwa mwenga pamulongoswa na nenga, kwaikiva mavulo ghangu yakamala ng'ogha.” <figure style="fig" file="13 Yoke.jpg" size="col" ref="11:30">Ng'ombi wavili wawopwa mibiki gha kutukutula</figure><verse eid="MAT 11:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MAT 12" />
  <para style="s">Bambu wa lichuwa lya Kupumulila</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Maliku 2:23-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Luka 6:1-5</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 12:1" />Kulipindi hali, Yesu awelili angutyanga kumitawa gha nganu lichuwa lya kupumulila. Hinu wavulwa ghaki wakakolwa na njala, wakatumbula kubena mihoji gha nganu, wakalyegha mbunji zyaki. <verse eid="MAT 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 12:2" />Mafalisayo pawalolili yala, wakamlongela Yesu, “Uloli, wavulwa ghako wangughola mghalu weni kukaniswa kugholwa Lichuwa lya Kupumulila.”<verse eid="MAT 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 12:3" />Yesu akawayanga, “Ghuli, msomili ng'ogha vila aigholile Daudi pamonga na wayaki lipindi pawawelili na njala? <verse eid="MAT 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 12:4" />Mweni ayingilili kulighuta lya Sapanga akalyegha hila mibumunda iyandalililwi kwaikiva gha lihengu lya Sapanga. Kangi akawapegha na wayaki hila mibumunda. Ila ni kihyetu na laghililo lya Musa hila apeghilwi na Sapanga yiwa yula angupalwa kulyegha ni mtambika weka. <verse eid="MAT 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 12:5" />Au ghuli, msoma ng'ogha kuhitabu kya laghililo lya Musa yiwa kila lipindi lya lichuwa lya kupumulila watambika wangutenyula laghililo lya Musa mlighuta, ila wanguwachilwa ng'ogha yiwa waghola uhakata? <verse eid="MAT 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 12:6" />Hinu, ninguwalongela lipala yiwa yula avili mkulu kupiti lighuta lya Sapanga kabaha. <verse eid="MAT 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 12:7" />Ghuli, mwenga mmanya ng'ogha milando hai ingumaanisa niki? ‘Ningupala luhungu na ng'ogha litambiku,’ handa mngalimanya mngaliwalamula ng'ogha wandu wenikuwela ng'ogha na uhakata. <verse eid="MAT 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 12:8" />kwaikiva Mwana wa Mundu ni Bambu wa lichuwa lya kupumulila.”<verse eid="MAT 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mundu mweni liwoku lipola</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Maliku 3:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Luka 6:6-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 12:9" />Yesu akahuka pala, akayingila mlighuta lyau lya kukonganikana Wayahudi. <verse eid="MAT 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 12:10" />Mula kukawela na mundu mmonga mweni liwoku lipola. Hinu, amonga gha Mafalisayo wakamkonya Yesu, “Ghuli, ni maha kumlamisa mundu lichuwa lya kupumulila?” Wamkonyili nagha wapati njila gha kumsitaki.<verse eid="MAT 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 12:11" />Yesu akawayanga, “Tulongi mmonga wa mwenga kawela na kondolu ghaki na hayu kadudukila mlyowu; ghuli, atemkola ng'ogha na kumlopola akamuhumisa panji Lichuwa lya Kupumulila? <verse eid="MAT 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 12:12" />Kwa hinaa, yula ni kondolu ila mundu ni wa maha nesu kupiti kondolu, Hinu ni maha kughola kindu maheli lipindi lya kupumulila.” <verse eid="MAT 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 12:13" />Ndiwa akamlongela yula mundu, “Ulangihi liwoku lyako.” Akalangiha na lyeni likalama likawela likomu handa lya ipili.<verse eid="MAT 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 12:14" />Ila Mafalisayo wakahuma panji, wakalongelana vila watemyalamisa Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mtumikila ahaghulililwi na Sapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 12:15" />Yesu akamanya yiwa Mafalisayo wawelili wanguyandala ndambu gha kumkoma, akahuka mahala pala. Wandu watangala wakamkovekela, akawalamisa wavina wogha, <verse eid="MAT 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 12:16" />kunu akiwakanisa wakotoho kuwalongela wandu yiwa mweni ni ghani, <verse eid="MAT 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 12:17" />ili yala alongili Sapanga kwa njila gha mlota Isaya yagholeki, <verse eid="MAT 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 12:18" />“Uloli mtumikila wa nenga nimhaghulili, mpalwa ghangu mwenikunighola nihekileli mmoyu. Nitevika mpumulo ghangu kunani gha mweni, na mweni atetangasa ghala ningupala wandu wagholi kumlima wogha.” <verse eid="MAT 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 12:19" />Mweni atewela ng'ogha na utatala wala kutova lilowi, na hata lilowi lyaki liteyoghanilwa ng'ogha mnjila. <verse eid="MAT 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 12:20" />Lidengi lipundangilwi atedumula ng'ogha, wala utambi unguhumisa lyosi utejimika ng'ogha, mbaka pala paateghola utoso gha ghala yenikupalwa yagholeki. <verse eid="MAT 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 12:21" />Kupitila mweni wandu wa milima hyogha watewela na litumaini nayu.<verse eid="MAT 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Mkulu wa Mahoka</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 3:20-30">Maliku 3:20-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Luka 11:14-23</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 12:22" />Hinu pala wandu wakamyeghela Yesu mundu mmonga angalikulola na awelili angali kulonga kwaikiva akolilwi na lihoka.Yesu akamlamisa na mweni akawesa kulonga na kulola. <verse eid="MAT 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 12:23" />Lipinga lyogha lya wandu walikangasili likalonga, “Ghuli, hayu Mwana wa Daudi ng'ogha?”<verse eid="MAT 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 12:24" />Ila Mafalisayo pawayughanila hagha, wakalonga, “Mundu hayu anguwahumisa mahoka kwa uweso wa Mkulu wa mahoka.”<verse eid="MAT 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 12:25" />Yesu amanyile kila wawelile wangukiwachila, akawalongela, “Unkosi wowosi hula weni kupaghanyika kumapanga maivili yeni kungingamana, utewesa ng'ogha kuyendelela, na mmbwani wowosi au walongo wowosi wapaghanyikili mapinga mapinga yeni kungingamana, wateguwa.” <verse eid="MAT 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 12:26" />Paikawela Lihoka lingumvinga Lihoka, hali lingulingingama lyeni. Hinu, unkosi ghaki uteyendelela ng'ogha. <verse eid="MAT 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 12:27" />Mwenga mngulonga yiwa nenga ninguwawinga mahoka kwa uweso wa Mkulu wa mahoka, ghuli, wavulwa wa mwenga wanguwawinga kwa uweso wa ghani? Kwaikiva gha nagha weni ndiwa watelonga yiwa mvile na mahakata au ng'ogha. <verse eid="MAT 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 12:28" />Ila paikawela nenga ninguwawinga mahoka kwa likakala lya Mpumulo wa Sapanga, hinu mmanyi yiwa Unkosi wa Sapanga uhika kala kwa mwenga.<verse eid="MAT 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 12:29" />Kangi mundu anguwesa ghuli kuyingila kulighuta lya mundu mweni makakala na kumpokola hindu ghaki, bila kutumbula huti kumuwopa yula mundu mweni makakala? Na baha ndiwa atewesa kumpokola hindu ghaki.<verse eid="MAT 12:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 12:30" />“Yeyosi mweni kuwela ng'ogha mbandi ghangu anguningingama, na yeyosi mweni kukungula ng'ogha na nenga kanguyandasa wandu.” <verse eid="MAT 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 12:31" />Kwaikiva gha nagha, ninguwalongela, kila uhakata ikiva wa kughola au kulonga wandu watelekeselwa ila yula atemlighu Mpumulo wa Sapanga atelekeselwa ng'ogha. <verse eid="MAT 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 12:32" />Sapanga atewalekesela wala watelongela milando mihakata kihyetu na nenga, Mwana wa Mundu. Ila Sapanga atewalekesela ng'ogha wandu wenikulongela milando mihakata kihyetu na Mpumulo wa Sapanga hinaa na hata haku kuulongolo.<verse eid="MAT 12:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Libiki na matungula ghaki</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 6:43-45">Luka 6:43-45</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 12:33" />Hinu Yesu akalongela, “Mngupalwa kughola mibiki iweli maha ili mpokeli matungula gha maha. Paikawela muwela na mibiki gha maha ng'ogha, mtetungula matungula gha maha ng'ogha. Mteimanya mibiki yiwa gha ghuli kukovekelana na matungula yahumila kulibiki lila.” <verse eid="MAT 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 12:34" />Mwenga kiwelekwa kya njoka! Kwa kyani mnguwesa kulonga mighalu gha maha ikiva mwenga ni waghola sambi? Kwaikiva mundu angulonga kukovekelana ghala yamema kumoyu ghaki. <verse eid="MAT 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 12:35" />Mundu wa maha angulongela milando gha maha kuhuma kumoyu ghaki gha maha, na mundu muhakata angulongela mighalu mihakata inguhuma kumoyu ghaki.<verse eid="MAT 12:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 12:36" />“Hinu, ninguwalongela, lichuwa lya kuutoso wandu watepalwa wayangi kila milando mihakata wailongelili. <verse eid="MAT 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 12:37" />Kwaikiva kwa milando ghako utewoneka yiwa uwela ng'ogha na mahakata kuulongolo gha Sapanga, na kwa milando ghako utetoswa.”<verse eid="MAT 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wangupala kilangihi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 8:11-12">Maliku 8:11-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:29-32">Luka 11:29-32</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 12:38" />Hinu wamonga wa wavula wa laghililo na Mafalisayo wakamlongela Yesu, “Mvula, tungupala kulola kilangihi kuhuma kwa wenga.”<verse eid="MAT 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 12:39" />Hinu Yesu akawayanga, “Kiwelekwa kihakata kyeni kuwela ng'ogha na umaha!” Mngupala kilangihi, mtepokela ng'ogha kilangihi badili ghaki kila kilangihi kya Yona mwenikuwela mlota. <verse eid="MAT 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 12:40" />Vila Yona kalikala machuwa itatu mumtima wa homba mkulu, ndiwa na mweni Mwana wa Mundu atelikala mghati mwa mlima machuwa itatu pamuhi na uhiku. <verse eid="MAT 12:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 12:41" />Wandu wa Ninawi wategholoka lipindi lya utoso naweni watekitosa kiwelekwa haki. Kwaikiva Waninawi walekili mahakata na kumuhuyila Sapanga kwaikiva wayoghanilili matangaso gha Yona, na mlole baha pavile na mkulu apiti Yona. <verse eid="MAT 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 12:42" />Malikia wa kusini atehumila lipindi kiwelekwa haki kingutoswa, na mweni atekilongela yiwa kiwela na mahakata. Kwaikiva mweni atyangili kuhuma kutali, akahika kuyughanila milando gha maha gha Selemani, na baha pawela na mkulu kupiti Selemani!<verse eid="MAT 12:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lihoka pawamuhuyila mundu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 11:24-26">Luka 11:24-26</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 12:43" />“Lihoka palihumiswa kuhuma kwa mundu, lingutindila tindila mluvagha likihakula mahala pakupumulilila ila anguwesa akasindwa kulola mahala, <verse eid="MAT 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 12:44" />hinu anguilongela, ‘Nitehuya ukaya kwa nenga kula nihukili.’ Ila panihuya na kupalola kulikala lipala, papyahililwa na kuyandalwa maha. <verse eid="MAT 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 12:45" />Hinu linguyenda kuwatola mahoka waghangi isaba, wahakata kupiti mweni, na wogha wanguhika na kumyingila hayu mundu. Na mundu hayu hinaa anguwela mhakata nesu kupiti vila kawela dahile. Ndiwa itewela kwa wandu hagha wahakata.”<verse eid="MAT 12:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nyongo na walongu wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Maliku 3:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Luka 8:19-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 12:46" />Yesu paawelili akali angulongela na lipinga lya wandu, nyongo ghaki na walongo ghaki wagholokili panji wakipala kulongela na mweni. <verse eid="MAT 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 12:47" />Hinu, mundu mmonga akayenda na kumlongela, “Lola, nyongo ghako na walongo ghako wangukulindila panji, wangupala kulongela na wenga.”<verse eid="MAT 12:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 12:48" />Ila Yesu akamkonya mundu yula, “Ghuli, nyongo ghangu ni ghani? Na walongo ghangu ni wakinaghani?” <verse eid="MAT 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 12:49" />Hinu akayinula liwoku lyaki upandi wa wavulwa ghaki, akalonga, “Hagha ndiwa nyongo ghangu na walongo ghangu! <verse eid="MAT 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 12:50" />Kwaikiva yeyosi angughola vila angupala Tati ghangu wa kundumba, hayu ndiwa mhaja ghangu, mhacha ghangu na nyongo ghangu.”<verse eid="MAT 12:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MAT 13" />
  <para style="s">Mlandano wa mtukutula</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Maliku 4:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-8">Luka 8:4-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 13:1" />Lichuwa lilalila, Yesu akahuka kulila lighuta, akayenda na kutama mmbali gha lihiwa Galilaya. <verse eid="MAT 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 13:2" />Lipinga likulunga lya wandu likalikungula kumtindila, hata ikamghola ayingili na kutama muwhatu. Kunu wandu wogha wakigholoka mmbali gha lihiwa. <verse eid="MAT 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 13:3" />Ndiwa Yesu akawalongela milando itangala kwa milandano, akilonga,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 13:3">“Mkulila ahukili kuyenda kukulila mbeyu zyaki. <verse eid="MAT 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 13:4" />Paawelili akikulila mbeyu kulitawa, mbeyu zighangi ziguwili mnjila, na wambongu wakahika wakazilyegha. <verse eid="MAT 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 13:5" />Zighangi ziguwili kumaganga pala pawela ng'ogha na lutupi lutangala. Zikawoneka kumela kwa kuloposela kwaikiva kuwelili ng'ogha na utali mkulunga wa lutupi kuyenda pahi. <verse eid="MAT 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 13:6" />Lijuwa palihomolili zikalungula, na kwaikiva ziwelili ng'ogha na mikigha mitali zikahova. <verse eid="MAT 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 13:7" />Zimonga zikamela na mibiki gha mihomi, na yeni mihomi ikakula na kuitindila. <verse eid="MAT 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 13:8" />Na zimonga ziguwili mmuhanga wamaha, zimelili, na zikalela zimonga mbunji imia, na waghangi mbunji isitini na zimonga mbunji iselasini.”<verse eid="MAT 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 13:9" />Hinu Yesu akawalongela, “Mweni mapulukilo gha kuhyoghanilila na ahyoghanili!”<verse eid="MAT 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuvula kwa milandano</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Maliku 4:10-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:9-10">Luka 8:9-10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 13:10" />Wavulwa ghaki wakamyendela, wakamkonya, “Kwakyani ungulonga na wandu kwa milandano?”<verse eid="MAT 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 13:11" />Yesu akawayanga, “Sapanga kawawesesa mwenga mmanyi ghala gha mkifisu ku Unkosi ghaki, ila weni wapeghwa ng'ogha uweso wa kuyamanya hagha hyogha.” <verse eid="MAT 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 13:12" />Kwaikiva, yula mwenikuwela na hindu atepokela na kuyongeselwa, ila yula mwenikuwela ng'ogha na hindu, hata kila akikola atepokolwa. <verse eid="MAT 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 13:13" />Ningulongela na weni kwa milandano, kwaikiva wangulola ghala ningughola ila wangujighola wangulola ng'ogha, na wanguyughanila ghala ninguvula ila wangumanya ng'ogha. <verse eid="MAT 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 13:14" />Kwa weni yatimila kala yala ayalongile mlota wa Sapanga Isaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:14">“Kuhyoghanila mtehyoghanila, ila mtemanya ng'ogha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:14">kangi kulola mtelola, ila mtemanya ng'ogha.”<verse eid="MAT 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 13:15" />Kwaikiva mioyu gha wandu hagha iwela mitopa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">wanguhyoghanila ng'ogha kwa mapulukilo ghao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">na wagubika mihu ghao.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">Ili wakotoho kulola kwa mihu ghao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">wakahyoghanila kwa mapulukilo ghao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">wakamanya kwa mioyu ghao, wakamhyukila Sapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">“Na mweni kawalamisa.”<verse eid="MAT 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 13:16" />“Ila mwenga, mhekeleli kwaikiva Sapanga kawatanga mwenga mloli. Mweni kawatanga mwenga mhyoghanili na kumanya ujumbi ghaki.” <verse eid="MAT 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 13:17" />Chakaka ninguwalongela, walota wa Sapanga na wandu watangala wa maha wapalili kulola hagha mnguyalola, ila wayalola ng'ogha na kuhyoghanila yala mnguyayoghanila ila wayoghanila ng'ogha.<verse eid="MAT 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angulongelela mlandano wa mtukutula</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Maliku 4:13-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:11-15">Luka 8:11-15</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 13:18" />“Myughanili mahimulilo gha yula ayendili kukulila mbeyu yiwa yangumaanisa niki. <verse eid="MAT 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 13:19" />Mundu yeyosi paahyoghanila lilando lya Unkosi wa Sapanga na akasindwa kumanya. Ni handa zila mbeyu ziguwili mnjila, yula mhakata kanguhika na kutola kila kivikilwi mmoyu ghaki. <verse eid="MAT 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 13:20" />Mbeyu hila yenikukulilwa mmaganga ni mlandano wa mundu anguhyoghanila lilando lila na bwitu akalipokela kwa kiheku. <verse eid="MAT 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 13:21" />Ila kwaikiva kahela mikegha mitali mghati mwaki, lingulikala kwa lipindi lihupi hela. Lipindi papahumila lung'ai au maghaso kwaikiva gha lilando hali, bwitu angutenyuka moyu. <verse eid="MAT 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 13:22" />Hila mbeyu iguwili paghati gha libiki lya mihomi, ni mlandano wa yula mundu anguhyoghanila lilando, ila holu gha mlima wogha hau na hindu ghaki hyogha kutindila lilando lila, na mweni angulela ng'ogha matungula. <verse eid="MAT 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 13:23" />Hila mbeyu ikulililwi ku mhanga wa maha ni mlandano wa mundu yula anguhyoghanila lilando lila na kulimanya, na mweni angulela matungula, imonga imia, ghangi isitini na ghangi iselasini.”<verse eid="MAT 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mlandano wa misapi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 13:24" />Yesu akawalongela mlandano ghangi, “Unkosi wa kundumba ungulandana na mundu akulili mbeyu maha kukitawa kyaki. <verse eid="MAT 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 13:25" />Ila wandu pawawonja, mhakata ghaki akahika, akakulila pungapunga paghati gha mpunga, na kuhuka. <verse eid="MAT 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 13:26" />Hinu mpunga paimela na kutumbula kuyalula, na misapi ikatumbula kuloleka . <verse eid="MAT 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 13:27" />Watumikila wa yula mweni kitawa wakamyendela, wakamlongela, ‘Mkulu tukulili mbeyu maha kukitawa kyaku, ghuli pungapunga ihumila kugha?’ <verse eid="MAT 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 13:28" />Mweni akawayanga, ‘Mhakata ndiwa agholile nagha’ Hinu watumikila ghaki wakamkonya, ‘Ghuli, ungupala tuyendi tukayatupuli?’ <verse eid="MAT 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 13:29" />Ila mweni akalongela, ‘Mkotoho kuyatupula, kwaikiva lipindi pamtupula pungapunga mnguwesa kutupula na mpunga pamonga. <verse eid="MAT 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 13:30" />Mvileki vikuli pamonga mbaka lipindi lya mabenu. Hinu lipindi hali nitewalongela wandu wa kubena. Mtumbuli kukungula pungapunga na mviki malundila ili yanyanywi lyoto. Ila mpunga ukungulwi na mkaviki kungoku ghangu.’”<verse eid="MAT 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mlandano wa mbeyu ikemwa haladali</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Maliku 4:30-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18-19">Luka 13:18-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 13:31" />Yesu akawalongela mlandano ghangi, “Unkosi wa kundumba ungulandana na mbeyu gha haladali yenikutolwa na mundu mmonga na akayenda kukulila kulitawa lyaki. <verse eid="MAT 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 13:32" />Yeni ni isokombi kupiti mbeyu zyogha, ila paimela kala inguwela ngulunga kupiti hila imelili hyogha. Na kangi ingukula na kuwela libiki. Hata mbongu wa kunani wanguhika na kuchenga vijaka kumiputila ghaki.”<verse eid="MAT 13:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mlandano wa simika</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 13:20-21">Luka 13:20-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 13:33" />Yesu akawalongela mlandano ghangi, “Unkosi wa kundumba ungulandana na simika aitolili nyongo mmonga, akaihanganya na ukowa wa nganu midebi miivili na mayaghani, na yeni simika ikaghola ukowa wogha ututumi.”<verse eid="MAT 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lukasini lya Yesu kutumila milandano</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 4:33-34">Maliku 4:33-34</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 13:34" />Yesu awalongelili wandu hagha hyogha kwa milandano. Kawalongela ng'ogha kindu chochosi kwa kuleka kutumila mlandano. <verse eid="MAT 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 13:35" />Ili lilando lilongilwi na mlota wa Sapanga litimili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:35">“Nitelonga na weni kwa milandano,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:35">nitevivika lipala vyogha vihighilwi kuhuma kulumbwa kwa mlima wogha.”<verse eid="MAT 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angulongelelela lipala mlandano wa mapungapunga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 13:36" />Hinu Yesu akawataula wala wandu, akayenda kuukaya kuyingila kulighuta awelili angulikala. Wavulwa ghaki wakamuyendela, wakamlongela, “Utulongeli ingumaanisa niki hula mlandano wa mipungapunga kulitawa.”<verse eid="MAT 13:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 13:37" />Yesu akawalongela, “Mtukutula wa zila mbeyu zya maheli ni Mwana wa Mundu.” <verse eid="MAT 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 13:38" />Lila litawa ni mlima wogha. Zila mbeyu zya maheli ni wandu wala wenikumyitikila Sapanga. Ila yala mapungapunga ni wandu wenikumyitikila ng'ogha Sapanga. <verse eid="MAT 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 13:39" />Mhakata mwenikukulila hila mipungapunga ni lihoka. Mabeno ni mwihu wa lipindi, na wandu wa kubena ni watumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga. <verse eid="MAT 13:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 13:40" />Mapungapunga vila yangukungulwa na kunyanywa lyoto, ndiwa itewela kumwihu gha lipindi. <verse eid="MAT 13:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 13:41" />Mwana wa Mundu atewalaghila watumikila ghaki wa kundumba kwa Sapanga na weni watekungula kuhuma kuunkosi ghaki, kila kindu kyeni kuyambusa sambi na waghola mahakata wogha, <verse eid="MAT 13:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 13:42" />hagha watumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga watewatagha kutanuli lya lyoto, na kula watelila na kuhyagha malinu kwaikiva gha kutama. <verse eid="MAT 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 13:43" />Ndiwa, wala wa maha wateng'ala handa lijuwa kuunkosi wa Tati ghao. Mweni mapulukilo gha kuyoghanilila na ahyoghanile!<verse eid="MAT 13:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mlandano wa unaisa uhighilwi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 13:44" />“Unkosi wa kundumba ungulandana na unaisa uhighilwi mkitawa. Mundu mmonga pakaulola, akauhigha. Kangi akahekelela nesu na akalamula kuyenda kuwusa vyogha vya ukaya ghaki, na akalihemela litawa lila.”<verse eid="MAT 13:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mlandano wa shanga zyeni kukemwa lulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 13:45" />“Kangi, unkosi wa kundumba ungulandana na mghola biasala mmonga mweni kuhaka lulu ghamaheli.” <verse eid="MAT 13:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 13:46" />Paapatili lulu imonga yeni mapesa yatangala, akayenda, akawusa vyogha vila kawela navyu, akahemela lulu hila.<verse eid="MAT 13:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mlandano wa wafu wa kuwopolela homba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 13:47" />“Hilahila, unkosi wa kundumba ungulandana na wafu utaghilwi mlihiwa na wawopola, na weni ukawomela homba wekaweka. <verse eid="MAT 13:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 13:48" />Paumemili, wandu wakaukukula kumuhanga, wakatama, wakahaghula homba wa maha wakawavika mghati gha vibeja ghao, na wala wa maha ng'ogha wakawatagha. <verse eid="MAT 13:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 13:49" />Ndiwa itewela kumwihu wa lipindi, watumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga watehumila, watewalekanisa wandu wahakata na wandu wamaha, <verse eid="MAT 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 13:50" />Watumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga, watewatagha wala wahakata kulitanuli lya lyoto. Kula watalila na kuhyagha malinu.”<verse eid="MAT 13:50" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngoko lwa hyonu na wadahili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 13:51" />Yesu akawakonya, “Ghuli, munguyamanya hagha hyogha?” wakamyanga, “Hina.”<verse eid="MAT 13:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 13:52" />Na mweni akawalongela, “Hinu, kila mvula wa laghililo lya Sapanga ampeghili Musa mwenikuwela mvulwa wa Unkosi wa Kundumba angulandana na mundu mweni ngoko akahumisa mghati ghaki hindu hyonu na hindu gha dahile.”<verse eid="MAT 13:52" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu wangumkanila haku Nasaleti</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Maliku 6:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Luka 4:16-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 13:53" />Yesu paayomulili kulonga milandano hila akahuka mahala pala, <verse eid="MAT 13:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 13:54" />akayenda ukaya ghaki, akawavula wandu kulighuta lya kukonganika Wayahudi hata wakalikangasa, wakalonga, “Hayu apatili kugha malangu hagha yatangala na uwesu hau wa kughola makangasu? <verse eid="MAT 13:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 13:55" />Ghuli, hayu ng'ogha yula mwana wa mhongola mibau? Ghuli, nyongo ghaki ng'ogha yula angukemwa Maria, na walongo ghaki ng'ogha wala kina Yakobu,Yusufu, Simoni na Yudasi? <verse eid="MAT 13:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 13:56" />Ghuli, wahaja ghaki, wabaha ng'ogha wakilikala na twenga? Hinu, apatili kugha hagha hyogha?” <verse eid="MAT 13:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 13:57" />Hinu, wakamkanila. Ila Yesu akawalongela, “Mlota wa Sapanga anguwesa ng'ogha kutundamilwa kumlima ghaki, ila mahala ghangi anguwesa kutundamilwa!” <verse eid="MAT 13:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 13:58" />Hinu mweni kaghola ng'ogha makangaso yatangala kula kwaikiva wandu wa kula wamkwinilili ng'ogha.<verse eid="MAT 13:58" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MAT 14" />
  <para style="s">Kihu kya Yohanambatisa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Maliku 6:14-29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Luka 9:7-9</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 14:1" />Lipindi lila, nkosi Helodi ahyoghanilile habali zya Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 14:2" />Hinu, akawalongela wavulwa ghaki, “Mundu hayu ni Yohana Mbatisa, kahinduka kuhuma kwa wahovili, ndiwa kwaikiva kana makakala gha kughola mighalu gha kukangasa.”<verse eid="MAT 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 14:3" />Helodi ndiwa awelili kamkamula Yohana, akamuwopa minyololu na kumvika mulighuta lya wawopwa, kwaikiva gha Helodia mdala wa Filipo, mwenikuwela mlongo ghaki. <verse eid="MAT 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 14:4" />Kwaikiva Yohanaawelili kamlongela Helodi, “Maha ng'ogha kwa wenga kulikala na hayu mdala!” <verse eid="MAT 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 14:5" />Helodi apalili kumkoma Yohana, ila awatilili wandu kwaikiva kwa weni Yohanaawelili mlota ghao.<verse eid="MAT 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 14:6" />Lichuwa limonga kumhambu wa kukumbwiki kuwelekwa kwaki Helodi, biti wa Helodia ahinili kuulongolo gha wandu. Mbaka Helodi akahekelela, <verse eid="MAT 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 14:7" />hata akalaghila kwa kulapa kumpegha hayu msikana chochosi atekipala.<verse eid="MAT 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 14:8" />Kunu biti akiwela kasoselwa na nyongo ghaki, akalonga, “Nipatili mutu wa Yohanamuluselu.”<verse eid="MAT 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 14:9" />Nkosi akakolwa na lusungu nesu, ila kwa kila kilapo kyaki na kwaikiva gha wala wahenja pala kumuhambu, akalaghila apeghwi. <verse eid="MAT 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 14:10" />Hinu, Helodi akamlaghila mundu kulighuta lya wawopwa ahyengi mutu Yohana. <verse eid="MAT 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 14:11" />Mutu kya Yohanaukayeghwa muluselu, wakampegha yula msikana, na mweni akamyeghela nyongo ghaki. <verse eid="MAT 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 14:12" />Wavulwa wa Yohanawakahika wakatola higha ghaki, wakasika. Hinu wakayenda kumlongela Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anguwapegha mulyo wandu ielufu itano</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Maliku 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luka 9:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Yohana 6:1-14</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 14:13" />Yesu paahyoghanilili ghala yamkolile Yohana mbatisa, akahuka mahala pala kwa kutumila whatu, akayenda mahala penikuwela ng'ogha na wandu ili aweli weka yaki. Ila wandu wapatili habali, wakamkovikela kwa maghulu kuhuma kumimbwani. <verse eid="MAT 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 14:14" />Hinu Yesu paahulukili mmbali gha bahali akalola lipinga likulunga lya wandu, akawawonela luhungu na akawalamisa mavina ghao.<verse eid="MAT 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 14:15" />Paihikili lumihi, wavulwa ghaki wakamuhikila na kumlongela, “Haku kwahela wandu wenikulikala haku, na masaa yahonga kala, uwatauli wandu hagha wayendi kuvimbwani ili wakajihemileli mulyo.”<verse eid="MAT 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 14:16" />Yesu akawalongela, “Maha ng'ogha wayendi, muwapeghi mwenga mulyo.”<verse eid="MAT 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 14:17" />Ila weni wakamlongela, “Tuwela na mibumunda itanu na homba waivili hela.”<verse eid="MAT 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 14:18" />Yesu akawalongela, “Mniyegheli haku.” <verse eid="MAT 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 14:19" />Akawalaghila wandu watami pahi mmanyahi. Hinu Yesu akaitola hila mibumunda miitanu na wala homba waivili, akayinula mihu ghaki kunani kundumba, akahighila, akametula hila mibumunda, na wavulwa ghaki wakawapegha wala wandu. <verse eid="MAT 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 14:20" />Wandu wogha wakalyegha, wakayukuta. Hinu wavulwa wakakungula vihighalili, wakamemesa vibeja ikumi na ivili. <verse eid="MAT 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 14:21" />Wandu wogha walyeghili wawelili walumi ielfu itano, wakileka kuwavalanga wadala na wana.<verse eid="MAT 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angutyanga kunani gha masi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Maliku 6:45-52</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:15-21">Yohana 6:15-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 14:22" />Lipindi lilalila Yesu akawalongela wavulwa ghaki wakweli muwhatu, wamlongoleli kumwambu gha lihiwa Galilaya kunu mweni anguyataula mapinga gha wandu. <verse eid="MAT 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 14:23" />Badili gha kuwatawula wandu, akakwela mkitumbi weka ghaki kuyupa, na paihika lumihi, mweni awelili kula weka ghaki, <verse eid="MAT 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 14:24" />lipindi lila hila whatu sehelela pabehi na paghati gha lihiwa, ila itolilwi na mawimbi kwaikiva liyegha liwelili lunguighasa ghasa.<verse eid="MAT 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 14:25" />Uhiku pabehi na kuchiya, Yesu akawayendela wavulwa kwa kutyanga kunani gha masi. <verse eid="MAT 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 14:26" />Wavulwa ghaki pawamlola akityanga kunani gha masi wakatila nesu, wakalonga, “Ni lihoka!” wakakuwa lilowi kwa holu.<verse eid="MAT 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 14:27" />Lipindi lilalila, Yesu akalonga na weni, “Mtulili ni nenga. Mkotoho kutila!”<verse eid="MAT 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 14:28" />Petelo akamyanga, “Bambu, handa ni wenga chakaka, nilongeli nityangi kunani gha masi nihiki kwa wenga.”<verse eid="MAT 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 14:29" />Yesu akalonga, “Ena, uhiki.” Hinu, Petelo akahuluka mula muwhatu akatyanga kunani gha masi, akamyendela Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 14:30" />Ila paaliwonili lila liyegha, akatila, na akatumbula kudidimila mmasi, akalila kwa lilowi, “Bambu,unilokoli!”<verse eid="MAT 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 14:31" />Lipindi lilalila Yesu akalangiha liwoku lyaki, akamkola na kumlongela, “Wenga mundu mweni kukwinila mayaghani! Kwa kyani ulolile holu?”<verse eid="MAT 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 14:32" />Hinu wogha wakakwela muwhatu, na liyegha likaponga. <verse eid="MAT 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 14:33" />Wogha wenikuwela mghati mwa hila whatu, wakamtundamilila, wakilonga, “Chakaka wenga ni Mwana wa Sapanga.”<verse eid="MAT 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anguwalamisa wavina kula Genesaleti</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 6:53-56">Maliku 6:53-56</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 14:34" />Pawahubhuka, wakahika kumlima wa Genesaleti. <verse eid="MAT 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 14:35" />Wandu wa kula pawammanyili, yiwa mweni ni Yesu wakalandala habali zyaki kogha na kogha mbandi hila. <verse eid="MAT 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 14:36" />Wakamluwa akotoho kuwakanisa kuyavisa luviniku lya nguu ghaki. Na wogha weni kumyavisa wakalama.<verse eid="MAT 14:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MAT 15" />
  <para style="s">Mavulo gha vilongosi wa twenga wa dahile</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 7:1-13">Maliku 7:1-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 15:1" />Hinu, Mafalisayo na wavula wa laghililo lya Sapanga ampeghili Musa wakahika kuhuma ku Yelusalemu, wakamuyendela Yesu, wakamkonya, <verse eid="MAT 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 15:2" />“Kwakyani wavulwa ghako wangupingika malaghililo tupokelili kuhuma kwa vilongosi wa twenga wa dahile? Wangukuwa ng'ogha mawoko vila ingupalwa pambila gha kulyegha!”<verse eid="MAT 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 15:3" />Yesu akawayanga, “Kwakyani na mwenga mngupingika malaghililo gha Sapanga, ila mngughola mavulo gha mwenga weka? <verse eid="MAT 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 15:4" />Kwaikiva Sapanga ailongile, ‘Uwatundamili wa tati ghako na nyongo ghako,’ na ‘mundu yoyosi mweni kumlighu tati ghaki au nyongo ghaki, angupalwa akomwi.’ <verse eid="MAT 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 15:5" />Ila mwenga mnguvula yiwa mundu pakawela na hindu gha kumtanga tati ghaki au nyongo ghaki, ila akalonga, ‘Kindu haki ni kya Sapanga,’ <verse eid="MAT 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 15:6" />hinu, unguwesa ng'ogha kumtundamila tati ghako kwa kumpegha kindu haki! Havi ndiwa mngupughanya lilando lya Sapanga kwa kukovekela mavulo gha mwenga weni. <verse eid="MAT 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 15:7" />Mwenga wambindingu! Mlota Isaya alotili vila ingupalwa yala yatehumila kwa mwenga! <verse eid="MAT 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 15:8" />Sapanga angulonga, ‘Wandu hagha wangunitundamila kwa milando hela, ila mumioyu ghao iwela kutali na nenga. <verse eid="MAT 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 15:9" />Kunitundamila kwa weni kunguwatanga ng'ogha chochosi, kwaikiva mavulo ghao yayandalwa na wandu hela wakilonga ni gha Sapanga.’”<verse eid="MAT 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mighalu yeni kumghola mundu akotoho kujumilwa kuulongolo gha Sapanga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 7:14-23">Maliku 7:14-23</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 15:10" />Yesu akalikema lila lipinga lya wandu, akalilongela, “Myughanili, na mmanyi! <verse eid="MAT 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 15:11" />Kindu kingumghola mundu akotoho kujumilwa kuulongolo gha Sapanga, ng'ogha kila kiyingila kumlomo, ila milando yeni kuhuma kumlomo. Haki ndiwa kingumghola mundu akotoho kujumilwa kuulongolo gha Sapanga.”<verse eid="MAT 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 15:12" />Hinu wavulwa ghaki wakamyendela, wakamlongela, “Ghuli, ungumanya yiwa Mafalisayo wahyomili pawayughanila milando ghako?”<verse eid="MAT 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 15:13" />Ila mweni akawayanga, “Kila kyeni kukulilwa ng'ogha na Tati ghangu, kitetupulwa. <verse eid="MAT 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 15:14" />Muwaleki hagha ni vilongosi wangalimihu, wanguwalongosa wangalimihu. Na paikawela angalimihu angumlongosa angalimihu myaki, wogha waivili watedubukila mlyohu.”<verse eid="MAT 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 15:15" />Petelo akalonga, “Utulongeli ungumanisa niki mlandano hau.”<verse eid="MAT 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 15:16" />Yesu akalonga, “Na mwenga mmanya ng'ogha mlandano hau? <verse eid="MAT 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 15:17" />Ghuli, mmanyang'ogha yiwa kila kimyingila mundu mumlomu kinguyenda mumtima na kuulongolo kinguhumiswa panji kinguwela ndaka? <verse eid="MAT 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 15:18" />Ila mighalu yenikuhuma mumlomu inguhuma mmoyu, na haki ndiwa kingumghola mundu akotoho kujumilwa kuulongolo gha Sapanga. <verse eid="MAT 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 15:19" />Kwaikiva mmoyu yanguhuma mawachilo mahakata yeni kumlongosa mundu kukoma, ungongola, kutola mdala au mlumi wa myako, wihi, ulangihi wa uhwangi na malighu. <verse eid="MAT 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 15:20" />Hagha ndiwa yangumghola mundu akotoho kujumilwa kuulongolo gha Sapanha. Ila kulyegha mulyo ukaleka kukuwa mawoku haku kunguwesa ng'ogha kumghola mundu akotoho kujumilwa kuulongolo gha Sapanga.”<verse eid="MAT 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kukwinila kwa nyongo mweni kuhuma Kanani</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 7:24-30">Maliku 7:24-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 15:21" />Yesu akahuka mahala pala na akayenda kumimbwani pabehi na Tilo na Sidoni. <verse eid="MAT 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 15:22" />Hinu nyongo mmonga wa lipinga lya wandu wa Kaanani akamuhikila, akalila, akilonga, “Bambu, Mwana wa Daudi, uniwoneli luhungu! Biti ghangu angughaswa na lihoka.”<verse eid="MAT 15:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 15:23" />Ila Yesu amyangili ng'ogha. Hinu, wavulwa ghaki wakamyendela, wakamlongela, “Amlongeli ayendi zyaki kwaikiva angutukovekela kuhyetu kunu akitutovela lilowi.”<verse eid="MAT 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 15:24" />Yesu akawayanga, “Nilaghilwa hela kuwalokola wandu wa mlima wa Izilaeli weni kuyaghamila handa kondolu.”<verse eid="MAT 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 15:25" />Bahala yula nyongo akahika, akimtundamilila manung'una, akalonga, “Bambu, undangi.”<verse eid="MAT 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 15:26" />Yesu akamyanga, “Maha ng'ogha kutola mulyo wa wana na kuwadangila waghalu.”<verse eid="MAT 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 15:27" />Hayu nyongo akayanga, “Ni chakaka, Bambu, ila hata ghalu wangulyegha vyenikuhighala na kuguwa pahi kuhuma kumesa gha Bambu ghao.”<verse eid="MAT 15:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 15:28" />Bahala Yesu akamyanga, “Nyongo, kukwinila ghako ni kukulu, hinu, ugholelwi handa ungupala.” Yula biti ghaki akalama lipindi lilalila.<verse eid="MAT 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anguwalamisa wandu watangala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 15:29" />Yesu akahuka pala akayenda mmbalimbali mwa lihiwa Galilaya, akakwela mlitumbi, akatama pahi. <verse eid="MAT 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 15:30" />Wandu watangala nesu wakamhikila wakiwayegha wavina na kuwavika kuulongolo ghaki, wangali kulola, walemafu kutyanga, wangali kulonga, na ghangi wogha wenikuwela wavina, mweni Yesu akawalamisa. <verse eid="MAT 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 15:31" />Lipinga lila lya wandu walikangasili nesu pawalolili angalikulonga akilonga, wenikuwela walemafu wa maghulu wangutyanga, na wangali kulola wangulola, wandu wakamyinula Sapanga mweni kutundamilwa na wandu wa Izilaeli.<verse eid="MAT 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anguwapegha mulyo wandu ielfu njechi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 8:1-10">Maliku 8:1-10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 15:32" />Hinu, Yesu akawakema wavulwa ghaki, akalonga, “Ninguwawonela luhungu wandu hagha kwaikiva wawela na nenga kwa machuwa itatu, na wawelili ng'ogha na mulyo. Na nenga ningupala ng'ogha kuwataula kunu wakiwela na njala, kwaikiva watewesa kuhyunga mnjila.”<verse eid="MAT 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 15:33" />Wavulwa ghaki wakamlongela, “Mahala haku wangulikala ng'ogha wandu, ghuli, tutepokela kugha mulyo wa kuwakwila wandu watangala hagha wogha?”<verse eid="MAT 15:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 15:34" />Yesu akawakonya, “Mvile na mibumunda mininga?” Wakamyanga, “Mibumunda isaba na vihomba vya mayaghani vinung'unanung'una.”<verse eid="MAT 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 15:35" />Hinu, Yesu akawalongela wandu watami pahi. <verse eid="MAT 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 15:36" />Akaitola hila mibumunda isaba na vila vihoba, akamyupa Sapanga, akavimetula, akawapegha wavulwa, na weni wakawapegha wandu. <verse eid="MAT 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 15:37" />Wogha wakalyegha, wakayukuta hinu wavulwa wakakungula vila vihighalili, wakamemesa vibeja isaba. <verse eid="MAT 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 15:38" />Wandu walyeghili wawelili walumi ielfu inne, wakileka kuvalanga wadala na wana.<verse eid="MAT 15:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 15:39" />Hinu, Yesu akawataula wandu, akakwela whatu, akayenda kumuji wa Magadani.<verse eid="MAT 15:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MAT 16" />
  <para style="s">Wandu wangupala kilangihi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 8:11-13">Maliku 8:11-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:54-56">Luka 12:54-56</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 16:1" />Mafalisayo na Masadukayu wamyendilili Yesu, na kwa kumyesa, wakamlongela awagoleli kilangihi kuhuma kundumba. <verse eid="MAT 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 16:2" />Ila Yesu akawayanga, “Paihika lumihi mwenga mngulonga, kunani kutewela kuponga kwaikiva kunani kunguwoneka kukeli!” <verse eid="MAT 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 16:3" />Na malawila pee mngulonga, “Lelu kutewela na liyegha, kwaikiva kunani ni kukele na kangi mahindu yatangala!” Hinu, mwenga mngumanya nesu kuvula lipindi kwa kulola muwoneku wa kunani, ila mwenga mngusindwa kumanya vilangihi vya mighalu yeni kuhumila machuwa gha lelo. <verse eid="MAT 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 16:4" />“Kiwelekwa haki kya maha ng'ogha na kiwela ng'ogha na utundamilu! kingupala kilangihi, ila kitepokela ng'ogha kilangihi kyokyosi ila kilangihi kila kya Yona.” Hinu, akawaleka, akayenda zyaki.<verse eid="MAT 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Simika gha Mafalisayo na Masadukayu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 8:14-21">Maliku 8:14-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 16:5" />Wavulwa ghaki pawahubhuka kala mbandi ghangi gha ipili gha lihiwa, wakamanya yiwa waliwasuwa kupapa mibumunda. <verse eid="MAT 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 16:6" />Yesu akawalongela, “Mlihungi na simika gha Mafalisayo na Masadukayu!”<verse eid="MAT 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 16:7" />Wakalongelana weni kwa weni, wakilonga, “Angulonga nagha kwaikiva tuyegha ng'ogha mibumunda.”<verse eid="MAT 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 16:8" />Yesu akamanya kila wawelili wakilongelana, hinu akawalongela, “Mkotoho kusindana mwenga kwa mwenga kulongelela libumunda. Mngupalwa mnikwinili nenga.” <verse eid="MAT 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 16:9" />Ghuli, mmbila mmanya ng'ogha? Ghuli, mkumbwike ng'ogha pametulili hila mibumunda mhano kwa wala wandu ielufu itano walyeghili? Ghuli, mmemesili vibeja vininga vya vila vihighalili? <verse eid="MAT 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 16:10" />Au, hila mibumunda isaba wapeghilwi wala wandu ielufu njechi, ghuli, mkungulili vibeja vininga vya vila vihighalili? <verse eid="MAT 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 16:11" />Hinu mmanya ng'ogha yiwa niwelili ng'ogha nikilongelela habali gha mibumunda? Mjihungi na simika lya Mafalisayo na Masadukayu!<verse eid="MAT 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 16:12" />Ndiwa wavulwa wakamanya yiwa awelili kalonga ng'ogha mghalu wa mibumunda au simika ila mavulo gha Mafalisayo pamonga na Masadukayu.<verse eid="MAT 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petelo angulongela lipala yiwa Yesu ni Mwana wa Sapanga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 8:27-30">Maliku 8:27-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Luka 9:18-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 16:13" />Yesu paahikili mbandu gha Kaisali kula wangupakema Filipi, awakonyili wavulwa ghaki, “Ghuli wandu wangulonga yiwa Mwana wa Mundu ni ghani?”<verse eid="MAT 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 16:14" />Wakamyanga, “Waghangi wangulonga yiwa ni Yohana Mbatisa, na waghangi Eliya, ghangi Yelemia au mmonga wa walota wa Sapanga.”<verse eid="MAT 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 16:15" />Yesu akawakonya, “Ghuli, mwenga mngulonga nenga na ghani.”<verse eid="MAT 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 16:16" />Simoni Petelo akayanga, “Wenga ndiwa Kilisito, Mwana wa Sapanga mwenikuwela mkomu.”<verse eid="MAT 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 16:17" />Yesu akalonga, “Uhighilwa wenga Simoni mwana wa Yona, kwaikiva kwahela mundu yeyosi kakugubutulila hali, ila Tati ghangu mwenikuwela kundumba ndiwa kakugubutulila. <verse eid="MAT 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 16:18" />Na nenga ningukulongela: Wenga ni Petelo, na kunani gha mghomba hau nitechenga lipinga lya wandu weni kumkwinila Kilisito, hata makakala gha kihu yatewesa ng'ogha kulisinda. <verse eid="MAT 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 16:19" />Nitekupegha funguu zya Unkosi wa Kundumba, na kila utekiwopa mumlimawogha, kitewopwa na kundumba, hilahila kila utekiwoposola kumlimawogha kitewoposolwa na kundumba.”<verse eid="MAT 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 16:20" />Hinu akawakanisa wavulwa ghaki wakotoho kumlongela mundu yeyosi yiwa mweni ndiwa Kilisito.<verse eid="MAT 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angulonga kuhakilwa na kukomwa kwaki</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 8:31-9:1">Maliku 8:31-9:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22-27">Luka 9:22-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 16:21" />Kuhuma lipindi lila Yesu atumbulili kuwamanyisa lipala lipala wavulwa ghaki yiwa ingumpala ayendi Yelusalemu na kukolwa na mahakilo matangala kuhuma kwa wagogolu, watambika wakulu na wavula wa laghililo mbaka ahovi, ila lichuwa lya itatu atehinduka.<verse eid="MAT 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 16:22" />Petelo akamtola mahala paweka akatumbula kumkalipila, akilonga, “Sapanga akotoho kughola hali! mghalu hau utekukola ng'ogha!”<verse eid="MAT 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 16:23" />Ila Yesu akaghalambuka, na kumlongela Petelo, “Uhuki kuulongolo gha nenga, Lihyukana! Wenga ni mhakata kwa nenga. Mawachilo ghako gha kisapanga ng'ogha, ila unguwachila kimundu”<verse eid="MAT 16:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 16:24" />Hinu Yesu akawalongela wavulwa ghaki, Mundu yeyosi mwenikupala kunikovikela nenga, ingumpala ajikanili mweni, atoli lipingika lyaki, anikovikeli. <verse eid="MAT 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 16:25" />Kwaikiva mundu mwenikupala kulokola ukomu ghaki mweni, hayu ateuyalamisa, <verse eid="MAT 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 16:26" />ila yeyosi mwenikuyalamisa ukomu ghaki kwaikiva gha nenga atepokela ukomu wa uchakaka. Kwaikiva atepata fwaida ghani mundu kupokela mlima wogha, ila akayalamisa ukomu ghaki? Kwaikiva kwahela kindu mundu anguwesa kuhipa ili apati ukomu ghaki. <verse eid="MAT 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 16:27" />Kwaikiva, Mwana wa Adamu atehika kuukulu wa Tati ghaki pamonga na watumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga, na haku ndiwa atempegha kila mundu kukovekelana na matendu ghaki. <verse eid="MAT 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 16:28" />Chakaka ninguwalongela, “Kuwela na waghangi bahala wenikuwela watehova ng'ogha pambila gha kumlola Mwana wa Mundu akihika ku Unkosi ghaki.”<verse eid="MAT 16:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="MAT 17" />
  <para style="s">Yesu angughalambuka wusu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 9:2-13">Maliku 9:2-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Luka 9:28-36</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 17:1" />Kuulongolo gha machuwa isita, Yesu akawatola Petelo na Yakobu na Yohanamlongo ghaki, akayenda na weni kunani gha litumbi litali na haku wakawela weka yau. <verse eid="MAT 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 17:2" />Kula Yesu akaghalambuka wusu kuulongolo gha weni, wusu ghaki ukang'anyima handa lijuwa na nguu zyaki zikawela mbulete handa mhana. <verse eid="MAT 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 17:3" />Wala wavulwa waitatu wakawalola Musa na Eliya wakilongela na Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 17:4" />Bahala Petelo akamlongela Yesu, “Bambu, nenga ningulola ni maha tulikali baha! Paikawela ungupala wenga nenga nitechenga vibimilo viitatu. kimonga kya wenga, na kimonga kya Musa na kimonga kya Eliya.”<verse eid="MAT 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 17:5" />Petulo pawelili akali akilongela bwitu, lihindu lyeni kung'anyima likawagubika, na lilowi likahyoghanilwa pala, “Hayu ni Mwana ghangu nimpalili nipalilwa na mweni, mumyughanile mweni.”<verse eid="MAT 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 17:6" />Wavulwa pawayughanila nagha wakaguwa kifulifuli, wakatila nesu. <verse eid="MAT 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 17:7" />Yesu akawayendela, akawayavisa, akalonga, “Mugholoki, Mkotoho kutila!” <verse eid="MAT 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 17:8" />Pawalolesa kunani wakalola ng'ogha mundu mghangi, ila Yesu weka ghaki.<verse eid="MAT 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 17:9" />Pawawelili wakihuluka kuhuma kulitumbi, Yesu akawalongela kwa mkasu, “Mkotoho kumlongela mundu yeyosi mighalu hai mbaka Mwana wa Mundu atehinduka.”<verse eid="MAT 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 17:10" />Hinu wavulwa wakamkonya, “Kwa kyani wavula wa laghililo lya Sapanga ampeghili Musa wangulonga ingupalwa Eliya ahiki huti?”<verse eid="MAT 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 17:11" />Yesu akawayanga, “Chakaka, Eliya angupalwa ahiki huti ayandali mighalu hyogha. <verse eid="MAT 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 17:12" />Ila ninguwalongela, Eliya kahika kala na weni wammanyili ng'ogha, bali wakamgholela mighalu mihakata handa waipalile weni. Mwana wa Adamu ategholelwa mahakata handa wamgholilile Elilya.”<verse eid="MAT 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 17:13" />Pala wala wavulwa wakamanya yiwa awelili akiwalongela habali gha Yohana Mbatisa.<verse eid="MAT 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angumlamisa mwana mweni lihoka</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 9:14-29">Maliku 9:14-29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43">Luka 9:37-43</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 17:14" />Hinu pawahikile kulipinga lya wandu, mundu mmonga akamyendela Yesu, akamtundamila manung'una, <verse eid="MAT 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 17:15" />akalonga, “Bambu, umuwoneli luhungu mwana ghangu kwaikiva kana kimbulengi, kangi angughaswa nesu, hagha ghangu muhumila kwa lipindi weka weka lipindi ghangi lingumguwisa kulyoto na lipindi ghangi kumasi. <verse eid="MAT 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 17:16" />Nimyeghili kwa wavulwa ghako, ila wawesili ng'ogha kumlamisa.”<verse eid="MAT 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 17:17" />Yesu akawayanga, “Ghuli mwenga kiwelekwa kyenikuwela ng'ogha na kukwinila, kilekili kumkwinila Bambu! Nitelikala na mwenga mbaka ligha? Ghuli nitewafumilila mbaka ligha? Mniyegheli hayu mwana!” <verse eid="MAT 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 17:18" />Hinu, Yesu akamkalipila yula lihoka, na lihoka likamuhuka, na yula mwana akalama lipindi lila lila.<verse eid="MAT 17:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 17:19" />Hinu wavulwa wakamkovekela Yesu kumahala pawela ng'ogha na wandu, wakamkonya, “Kwakyani twenga tuwesa ng'ogha kumhumisa yula lihoka?”<verse eid="MAT 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 17:20" />Yesu akawayanga, “Kwaikiva muwela na ukwinila mayaghani. Ninguwalongela chakaka, paikawela muwela na ukwinila mayaghani handa mbeyu gha libiki lyeni kukemwa haladali, mtewesa kulongela litumbi hali, ‘Utupuki na uyendi kula mahala ghangi,’ na lyeni litetupuka. Na kwahela kindu kitesindwa kugholeka kwa mwenga!” <verse eid="MAT 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 17:21" />Yesu akalipinga, “Lihoka lya ndambu hai linguwesa ng'ogha kuhumiswa mbaka kwa kuyupa na kuwopa mulyo.”<verse eid="MAT 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angulongelela kangi kihu kyaki</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Maliku 9:30-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:45">Luka 9:45</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 17:22" />Kuulongolo, wavulwa pawalikungulile pamonga ku Galilaya, Yesu awalongilile, “Mwana wa Mundu atelekwa akamulwi na wandu wahakata.” <verse eid="MAT 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 17:23" />“Watemkoma, ila lichuwa lya itatu atehindulwa.” Wavulwa ghaki wakamng'ung'ulikila nesu.<verse eid="MAT 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhipa usulu kulighuta lya Sapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 17:24" />Hinu Yesu na wavulwa ghaki pawahikili kummbwani wa Kapelinaumu, wakungula usulu wa lighuta lya Sapanga wakamyendela Petelo, wakamkonya, “Ghuli, mvula wa mwenga anguhipa usulu wa lighuta lya Sapanga?”<verse eid="MAT 17:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 17:25" />Petelo akayanga, “Ena, mweni anguhipa.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 17:25">Hinu, Petelo paayingila mghati mwa lighuta, pambila hata kalongela lilando, Yesu akamkonya, “Simoni wenga unguliwachila niki kuhabali gha kuhipa usulu? Wankosi wa mlima wogha wangukungula usulu au kodi kuhuma kwa kina ghani? Kuhuma kwa wakola mlima au kwa wahenja?”<verse eid="MAT 17:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 17:26" />Petelo akayanga, “Kuhuma kwa wahenja.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 17:26">Yesu akawalongela, “Hinu, wenikaya wangupalwa ng'ogha kuhipa. <verse eid="MAT 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 17:27" />Ila ili tukotoho kuwaghola wahyomi, uyendi mlihiwa ukalopoli homba, utoli homba wa mtumbulo kumlopola umgubutuli lilomo lyaki na hamu kumlomo utelola mapesa, utoli ukahipi usulu ghako na wa nenga.”<verse eid="MAT 17:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="MAT 18" />
  <para style="s">Mkulu ni ghani?</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Maliku 9:33-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Luka 9:46-48</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 18:1" />Lipindi lila wavulwa wakamuyendela Yesu, wakamkonya, “Ni ghani mwenikuwela mkulu nesu kuunkosi wa kundumba?”<verse eid="MAT 18:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 18:2" />Yesu akamkema mwana mmonga, akamgholosa paghati ghao, <verse eid="MAT 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 18:3" />hinu akalonga, “Ninguwalongela chakaka, pamghalambuka ng'ogha na kuwela handa wana, katu mteyingila ng'ogha ku Unkosi wa Kundumba.” <verse eid="MAT 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 18:4" />Yeyosi mweni kuyitikila handa mwana hayu, ndiwa mwenikuwela mkulu ku Unkosi wa Kundumba. <verse eid="MAT 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 18:5" />Yeyosi angumpokela mwana mmonga handa hayu kwa kwaikiva gha nenga, angumbokela nenga.<verse eid="MAT 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuyambusa waghangi wagholi sambi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 9:42-48">Maliku 9:42-48</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1-2">Luka 17:1-2</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 18:6" />“Ila mundu yeyosi akimyambusa mmonga wa wanung'una hagha wanikwinila nenga agholi uhakata, ingawelili maha awopwe liganga likulunga lya kuhyaghila kuntandala na kudidimikwa kumasi matali kuyenda pahi mubahali.”<figure style="fig" file="01 Millstone.jpg" size="col" ref="18:6">Wandu wavili wanguyagha kulwala</figure> <verse eid="MAT 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 18:7" />Mwenga wandu wa mlima wogha mtepata unyokolu kwaikiva mighalu inguyambusa wandu kughola mahakata! Mighalu hai ni lasima ihumili, ila unyokolu kwa mundu yula anguyambusa yahumili.<verse eid="MAT 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 18:8" />“Ikiwela liwoku au lighulu lyaku lingukuyambusila ughole sambi, lidumuli na kulitagha kutali na wenga. Ni mbaa kwa wenga kuyingila kuukomu ukileka liwoku au lighulu, kupiti kudangwa kulyotu lya machuwa hyogha bila mwihu ukiwela na mawoku maivili na maghulu ghako hyogha maivili.” <verse eid="MAT 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 18:9" />Paikawela lisu lyaku likakuyambusila, ulihumisi na kulitagha kutali na wenga mbaa kwa wenga kuyingila kuukomu ukiwela lidoju, kupiti kudangwa kulyoto lya machuwa hyogha bila kujimika ukiwela na mihu ghako hyogha miivili.<verse eid="MAT 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mlandano wa kondolu ayaghamilili</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 15:3-7">Luka 15:3-7</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 18:10" />“Mlihungi! Mkotoho kumpughanya mmonga wa wanung'una hagha. Chakaka ninguwalongela, watumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga wa weni wenikuwela haku kundumba machuwa hyogha wangugholoka kuulongolo gha Tati ghangu.” <verse eid="MAT 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 18:11" />Kwaikiva Mwana wa Mundu ahikili kuwalokola wala wayaghamilili.<verse eid="MAT 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 18:12" />“Mnguliwachila niki? Mundu pakawela na kondolu imia imonga, na akamyaghamisa mmonga, ateghola ghuli? Ghuli, atewaleka ng'ogha wala itisini na itisa kula kulitumbi, akayenda kumuhakula yula ayaghamilili mmonga.” <verse eid="MAT 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 18:13" />Ninguwalongela chakaka, pakamkamula kala, atehekelela nesu kwa hayu mmonga kupiti vila anguhekelela kwa hagha itisini na itisa wala weni kuyaghamila ng'ogha. <verse eid="MAT 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 18:14" />Havi havi na Tati wa mwenga wa kundumba ndiwa angughola kapala ng'ogha hata mmonga wa hagha wanung'una ayaghamili.<verse eid="MAT 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mlongo ghako paakakugholela uhakata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 18:15" />“Mlongo ghako pakakugholela uhakata, umyendeli ukamlongeli kila kakugholela mkiwela waivili weka yenu. Pakakuyoghanila utewela umlokola mlongo ghako.” <verse eid="MAT 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 18:16" />Ila paikawela kakuhyoghanila ng'ogha, hinu uyendi na mundu ghangi mmonga au waivili ili kila lilando lihighiliswi na ulangihi wa walangihi waivili au waitatu. <verse eid="MAT 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 18:17" />Pakawayughanila ng'ogha hagha, ulilongeli lipinga lya wandu wamkwinila Kilisito, na lyeni ikiwela kaliyoghanila ng'ogha, na awoneki kwa wenga kawela handa wandu waghangi wenikumkwinila ng'ogha Sapanga au handa wakungula usulu.<verse eid="MAT 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kukanisa na kulekesela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 18:18" />“Ninguwalongela chakaka, kila mtekiwopa kumlimawogha kitewopwa na kundumba, na kila mtekiwoposola kumlimawogha kitewoposolwa na kundumba.”<verse eid="MAT 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 18:19" />“Kangi ninguwalongela, waivili paghati gha mwenga pawajumilana kuyupa kunani gha mghalu mtenu haku kumlimawogha. Tati ghangu wa kundumba atewagholela. <verse eid="MAT 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 18:20" />Kwaikiva kokosi kula pawalikungula waivili au waitatu kwaikiva gha nenga, nenga nabaha paghati ghao.”<verse eid="MAT 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mlandano wa mtumikila mweni kupala ng'ogha kulekesela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 18:21" />Kuulongolu Petelo akamyendela Yesu, akamkonya, “Bambu, ikiwela mlongu ghangu kanigholela uhakata, ni mihanja mininga ningupalwa kumlekesela? Ghuli hata mihanja isaba?”<verse eid="MAT 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 18:22" />Yesu akamuyanga, “Nilonga ng'ogha mihanja isaba hela, ila isaba mihanja isabini.” <verse eid="MAT 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 18:23" />Ninguwalongela nagha, kwaikiva Unkosi wa Sapanga ungulandana na nkosi mmonga mweni kulamula kulolesa maha habali gha mavalangu kuhuma kwa watumikila ghaki. <verse eid="MAT 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 18:24" />Pakatumbula kupokela habali gha hindu ghaki, ikawoneka mundu mmonga mweni kuwela angupalwa haipi vihaku ielufu ikumi vya sahabu akayegha kwa mweni. <verse eid="MAT 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 18:25" />Mundu hayu kahela kya kuhipa, nkosi ghaki akalamula awuswi kuwela muhusutu, mweni na muhumbu ghaki pamonga na wana ghaki na vyogha vila kawela navyu viwuswi, lukani apati kuhipwa. <verse eid="MAT 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 18:26" />Hinu, hayu mtumikila akatundamila manung'una kulongolo ghaki, akalonga, “Unifumilili, nitekuhipa vihaku ghako hyogha.” <verse eid="MAT 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 18:27" />Yula nkosi akamwonela luhungu, akamlekesela lila lideni, akamleka ayendi zyaki.<verse eid="MAT 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 18:28" />“Ila hayu mtumikila paawelili anguhuma panji, akakongine na mtumikila myaki mweni kuwela na lideni lyaki lya magwala imia imonga vya madini gha feza. Akamkamula, akamvika lingaka akimlongela, uhipi lideni lyangu!” <verse eid="MAT 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 18:29" />Yula mtumikila myaki akamtundamilila manung'una, akamluwa, “Unifumilili nitekuhipa.” <verse eid="MAT 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 18:30" />Ila mweni akakanila, akamyegha kukihungu mbaka pala atehipa lideni lila. <verse eid="MAT 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 18:31" />Hinu, watumikila wayaki pawalolile mghalu hula wakamng'ung'ulikila nesu, wakayenda kumlongela mghalu hula nkosi ghao. <verse eid="MAT 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 18:32" />Yula nkosi akamkema yula mtumikila akamlongela, “Wenga ni mtumikila mhakata nesu! Uniluwili nikulekeseli, na nenga nikakulekesela lideni lyaku lyogha.” <verse eid="MAT 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 18:33" />“Ghuli, wenga upalilwi ng'ogha kumuwonela luhungu mtumikila myaku handa nenga vila nikuwonilili luhungu wenga?” <verse eid="MAT 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 18:34" />“Hinu, kwa lilaka, yula nkosi ghaki akamkamula yula mtumikila na kumyegha kwa watovangondu wa lighuta lya wawopwa wamghasi mbaka pala atehipa lideni lyaki lyogha.”<verse eid="MAT 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 18:35" />Yesu akayongesela kulonga, “Hilahila na Tati ghangu wa kundumba atewagholela kila mmonga wa mwenga, paikawela kamlekesela ng'ogha myaki kuhuma mmoyu yula mweni kumgholela uhakata.”<verse eid="MAT 18:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="MAT 19" />
  <para style="s">Mavulo gha kuposa na kulekana</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 10:1-12">Maliku 10:1-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 19:1" />Yesu paayomolili kulongela milando hila, akahuka Galilaya, akayenda Yudasiya, kumwambu gha lweni Yolidani. <verse eid="MAT 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 19:2" />Wandu watangala wamkovekelili kula, na mweni akawalamisa wala wenikuwela wavina haku.<verse eid="MAT 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 19:3" />Mafalisayo wamonga wakamhikila, wakamkonya kwa kumtegha, “Ghuli, ni maha mngwana kumleka mhumbu ghaki kwa likosa lolosi?”<verse eid="MAT 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 19:4" />Yesu akawayanga, “Ghuli msomili ng'ogha ku Mayandiko gha Sapanga amlumbili mundu mlumi na mdala? <verse eid="MAT 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 19:5" />Hinu Sapanga akalonga, ‘Kwaikiva gha nagha mlumi atemleka tati ghaki na nyongo ghaki, na atekovekelana na mdala ghaki, na weni waivili watewela higha mmonga.’ <verse eid="MAT 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 19:6" />Nagha, weni ng'ogha waivili kangi ila ni higha mmonga. Hinu, kila akikonganisili Sapanga, mundu akotoho kukilekanisa.”<verse eid="MAT 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 19:7" />Ila weni wakamkonya, “Kwakyani, Musa atulaghilili mdala umyandikili lihamba lya kulekana?”<verse eid="MAT 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 19:8" />Yesu akawayanga, “Musa alongili nagha kwaikiva gha ukamala gha mioyu ghao. <verse eid="MAT 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 19:9" />Ningulonga nagha mhumbu ghako kaghola ngongola ng'ogha, ungupalwa ng'ogha kumpegha lihamba lya kumleka ili umposi mdala mghangi. Ikiva uteghola nagha, ungughola ngongola.”<verse eid="MAT 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 19:10" />Wavulwa ghaki wakamlongela Yesu, “Ikiva mighalu yeni ndiwa hai ni mbaa kuleka kuposa.”<verse eid="MAT 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 19:11" />Yesu akawalongela, “Mavulo hagha yangughola lihengu kwa amonga gha wandu hela na ng'ogha kwa kila mundu. Ila wala weni kutangwa na Sapanga. <verse eid="MAT 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 19:12" />Kwaikiva kuwela na uyambuso wekaweka wa kumghola mundu akotoho kuposa: Waghangi ni kwaikiva waweleka mbendi, waghangi wakiva mbendi kwa kugholwa na wandu, na waghangi walamula weni kuleka kutola mdala kwaikiva gha Unkosi wa Sapanga. Mweni kuwesa kupokela mavulo hagha na apokeli.”<verse eid="MAT 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anguwahighila wana wasokombi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Maliku 10:13-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Luka 18:15-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 19:13" />Hinu amonga gha wandu wakamyeghela Yesu wana wasokombi ili awavikili mawoku na kuwahighila. Ila wavulwa ghaki pawalilolile hali wakawalemesa wandu wakotoho kuwayegha wana wasokombi. <verse eid="MAT 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 19:14" />Yesu akalonga, “Muwaleki wana wasokombi wahiki kwa nenga, mkotoho kuwalemesa, kwaikiva Unkosi wa Kundumba ni wa wandu weni kuwela handa wana hagha.”<verse eid="MAT 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 19:15" />Mweni, akawavikila mawoko, hinu akahuka mahala pala.<verse eid="MAT 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Msongolo mnaisa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Maliku 10:17-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Luka 18:18-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 19:16" />Mundu mmonga akamhikila Yesu, akamkonya, “Mvula, nigholi kindu kyani kya maha ili mbati ukomu wa machuwa yayendelela bila mwihu?”<verse eid="MAT 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 19:17" />Yesu akamyanga, “Kwa kyani ungungonya nenga nilongeleli lilando maha? Sapanga weka yaki ndiwa mweni kuwoneka na hau umaha. Ila paupala kuyingila kuukomu, ukoli lilaghilo.”<verse eid="MAT 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 19:18" />Yula mundu akamkonya, “Lilaghilo liki?” Yesu akamyanga, “Ukotoho kukoma, ukotoho kutola mhumbu wa myaku, ukukotoho kuhija, ukotoho kulongela milando gha uhwangi, <verse eid="MAT 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 19:19" />watundamili tati ghako na nyongo ghako, na mpali myako handa ungujipala mweni.”<verse eid="MAT 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 19:20" />Yula msongolo akalonga, “Havi vyogha ninguvikola, nigholi kyani kangi?”<verse eid="MAT 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 19:21" />Yesu akamlongela, “Ikiva ungupala uwoneki upungula ng'ogha na chochosi, uyendi ukawusi vindu ghako na uwapeghi wakapuku mapesa, na wenga utewela na ngoko kundumba, badili gha hagha uhiki unikovikeli.”<verse eid="MAT 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 19:22" />Yula msongolo paayughanilili ghala, akayenda zyaki akiva na mang'ung'uliku, kwaikiva awelili mnahisa nesu.<verse eid="MAT 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 19:23" />Hinu Yesu akawalongela wavulwa ghaki, “Chakaka ninguwalongela itewesekana kwa ugangamalu mundu mnaisa kuyingila ku Unkosi wa Kundumba. <verse eid="MAT 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 19:24" />Kangi ninguwalongela, ni yuyughu ngamiya kuphita kulilanga lya sindanu, kupiti kwa mnaisa kuyingila ku Unkosi wa Sapanga.”<verse eid="MAT 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 19:25" />Wala wavulwa pawayughanila nagha walikangasili nesu, wakamkonya, “Ni ghani hinu atewesa kulokoka?”<verse eid="MAT 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 19:26" />Yesu akawalola, akalonga, “Kwa mundu mghalu hau uwesekana ng'ogha, ila kwa Sapanga mighalu hyogha inguwesekana.”<verse eid="MAT 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 19:27" />Hinu Petelo akayanga, na “Twenga tuleka kila kindu na tukakovekela, tutepokela kyani?”<verse eid="MAT 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 19:28" />Yesu akawalongela, “Ninguwalongela chakaka, Mwana wa Mundu paatehika kutama kukikalilo kyaki kya ukulu kya maha ku mlima wogha wa hyonu, mwenga mnikovekelili mtetama kuvitamilo ikumi na ivili mkiyalamula makabila ikumi na ivili gha Izilaeli.” <verse eid="MAT 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 19:29" />Na kila mmonga alekili lighuta lyaki au mlongu au mhacha au tati au nyongo au wana au matawa kwaikiva gha nenga, atepokela miyanja imia kupiti, na kupokela ukomu wa machuva yayendelela bila mwihu. <verse eid="MAT 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 19:30" />Ila weni kuwela wa mtumbulo watewela wa mwihu, na weni kuwela wa mwihu watewela wa utumbulo.<verse eid="MAT 19:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="MAT 20" />
  <para style="s">Waghola lihenga kulitawa lya misabibu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 20:1" />“Unkosi wa kundumba ungulandana na mundu mweni litawa lya misabibu, mweni ahukili malawila pee apalile kuhakula watukutula wa kughola lihengu kulitawa lyaki.” <verse eid="MAT 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 20:2" />Alaghanile na weni kuwahipa ligwala lya lidini lya feza limonga kwa lichuwa, hinu akawayegha kulitawa lya misabibu. <verse eid="MAT 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 20:3" />Akahuka lipindi lya isaa itatu malawila, akalola wandu waghangi wagholoka kusoku, wenikuwela ng'ogha na lihengu. <verse eid="MAT 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 20:4" />Akawalongela, “Myendi na mwenga mkagholi lihengu kulitawa lya misabibu, na nenga nitewapegha kila mngupalwa kuhipwa kwa kila mtekighola.” <verse eid="MAT 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 20:5" />Hinu, wakayenda. Hayu mweni litawa akahuka kangi lipindi lya isaa isita na isaa itisa, akaghola hilahila. <verse eid="MAT 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 20:6" />Hata lipindi lya isaa ikumi na imonga lumihi, akahuka kangi, akalola wandu waghangi wagholoka pala kusoku. Hinu akawakonya, “Kwakyani mngugholoka haku mkiwela ng'ogha na lihengu?” <verse eid="MAT 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 20:7" />Wakamuyanga, “Kwaikiva kwahela mundu atupeghili lihengu.” “Hinu myendi kulitawa lya nenga lya misabibu mkagholi lihengu.”<verse eid="MAT 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 20:8" />“Pakuchia, yula mweni litawa akamlongela yula mvika mapesa ghaki, uwakemi waghola lihengu kuwapegha mahipo ghao, ukitumbula na wala wakemilwi kumwihu na kuyomola na wala wa mtumbulo.” <verse eid="MAT 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 20:9" />Hinu, wakahika wala watumbulili lihengu lipindi lya isaa ikumi na imonga, wakapokela kila mmonga ligwala limonga lya lidini lya feza. <verse eid="MAT 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 20:10" />Wala wa mtumbulo pawahikili, wawelili wanguliwachila yiwa watehipwa kupiti wala waghangi, ila hata weni wakapokela kila mmonga ligwala limonga. <verse eid="MAT 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 20:11" />Wakapokela mahipo ghao, wakatumbula kumng'ung'ulikila yula Bambu. <verse eid="MAT 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 20:12" />Wakalonga, “Wandu hagha wenikutolwa kumwihu weni waghola lihengu kwa lipindi lya isaa imonga hela, ila uwapegha mahipo handa twenga. Kunu twenga tufumilila mahengu matopa lichuwa lyogha lijuwa likalipa!” <verse eid="MAT 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 20:13" />“Hinu yula mweni litawa akamyanga mmonga gha weni, ghanja, nikululunganya ng'ogha. Ghuli tulaghanile ng'ogha kukupegha mahipo gha machuwa hyogha ligwala limonga lya lidini lya feza kwa lichuwa? <verse eid="MAT 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 20:14" />Utoli mahipo ghako uyendi zyaku, nenga ningupala kumpegha hayu wa mwihu handa nikupegha wenga. <verse eid="MAT 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 20:15" />Ghuli, nenga ningupalwa ng'ogha kughola vila ningupala na hindu ghangu mweni? Ghuli wenga ungulola wifu kwaikiva nenga nighola ulungwana?”<verse eid="MAT 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 20:16" />Yesu akayomola kwa kulonga, “Hinu, wala wenikuwela wa kumwihu watewela wa mtumbulo na wamtumbulo watewela wa kumwihu.”<verse eid="MAT 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angulongela kangi lihanja lya itatu kunani gha kihu kyaki</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Maliku 10:32-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Luka 18:31-34</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 20:17" />Yesu pamonga na wavulwa ghaki watangala wawelili wakiyenda ku Yelusalemu, na wakiva wakali wakityanga mnjila, mweni akawatola wala wavulwa ghaki ikumi na ivili chonju na wala waghangi na akatumbula kulongela na weni, <verse eid="MAT 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 20:18" />“Myughanili! Tunguyenda Yelusalemu, na haku Mwana wa Mundu ateyeghwa kwa watambika wakulu pamonga na wavula wa laghililo na weni watemtosa kihu. <verse eid="MAT 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 20:19" />Watemyegha kwa wandu wammanya ng'ogha Sapanga ili apughanywi, atovwi hyatu na kuvambwa, ila lichuwa lya itatu atehinduliwa.”<verse eid="MAT 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nyongo angupala wana ghaki wapeghwi ukulu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 10:35-45">Maliku 10:35-45</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 20:20" />Lichuwa limonga nyongo wa akina Zebidayu akamhikila Yesu pamonga na wana ghaki, akamtundamila manung'una kuulongolo ghaki na kumluwa kindu.<verse eid="MAT 20:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 20:21" />Yesu akamkonya, “Ungupala kyani?” Yula nyongo akamlongela,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 20:21">“Ningupala ulaghilile hagha wana ghangu waivili, mmonga apati kutama mbandi ghako gha liwoku lya kuliyila na mmonga mbandi ghako gha shotu ku Unkosi ghako.”<verse eid="MAT 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 20:22" />Yesu akayanga, “Mwenga mmanya ng'ogha mnguluwa kyani. Ghuli, mnguwesa kunyweghela kitekelu nitenyweghala nenga?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 20:22">Wakamyanga, “Tunguwesa.”<verse eid="MAT 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 20:23" />Yesu akawalongela, “Chakaka mtenyweghela kitekelu kya nenga kya mahakilo, ila kutama kuliwoku lya kuliyila au shotu kwa nenga hali lihengu lya nenga ng'ogha, mghalu hau watepeghwa wala wayandaliliwi kala na Tati ghangu.”<verse eid="MAT 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 20:24" />Wala wavulwa waghangi ikumi pawayughanila ghala, wakawahyomela wala walongo waivili. <verse eid="MAT 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 20:25" />Ila Yesu akawakema wogha kwa pamonga na kuwalongela, “Mngumanya yiwa vilongosi wa mlima wogha wangulongosa wandu ghao kwa makakala, na wakulunga hagha wanguwatumikisa wandu ghao. <verse eid="MAT 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 20:26" />Ikotoho kuwela nagha kwa mwenga, ila mwenikupala kuwela mkulu paghati gha mwenga angupalwa aweli mtumikila wa wogha. <verse eid="MAT 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 20:27" />Hinu mundu yula mwenikupala kuwoneka wa mtumbulo kwa mwenga angupalwa aweli mhusutu kwa mwenga. <verse eid="MAT 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 20:28" />Handa iwela kwa Mwana wa Mundu kahika ng'ogha ili atumikilwi, bali kuwatumikila na kuhumisa ukomu ghaki kwa kuwakombola wandu watangala.”<verse eid="MAT 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anguwalamisa wangalikulola waivili</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Maliku 10:46-52</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Luka 18:35-43</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 20:29" />Yesu pawelili anguhuka kummbwani wa Yeliku, wandu watangala limkovekelili. <verse eid="MAT 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 20:30" />Hinu wangalikulola waivili watamili mmbali na njila, pawayughanila yiwa Yesu awelili angutyanga, wakaguta lilowi wakilonga, “Bambu, Mwana wa Daudi, utuwoneli luhungu!”<verse eid="MAT 20:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 20:31" />Lila lipinga lya wandu likawakalipila na kuwalongela wanyamali. Ila weni wakayongesa kuguta kwa lilowi nesu, “Bambu, Mwana wa Daudi, utuwoneli luhungu!”<verse eid="MAT 20:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 20:32" />Yesu akagholoka, akawakema na kuwakonya, “Mngupala niwagholeli niki?”<verse eid="MAT 20:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 20:33" />Wakamyanga, “Bambu, tungupala kulola.”<verse eid="MAT 20:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 20:34" />Yesu akawawonela luhungu, akawayavisa mihu ghao, na palapala wakawesa kulola, na weni wakamkovikela.<verse eid="MAT 20:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="MAT 21" />
  <para style="s">Yesu anguyingila Yelusalemu kunu wandu wakimkuwila vilulu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Maliku 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luka 19:28-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yohana 12:12-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 21:1" />Yesu na wavulwa ghaki pawawelili pabehi gha kuhika Yelusalemu, wakahika Betifage kulitumbi lya Mizeituni, ndiwa akawalaghila wavulwa ghaki waivili, <verse eid="MAT 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 21:2" />akawalongela, “Myendi mbaka kukimbwani kyeni kuwela kuulongolo gha mwenga na mtemlola punda kawopwa na mwana punda kawopwa mmbali ghaki. Muwawopoli na muwayeghi kwa nenga. <verse eid="MAT 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 21:3" />Na paikawela mundu yeyosi kawakonya kwa kyani mnguwatola, mumlongeli, ‘Bambu anguwapala,’ na mweni atewalekesela muwahuyisi njenji.”<verse eid="MAT 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 21:4" />Mghalu hau uhumilili ili ghala yalongilwi na mlota wa Sapanga yatimili.<verse eid="MAT 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 21:5" />“Walongeli wandu wa Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:5">nkosi ghako anguhika hinaa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:5">Ni mlungwana kanguhika akiwela kalikala kunani gha mbunda, avili na mwana ghaki msokombi.”<verse eid="MAT 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 21:6" />Hinu, wala wavulwa wakayenda wakaghola handa Yesu awalaghilili. <verse eid="MAT 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 21:7" />Wakamyegha yula mbunda na mwana ghaki, wakayanjasa nguu zyau kunani ghao na Yesu akatama kunani ghaki. <verse eid="MAT 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 21:8" />Lipinga likulunga lya wandu likayanjasa nguu zyao mnjila, na wandu waghangi wakadumula viputila vya mibiki wakayanjasa mnjila. <verse eid="MAT 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 21:9" />Lila lipinga lya wandu lyeni kumlongolela na lila lyenikumkovekela likaguta lilowi, “Asifilwi Mwana wa Daudi! Ahighilwi hayu anguhika kwa lihina lya Bambu! Asifilwi Sapanga kunani!”<verse eid="MAT 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 21:10" />Yesu pawelili anguyingila ku Yelusalemu, wandu wogha wa mmbwani wakawela na holu, wandu wakakonyana, “Hayu ni ghani?”<verse eid="MAT 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 21:11" />Wandu kulila lipinga wakalonga, “Hayu ni Yesu, yula mlota kuhuma ku Nazaleti mmbwani wa Galilaya.”<verse eid="MAT 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anguyenda kulighuta lya Sapanga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Maliku 11:15-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Luka 19:45-48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Yohana 2:13-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 21:12" />Hinu, Yesu akayingila kuliugha mlighuta lya Sapanga, akawawinga panji wandu wawelili wanguwusa na kuhemela hindu mghati mwa lighuta lya Sapanga, akaghalambula mesa sya wala wawelili wangupeghana mapesa, na vitamilo vya wala wawelili wanguwusa ngunda. <verse eid="MAT 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 21:13" />Akawalongela, “Iyandikwa ku Mayandiko gha Sapanga, lighuta lyangu litekemwa lighuta lya kuyupila. Ila mwenga mghola yiwa mbaku gha wapokola.”<verse eid="MAT 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 21:14" />Wangalikulola na walemafu waghangi wakamyendela kula mlighuta lya Sapanga, na mweni Yesu akawalamisa. <verse eid="MAT 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 21:15" />Hinu watambika wakulu na wavula wa laghililo pawayalolili makangasu ayagholili Yesu, na kangi wana wanung'una pawawelili wanguguta lilowi mlighuta wakilonga, “Asifilwi Mwana wa Daudi,” Wakahyoma. <verse eid="MAT 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 21:16" />Hinu wakamlongela, “Ghuli, unguyughanila ng'ogha haki wangukilongela?” Yesu akawayanga, “Hina, ninguyughanila! Ghuli mpatili ng'ogha kusoma Mayandiko hagha?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:16">‘Kuhuma kumilomo gha wana wanung'una na wanachali wenga Sapanga ungusifilwa?’”<verse eid="MAT 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 21:17" />Hinu, akawaleka akahuma panji gha mmbwani na kuyenda Besania, akaghonja kula.<verse eid="MAT 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anguulongelela mahakata libiki lyeni kulela tini</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 11:12-14">Maliku 11:12-14</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 11:20-24">20-24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 21:18" />Yesu pawelili anguhuya kumbwani malawila pee, akawela na njala. <verse eid="MAT 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 21:19" />Aliwonili libiki lya mtini limonga mmbali gha njila, akaliyendela, ila kalola ng'ogha chochosi bali mahamba hela. Hinu, akaulapila, “Ukotoho kulela kangi matungula machuva hyogha bila mwihu!” palapala hula mtini ukanyala.<verse eid="MAT 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 21:20" />Wavulwa pawalolili ghala wakalikangasa wakalonga, “Kwakyani mtini hau unyala bwitu?”<verse eid="MAT 21:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 21:21" />Yesu akawayanga, “Chakaka ninguwalongela, ikiva mtewela na ukwinila na mkawela ng'ogha na holu mnguwesa kughola nagha na hata mkililongela litumbi hali, ‘Utupuki na ukataghwi mmbahali,’ itewela nagha. <verse eid="MAT 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 21:22" />Hilahila pamkawela na ukwinila, chochosi mtekiluwa, mtepokela.”<verse eid="MAT 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angukonywa uweso ghaki</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Maliku 11:27-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Luka 20:1-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 21:23" />Yesu ayingilili mlighuta lya Sapanga, akawela anguvula. Pawelili anguvula, watambika wakulu na wagogolo wa wandu wakamkonya, “Ungughola mighalu hagha kwa uweso wa ghani? Ghani kakupegha uweso hau?”<verse eid="MAT 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 21:24" />Yesu akawayanga, “Na nenga nitewakonya lilando limonga, na paikawela mteniyanga, hinu na nenga nitewalongela ningughola mighalu hai kwa uweso wa ghani. <verse eid="MAT 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 21:25" />Ubatisu wa Yohanauhumili kugha? Ghuli, uhumili kundumba au kwa wandu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:25">Wakatumbula kukonyana weni kwa weni na kulonga, “Patutelonga uhumili kundumba atetukonya, hinu kwakyani muukwinila ng'ogha?” <verse eid="MAT 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 21:26" />Na patutelonga, “Uhumili kwa wandu, tungutila lipinga lya wandu kwaikiva wogha wangujumila yiwa Yohanani mlota wa Sapanga.” <verse eid="MAT 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 21:27" />Hinu, wakamyanga, “Tumanya ng'ogha!” Na mweni Yesu akawalongela,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:27">“Na nenga kangi nitewalongela ng'ogha ningughola mighalu hai kwa uweso wa ghani.”<verse eid="MAT 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mlandanu wa wana waivili walumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 21:28" />“Mwenga mnguliwachila niki, mundu mmonga awelili na wana waivili walumi. Akamlongela yula wa mtumbula, ‘Mwana ghangu, lelu uyendi ukagholi lihengu kukitawa kya mizabibu.’ <verse eid="MAT 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 21:29" />Yula mwana ghaki akamyanga, ‘Nema!’ Ila kuulongolu akaghalambula mawachilo ghaki, akayenda kughola lihengu. <verse eid="MAT 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 21:30" />Yula Tati akamlongela mwana ghaki wa ipili hila hila, na mweni akamyanga, ‘Ena tati!’ Ila kayenda ng'ogha kulihengu. <verse eid="MAT 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 21:31" />Ghuli, ni ghani paghati gha hagha wavili kaghola vila apalili Tati ghaki?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:31">Wakamyanga, “Yula mwana wa utumbula.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:31">Hinu, Yesu akawalongela, “Chakaka ninguwalongela, wakungula usulu na waghola ngongola watelongola kuyingila kuunkosi wa Sapanga yambila gha mwenga. <verse eid="MAT 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 21:32" />Kwaikiva Yohanaahikili kwa mwenga akawalangiha njila gha maha, ila mwenga mumkwinila ng'ogha, bali wakungula usulu na waghola ngongola wakamkwinila. Hata badili gha kulola hagha hyogha mleka ng'ogha mahakata na kumhyukila Sapanga.”<verse eid="MAT 21:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mlandano wa watukutula kulitawa lya misabibu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Maliku 12:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Luka 20:9-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 21:33" />Yesu akalonga, “Mhyoghanili malandano ghangi. Mundu mmonga mweni litawa atukutulili misabibu, akalitindililila likuta, akahimba lyowu lya kugholela divai, na akachenga kindangawala kya kugholokelela, hinu akalikodisa kwa watukutula na mweni akatumbula mwanja mbaka mlima wa kutali.” <verse eid="MAT 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 21:34" />Lipindi lya mabenu palihika, akawalaghila watumikila ghaki kwa wala watukutula, ili watoli lihomosu lyaki lya mabenu. <verse eid="MAT 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 21:35" />Wala watukutula wakawakamula wala watumikila, mmonga wakamtova, na ghangi wakamkoma na ghangi kangi wakamtova maganga. <verse eid="MAT 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 21:36" />Yula mundu akawayegha kangi watumikila waghangi, watangala kupiti wala wa lyanja lya utumbula. Wala watukutula wakawagholela hilahila. <verse eid="MAT 21:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 21:37" />Mwihu ghaki akamyegha mwana ghaki kunu akililonga, “Watemtundamila mwanaghangu.” <verse eid="MAT 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 21:38" />Ila wala watukula pawamlolili mwana ghaki wakalongelana weni kwa weni, “Hayu ndiwa mlihi, tumkomi ili tutoli ulihi ghaki!” <verse eid="MAT 21:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 21:39" />Hinu, wakamkamula, wakamuhumisa panji gha lila litawa lya mizabibu, wakamkoma.<verse eid="MAT 21:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 21:40" />Yesu akakonya, “Hinu, lipindi mweni litawa lya mizabibu paatehika, atewagholela kyani wala watukutula?”<verse eid="MAT 21:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 21:41" />Weni wakamyanga, “Atewakoma wogha wahakata, na lila litawa atewapegha watukutula waghangi wa kumpegha lihomosu lyaki lya mabeno lipindi lya mabeno.”<verse eid="MAT 21:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 21:42" />Yesu akawalongela, “Ghuli, msoma ng'ogha mghalu hau ku Mayandiko?”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:42">Yeni kulonga, “Liganga walilemili wachenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:42">hinaa liwela liganga lya maha lya kitamilo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:42">Bambu ndiwa agholili mghalu hau,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:42">na lyeni ni lya kukangasa nesu kwa twenga!”<verse eid="MAT 21:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 21:43" />“Kila ningukimaanisa ni haki,” “Unkosi wa Sapanga utehumiswa kwa mwenga na kupeghwa wenikuwela Wayahudi ng'ogha hula unguwesa kulela matungula.” <verse eid="MAT 21:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 21:44" />Hilahila akalonga, “Yeyosi ateguwila kunani gha liganga hali atedumuka vipandi vipandi, na yula ateguwilwa na lyeni, litemhyagha.”<verse eid="MAT 21:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 21:45" />Watambika wakulu na Mafalisayo pawayughanilili hila milandano ghaki Yesu, wakamanya yiwa awelili anguwalonga weni. <verse eid="MAT 21:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 21:46" />Wakahakula njila gha kumkamula ila wakatila lila lipinga lya wandu kwaikiva wandu wammanyili Yesu yiwa ni mlota wa Sapanga.<verse eid="MAT 21:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="MAT 22" />
  <para style="s">Mlandano wa mhambu wa uposo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 14:15-24">Luka 14:15-24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 22:1" />Yesu akalonga kangi na weni kwa kutumila milandano, <verse eid="MAT 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 22:2" />“Unkosi wa kundumba ulandine na nkosi amyandalilile mwana ghaki mhambu wa uposo.” <verse eid="MAT 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 22:3" />Akawalaghila watumikila ghaki kuwakema wala wawelili wakemwa kumhambu, ila wala wakemilwi walemili kuhika. <verse eid="MAT 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 22:4" />Hinu akawalaghila kangi watumikila ghangi, akalonga, “muwalongeli wala wakemilwi kumhambu mhambu ghangu uyandalwa kala, nihinja kala ng'ombi dumi na ng'ombi wanung'una wakamala ng'ogha weni kunonela.” <verse eid="MAT 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 22:5" />Ila weni wahika ng'ogha, wakayenda zyao, mmonga kulitawa lyake na mghangi kumahengu ghaki, <verse eid="MAT 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 22:6" />wamonga gha weni wakawakamula wala watumikila ghaki wakawatova na kuwakoma. <verse eid="MAT 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 22:7" />Yula nkosi akahyoma, akawalaghila watovangondo ghaki ili wakawakomi wala wakoma wandu na kuuyalamisa mmbwani ghao kwa lyoto. <verse eid="MAT 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 22:8" />“Hinu akawalongela watumikila ghaki, mhambu wa uposo uyandalwa kala ila wala wakemilwi kulyegha wayitikilile ng'ogha kuyenda.” <verse eid="MAT 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 22:9" />Hinu myendi, “kunjila na wogha wala mtewalola muwakemi wahiki kumhambu.” <verse eid="MAT 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 22:10" />Wala watumikila wakahuka, wakayenda mnjila, wakawakungula wandu wogha wawalolile, wahakata na wamaha. Mlighuta lya mhambu kukamema wahenja.<verse eid="MAT 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 22:11" />“Nkosi paayingila kuwalola wahenja akamlola mundu mmonga akiva kavala ng'ogha nguu zya mhambu wa uposo. <verse eid="MAT 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 22:12" />Nkosi akamkonya, ‘Ghanja, uyingilighuli hamu ukiva uvala ng'ogha nguu zya mhambu?’ Ila mweni akatama nuu. <verse eid="MAT 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 22:13" />Hinu nkosi akawalongela watumikila, ‘Mumuwope maghulu na mawoko mkamtaghi panji mulwiha, kula atelila na kuhyagha malinu.’”<verse eid="MAT 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 22:14" />Yesu akayomola kwa kulonga, “Wandu weni kukemwa ni watangala, ila weni kuhaghulwa ni mayaghani.”<verse eid="MAT 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angukonywa kunani gha kuhipa usulu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Maliku 12:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Luka 20:20-26</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 22:15" />Hinu Mafalisayo wakayenda zyao, wakakonyana wagholi niki ili wamkamuli Yesu kwa milando ghaki. <verse eid="MAT 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 22:16" />Hinu, wakawalaghila wavulwa ghao pamonga na kipinga kya Helode. wakamkonya, “Mvula, tungumanya yiwa wenga ni mundu wa maha, na unguvula njila gha Sapanga gha wandu kughola ghala gha maha, na ungumtila ng'ogha mundu yoyosi, kwaikiva ungulola ng'ogha ukulu wa mundu. <verse eid="MAT 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 22:17" />Hinu utulongeli, tungupalwa kuhipa usulu kwa nkosi Kaisali? au ng'ogha?”<verse eid="MAT 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 22:18" />Ila Yesu amanyili lukani lwa weni lihakata akawalongela, “Mwenga wandu wa mbindingu kwa kyani mngunitegha? <verse eid="MAT 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 22:19" />Mnilangusili ligwala lya kuhipa usulu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 22:19">Na weni wakamlangusila ligwala. <verse eid="MAT 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 22:20" />Hinu, Yesu akawakonya, “Wusu na lihina hai ni vya ghani?”<verse eid="MAT 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 22:21" />Wakamyanga, “Ni gha nkosi kaisali.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 22:21">Hinu Yesu akawalongela,“Hinu, gha Kaisali mumpeghi Kaisali, na gha Sapanga mumpeghi Sapanga.”<verse eid="MAT 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 22:22" />Pawayughanilili nagha wakalikangasa wakamleka wakayenda zyao.<verse eid="MAT 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angukonywa habali gha uhinduki</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Maliku 12:18-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Luka 20:27-40</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 22:23" />Lichuwa lilalila, wamonga wa Masadukayu wala wangulonga wahovili wanguhinduka ng'ogha wamyendelili Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 22:24" />Hinu, wakamlongela, “Mvula, Musa atulongilili mundu amposili mdala pakahova na kaleka ng'ogha mwana, ni lasima mlongu ghaki amposi hayu mdala ahovitiliwi, ili ampatili mlongu ghaki wana. <verse eid="MAT 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 22:25" />Hinu, pawelili na walongo isaba paghati gha twenga. Yula wa mtumbulo akaposa mdala, akahova akawela ng'ogha na mwana, akamlekela mlongu ghaki yula mdala. <verse eid="MAT 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 22:26" />Ikawela hilahila kwa mlongu waivili, na waitatu, mbaka waisaba. <verse eid="MAT 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 22:27" />Mwihu wa hyogha yula mdala na mweni akahova. <verse eid="MAT 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 22:28" />Hinu ghuli, lichuwa lila lya uhinduki, yula mdala atewela mhumbu wa ghani? Paghati gha walongo wala isaba, kwaikiva wala wogha wawelili wamposa yula mdala.”<verse eid="MAT 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 22:29" />Yesu akawayanga, “Mwenga mghola maha ng'ogha kwaikiva mmanya ng'ogha Mayandiko gha Sapanga na hata makakala gha Sapanga. <verse eid="MAT 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 22:30" />Kwaikiva wahovili pawatehinduka wateposa ng'ogha wala kuposwa, watewela handa watumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga. <verse eid="MAT 22:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 22:31" />Ila kwa hula mghalu wa wandu kuhinduka, msomili ng'ogha yala awalongilile Sapanga? Akilonga, <verse eid="MAT 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 22:32" />‘Nenga ni Sapanga wa Ibulahimu, Sapanga wa Isaka na Sapanga wa Yakobu!’ Hinu mweni ng'ogha Sapanga wa wahovili, bali ni Sapanga wa wavile wakomu.” <verse eid="MAT 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 22:33" />Wala wandu watangala pawahyoghanila nagha wakalikangasa nesu kwa mavulo ghaki.<verse eid="MAT 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Laghililo likulu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 12:28-34">Maliku 12:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luka 10:25-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 22:34" />Mafalisayo pawayughanila yiwa Yesu awelili kawanyamalisa Masadukayu, hinu weni wakalikungula pamonga. <verse eid="MAT 22:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 22:35" />Mmonga, wa mafalisayu mweni kumanya laghililo, akamkonya Yesu kwa kumyesa, <verse eid="MAT 22:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 22:36" />“Mvula, ni laghililo ghani likulunga kupiti amuli zyogha?”<verse eid="MAT 22:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 22:37" />Yesu akamyanga, “‘Mpali Bambu Sapanga ghako kwa moyu ghako wogha na kwa mpumulo ghako wogha pamonga na malangu ghako hyogha’. <verse eid="MAT 22:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 22:38" />Hali ndiwa laghililo likulunga na lya utumbulo. <verse eid="MAT 22:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 22:39" />Na gha ipili ingulandana na hai. ‘Mpali myako handa ungulipala mweni’. <verse eid="MAT 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 22:40" />Malaghilo hyogha gha Musa na mavulo gha walota yangupapwa na hagha malaghililo maivili.”<verse eid="MAT 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kilisito ni masia</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Maliku 12:35-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Luka 20:41-44</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 22:41" />Mafalisayo pawalikungula pamonga, Yesu akawakonya, <verse eid="MAT 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 22:42" />“Mnguliwachila kyani kwa habali gha Kilisito mkombola? Mweni ni mwana wa ghani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 22:42">Weni wakamyanga, “Mweni ni mwana wa Daudi.”<verse eid="MAT 22:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 22:43" />Yesu akawalongela, “Inguwesaghuli hinu Daudi akilongoswa na Mpumulo wa Sapanga kumkema Yesu Bambu, akilonga,<verse eid="MAT 22:43" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 22:44" />‘Bambu amlongilili Bambu ghangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 22:44">Utami upandi ghangu wa kuliyila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 22:44">mbaka pala paniwasinda wahakata ghako.’ <verse eid="MAT 22:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 22:45" />Hinu, ikiva Daudi angumkema kilisito ‘Bambu,’ hinaa inguwesekanaghuli Kilisito aweli mwana wa Daudi?”<verse eid="MAT 22:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 22:46" />Kwahela mundu yeyosi awesili kumyanga Yesu lilando. Na kuhuma lichuwa lila kwahela mundu ayesili kumkonya lilando.<verse eid="MAT 22:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="MAT 23" />
  <para style="s">Yesu anguwang'ung'ulikila wavula wa laghililo na Mafalisayo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 12:38-39">Maliku 12:38-39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:43-46">Luka 11:43-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-46">20:45-46</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 23:1" />Hinu Yesu akayalongela mapinga gha wandu pamonga na wavulwa ghaki weni kuwela pala. <verse eid="MAT 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 23:2" />Wavula wa laghililo na Mafalisayo ndiwa wapeghilwi uweso wa kughalambula laghililo lya Musa. <verse eid="MAT 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 23:3" />Hinu inguwapala muwatundamili na kughola vila wanguwalongela mgholi. Ila mkotoho kukovekela yala wanguyaghola kwaikiva wangughola ng'ogha yala wanguyatangasa. <verse eid="MAT 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 23:4" />Weni uwopa mihigu mitopehu na kuwatwika wandu mmakombi, ila weni wawesa ng'ogha kuyavisa hata kwa kyala kuipapa. <verse eid="MAT 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 23:5" />Weni wangughola matendu ghao hyogha ili wandu wawalole. Na kangi wanguvala ngoi zyeni mayandiko gha laghililo kunani gha wuso na kumawoku, kangi wangutanula vihundu vyeni kuning'inila kulihabiti lyau. <verse eid="MAT 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 23:6" />Wangupala kutama kuvitamilu vya kuulongolo kumhambu na vila vitamilu vigholilwi maha nesu kulighuta lya kukonganika Wayahudi. <verse eid="MAT 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 23:7" />Wangupala kujambuswa na wandu kwa kutundamilwa msoku na kupala kukemwa na wandu, “Mvula.” <verse eid="MAT 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 23:8" />Ila mwenga wandu wakotoho kuwakema, “Mvula,” Kwaikiva mvula wa mwenga ni mmonga hela, na mwenga wogha ni wavulwa ghangu. <verse eid="MAT 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 23:9" />Mkotoho kumkema mundu yeyosi “Tati” haku kumlimawogha, kwaikiva Tati wa mwenga ni mmonga hela, yula mwenikuwela kundumba. <verse eid="MAT 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 23:10" />Kangi mkotoho kukemwa “Vilongosi,” kwaikiva kilongosi wa mwenga ni mmonga hela, na mweni ni Kilisito. <verse eid="MAT 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 23:11" />Mundu yeyosi mwenikupala kuwela kilongosi wa mwenga, aweli mundu wa kunyenyekela na kuwatumikila wandu waghangi. <verse eid="MAT 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 23:12" />Mundu yeyosi atejiyinula Sapanga atemuhulusa, na yula atejihulusa Sapanga atemuyinula.<verse eid="MAT 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angung'ung'ulikila umbindingu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 12:40">Maliku 12:40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:39-42">Luka 11:39-42</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 11:44">44</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 11:52">52</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:47">20:47</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 23:13" />“Mtenyokolwa mwenga wavula wa laghililo na Mafalisayo, wenikuwela wambindingu! Mngutata mlyango wa unkosi wa kundumba kuulongolo gha mihu gha wandu. Kunu mwenga mwaweni mnguyingila ng'ogha mghati, wala kuwalekesela wenikupala kuyingila wayingili.” <verse eid="MAT 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 23:14" />Mtenyokolwa mwenga wavula wa laghililo na Mafalisayo, wenikuwela wambindingu! Mngulyegha vya wahoviliwi na walumi ghao, kwa kujighola yiwa walungwana kwa kuyupa mayupu matali. Kwaikiva gha nagha mtepokela unyokolu mkulunga nesu.<verse eid="MAT 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 23:15" />“Mtenyokolwa mwenga wavula wa laghililo na Mafalisayo, wandu wambindingu! Mnguyenda mwanja mbahali na kumlima kuyumu ili mumpati mundu mmonga aweli mkovekela wa dini gha Kiyahudi. Pamumpata kala, mngumghola kuwela mundu wa kuyenda mlyoto lijimika ng'ogha handa mwenga mwaweni.”<verse eid="MAT 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 23:16" />“Mtenyokolwa mwenga vilongosi wangalikulola! Mwenga mnguvula yiwa mundu pakalapa kwa kilapu kya Lighuta lya Sapanga kilapu haki kyahela makakala, ila yula atelapa kwa zahabu gha Lighuta lya Sapanga kilapu haki kingumkola.” <verse eid="MAT 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 23:17" />Mwenga mngalikulola wasihisihi! Ni niki kikulu nesu. Zahabu au Lighuta lya Sapanga lyenikughola hai zahabu ijumilwi kuulongolo gha Sapanga? <verse eid="MAT 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 23:18" />Kangi mnguvula yiwa mundu pakalapa kwa kihanja kya kuyeghela litambiku haki kilapo ng'ogha, ila mundu pakalapa kwa litambiku lyeni kuvikwa kunani gha kihanja haki, hayu kawopwa kwa kilapu haki. <verse eid="MAT 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 23:19" />Mwenga mngalikulola nesu! Ni niki hai yeni kuwela gha maha nesu, hila hupo, au kihanja kila kingughola litambiku lijumilwi kuulongolo gha Sapanga? <verse eid="MAT 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 23:20" />Hinu mundu mwenikulapa kwa kihanja kya kuyeghela litambiku hayu kalapa kuhaki kihanja na vyogha vyeni kuwela kunani ghaki. <verse eid="MAT 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 23:21" />Na mweni kulapa kwa Lighuta lya Sapanga, hulapa kwa lila Lighuta lya Sapanga na kwa hayu angutama mghati ghaki. <verse eid="MAT 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 23:22" />Na yula angulapa kwa kunani kwa Sapanga hayu kalapa kukitamilo kya Sapanga, na kwa hayu mweni kutama kunani ghaki.<verse eid="MAT 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 23:23" />“Mtenyokolwa mwenga wavula wa laghililo na Mafalisayo, wandu wambindingu! Mnguhomosa wandu lilundila lya ikumi, hata mahamba yeni kunungila maha nesu, bizali na msusa, na kunu mnguleka mighalu gha maha gha laghililo handa vila haki, luhungu, na kukwinila hagha ndiwa mpalilwi nesu kuyakovikela bila kuisemwa ghala maghangi.” <verse eid="MAT 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 23:24" />Mwenga Vilongosi mngalikulola! Mnguhusia wangosi kukinyweghelo kunu mnguleka ngamia, na mngumila!<verse eid="MAT 23:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 23:25" />“Mtenyokolwa mwenga wavula wa laghililo na Mafalisayo mwenga wandu wambindingu! Mnguwofula kitekelu na bakuli kwa panji, ila mghati mnguleka kukimema upokola na uwimi.” <verse eid="MAT 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 23:26" />Mafalisayo ungalikulola! Uwofuli huti kitekelu mghati na panji kutewela maha hilahila.<verse eid="MAT 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 23:27" />“Mtenyokolwa mwenga wavula wa laghililo na Mafalisayo, wambindingu! wenikuwela handa mamambi yalembilwi chokaa kwa panji yanguwoneka maha, ila mghati yamema mihupa gha mundu ahovili na ndaka wekaweka.” <verse eid="MAT 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 23:28" />Hilahila kwa panji mwenga mnguwoneka kwa wandu muwela ng'ogha na sambi, ila kwa mghati mmema umbindingu na uhakata.<verse eid="MAT 23:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Unyokolu unguhika</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 11:47-51">Luka 11:47-51</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 23:29" />“Mtenyokolwa mwenga wavula wa laghililo na Mafalisayo, wambindingu! Mnguchenga mamambi gha walota na kuchengela mamambi gha wandu wa maha.” <verse eid="MAT 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 23:30" />Kangi mwenga mngulonga, “Ikiva twenga tungalikala lipindi lya watati wa twenga, tungalikonganika ng'ogha na weni pakuwakoma walota.” <verse eid="MAT 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 23:31" />Hinu mnguhighilisa maweni yiwa mwenga ni wana wa wandu wawakomili walota. <verse eid="MAT 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 23:32" />Kwa nagha, myendelesi lihengu liwelili likigholwa na watati wa mwenga lya kuwakoma walota! <verse eid="MAT 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 23:33" />Mwenga kiwelekwa kya njoka wenikuwela na sumu! Mtewesaghuli kuhyeta utoso wa kulyoto lijimika ng'ogha bila mwihu? <verse eid="MAT 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 23:34" />Kwaikiva gha nagha ninguwayeghela walota na wandu weni luhala na wavula, mtewakoma na mtewawamba kulipingika wamonga ghao, na waghangi mtewatova hyatu kumighuta gha kukonganika Wayahudi na kuwahakula kukila mmbwani. <verse eid="MAT 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 23:35" />Hinu mighalu hai hyogha itewela kunani gha mwenga kwaikiva gha mwahi wogha wa wandu wa maha uyitilwi kunani gha lutupi. Ena kuhuma , pala uyitika mwahi wa Abeli mwenikuwela kahela uhakata, mbaka hula wa Zakaria, mwana wa Barakia, mwenikuwela mumkomili kulighuta lya Sapanga paghati gha mahala pajumilwa na Sapanga na luhanja lwa saba. <verse eid="MAT 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 23:36" />Ninguwalongela chakaka, kiwelekwa haki kitepokela unyokolu kwaikiva gha mighalu hai.<verse eid="MAT 23:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anguulilila mbwani wa Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 13:34-35">Luka 13:34-35</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 23:37" />“Mwenga wandu wa Yelusalemu! mwenga wandu wa Yelusalemu munguwakoma walota na kuwatova maganga wala walaghililwi kwa wenga. Mihanja mininga niyesili kuwakungula wana ghako kwa nenga, handa vila nguku angukungula wana ghaki pahi gha mbapatilu zyaki, ila upalili ng'ogha.” <verse eid="MAT 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 23:38" />Mloli Sapanga ateleka Lighuta lya mwenga lipala. <verse eid="MAT 23:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 23:39" />Ningukulongela, mtenilola ng'ogha kangi mbaka lipindi mtelonga, “Ahighilwi hayu anguhika kwa lihina lya Bambu.”<verse eid="MAT 23:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="MAT 24" />
  <para style="s">Yesu angulongela kubomolwa kwa Lighuta lya Sapanga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 13:1-2">Maliku 13:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5-6">Luka 21:5-6</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 24:1" />Yesu akahuma Kulighuta lya Sapanga na paawelili akiyenda zyaki, wayitikila ghaki wakamyendela, wakamlangiha majengu gha Lighuta lya Sapang. <verse eid="MAT 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 24:2" />Yesu akawalongela, “Ghuli, Mngulola hagha hyogha? Chakaka ninguwalongela, kwahela hata liganga litehighala baha kunani palimonga, kila kindu kitebomolwa.”<verse eid="MAT 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lung'ai na maghaso</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Maliku 13:3-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:7-19">Luka 21:7-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 24:3" />Yesu pawelili katama kunani mwa litumbi lya mizeituni, wavulwa ghaki wakamyendela ili waweli weka yau mahala pala, wakamkonya, “Tulongeli mighalu hai itehumila ligha? Ni kilangihi kyani kitetulangiha kuhika kwa wenga na kilangihi kya mwihu wa mlima wogha ni niki?”<verse eid="MAT 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 24:4" />Yesu akawayanga, “Mlihungi mundu akotoho kuwangonga.” <verse eid="MAT 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 24:5" />Wandu watangala watehumila wakitumila lihina lya nenga na weni watewayaghamisa wandu watangala. <verse eid="MAT 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 24:6" />Mteyughanila mighalu gha ngondo na kulongelwa kuwela kwa ngondo, ila mkotoho kung'ung'ulika, kwaikiva hagha lasima yuhumili, ila mwihu ghaki utewela wambila. <verse eid="MAT 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 24:7" />Wandu wa mlima mmonga watetovana na wandu wa mlima mghangi, na wandu wa unkosi mmonga utetovana na wandu wa unkosi ghangi. Amonga gha mahala kutewela na njala na mihihimilo kumahala wekaweka gha mlima wogha. <verse eid="MAT 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 24:8" />Hagha hyogha ni handa mtumbulo wa utungu wa kuiwopola mwana.<verse eid="MAT 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 24:9" />Hinu Yesu akayendelela kulonga, “Watewahumisa ili mhakilwi na kukomwa. Na milima hyogha itewahyomela kwaikiva gha kunikwinila nenga.” <verse eid="MAT 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 24:10" />Lipindi hali, wandu watangala wateleka kukwinila kwau, na weni watehyukana kila mmonga na myake na kuhyomelana. <verse eid="MAT 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 24:11" />Hinu, watehumila walota watangala wa uhwangi, watewalongela mighalu gha uhwangi wandu watangala. <verse eid="MAT 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 24:12" />Kangi upalo wa wandu watangala utepungula kwaikiva sambi sitewela siyongeseka nesu. <verse eid="MAT 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 24:13" />Ila yula mundu ategangamala mbaka mwihu ndiwa atelokoka. <verse eid="MAT 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 24:14" />Ila, pambila gha mwihu kuhika, hai Habali Maha gha unkosi wa Sapanga itetangaswa kogha ili wandu wogha wapati kuimanya.<verse eid="MAT 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lung'ai likulunga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 13:14-23">Maliku 13:14-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Luka 21:20-24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 24:15" />“Pamlola mghalu wa kutisa weni kuyegha uyalamiso ugholoka Ukaya kwa Sapanga, handa ailongile Danieli mlota wa Sapanga, yula mweni kusoma anguwesa kumanya mighalu hai.” <verse eid="MAT 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 24:16" />Hinu, wala wawelili Yudasia na watuilili mmitumbi. <verse eid="MAT 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 24:17" />Mweni kuwela kunani gha lipaghala lya lighuta lyaki akotoho kughuluka kutola kindu chochosi kuhuma mulighuta lyaki. <verse eid="MAT 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 24:18" />Na yula mwenikuwela mlitawa akotoho kuhuya ukaya kutola nguu zyaki. <verse eid="MAT 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 24:19" />Watenyokolwa wanyongo wenikuwela na ndumbu na wala wanguyongesa kumachuwa hagha! <verse eid="MAT 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 24:20" />Mluwi ili mkotoho bhutuka lipindi lya lupepu au lichuwa lya kupumulila! <verse eid="MAT 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 24:21" />Kwaikiva lipindi hali kutewela na lung'ai likulunga lipatili ng'ogha kuhumila kuhuma mtumbulo wa mlima wogha mbaka hinaa, na wala itehumila ng'ogha kangi. <verse eid="MAT 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 24:22" />Ila Sapanga kapungula kala machuwa hagha, handa angalipungula ng'ogha machuwa hagha kwahela mundu angalilokoka, ila kukovekelana na wahaghulwa ghaki Sapanga kapungula machuwa hagha.<verse eid="MAT 24:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 24:23" />“Hinu, kumachuwa hagha handa mundu yeyosi paawalongela hagha, ‘Kilisito kabaha au kakula,’ mkotoho kumyitikila.” <verse eid="MAT 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 24:24" />Kwaikiva watehumila wandu wenikuikema kilisito waghangi na walota wa uhwangi. Wateghola makangaso makulunga na maloloso gha kuwesa kuwayaghamisa paiwesekana hata wahaghulwa wa Sapanga. <verse eid="MAT 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 24:25" />Mlihungi, nenga niwalongela kala pambila gha mighalu hai kuhumila.<verse eid="MAT 24:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 24:26" />Hinu, Pawawalongela, “Mloli, Kilisito kakuluvagha,” mkotoho kuyenda. Au “Mloli Kilisito kajihigha mghati,” mkotoho kuyitikila. <verse eid="MAT 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 24:27" />Kwaikiva, handa vila lumuli lingulangasa kuhuma kuhumila liujuwa mbaka kuhongela lijuwa, ndiwa kutewela haku kuhika kwa Mwana wa Mundu.<verse eid="MAT 24:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 24:28" />Kwaikiva pala penikuwela lindumbi, ndiwa pala watelikungula wagwasi.<verse eid="MAT 24:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhika kwa Mwana wa Mundu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Maliku 13:24-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Luka 21:25-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 24:29" />Bwitu machuwa hagha gha lung'ahi payayenda, Sapanga ateghalambula lijuwa kuwela lwisa, na mbalamwehi itelangasa ng'ogha na ndondwa ziteguwa kuhuma kunani, hilahila Sapanga atetika makakala gha kundumba. <verse eid="MAT 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 24:30" />Ndiwa, kilangihi kya Mwana wa Mundu kitewoneka kunani, na baha wandu wogha wa mlima wogha watelumbilila. Kwaikiva watemlola Mwana wa Adamu akihika kuhuma kunani gha mahindu gha kundumba na makakala gha ukulu utangala. <verse eid="MAT 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 24:31" />Na mweni atewayegha watumikila ghaki kunu wakikuwa talumbeta, na weni watewakungula wayitikila ghaki kuhuma pandi zyogha njechi zya mlima wogha, kuhuma mwihu mmonga wa kunani mbaka mwihu ghangi.<verse eid="MAT 24:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mlivuli kuhuma kulibiki lya tini</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Maliku 13:28-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Luka 21:29-33</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 24:32" />“Kupitila libiki lya tini mjivuli mlandano ghaki, bwitu lipindi miputila ghaki paitumbula kuwela pyeeku mahamba ghaki, mngumanya yiwa lipindi lya kutukutula lya pabehi.” <verse eid="MAT 24:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 24:33" />Hilahila mwenga pamlola mighalu hai hyogha ingugholeka, mmanyi yiwa kapabehi nesu. <verse eid="MAT 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 24:34" />Ninguwalongela chakaka, kiwelekwa haki kiteyenda ng'ogha pambila gha mighalu hai hyogha kuhumila. <verse eid="MAT 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 24:35" />Kundumba na mlima wogha viteyenda, ila milando hai iteyenda ng'ogha.<verse eid="MAT 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwahela angumanya lichua wala lipindi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 13:32-37">Maliku 13:32-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:26-30">Luka 17:26-30</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 17:34-36">34-36</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 24:36" />“Ila kumanya lichuwa au lipindi hali, kwahela mundu mweni kuwesa kumanya litehika ligha, wala watumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga wala Mwana, ila Tati weka ghaki ndiwa mweni kumanya lichuwa hali.” <verse eid="MAT 24:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 24:37" />Kwaikiva handa iwelili lipindi lya Nuhu, ndiwa itewela kuhika kwa mweni Mwana wa Mundu. <verse eid="MAT 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 24:38" />Kwaikiva lipindi lila yambila gha kufula kwa masi, wandu wawelili wakilyegha na kunywegha, wakiposa na kuposwa mbaka lichuwa lila Nuhu paayingilili kulisafina. <verse eid="MAT 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 24:39" />Wamanyili ng'ogha chochosi mbaka pala kufula kwa masi papakungula vyogha. Havi ndiwa itewela lipindi Mwana wa Adamu paatehika. <verse eid="MAT 24:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 24:40" />Lipindi hali wandu waivili watewela mkitawa, mmonga atetolwa na ghangi atelekwa. <verse eid="MAT 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 24:41" />Wadala waivili watewela wanguhyagha pamonga, mmonga atetolwa na ghangi atelekwa. <verse eid="MAT 24:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 24:42" />“Hinu, mlihungi, kwaikiva mmanyang'ogha lichuwa atehika Bambu wa mwenga.” <verse eid="MAT 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 24:43" />Ila mmanyi mghalu hau, ikiva mweni lighuta angalimanya lipindi ligha mwihi atehika, angalilindila, angalileka kuwonja akaleka lighuta lyaki libomolwi. <verse eid="MAT 24:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 24:44" />Kwaikiva gha nagha, na mwenga mliyandali, kwaikiva Mwana wa Adamu atehika lipindi mmanya ng'ogha.<verse eid="MAT 24:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mlandano wa mtumikila wa chakaka</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 12:41-48">Luka 12:41-48</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 24:45" />Yesu akayendelela kulonga, “Ni ghani hinu avile mtumikila wa chakaka na mweni mawachilo gha maha, yula Bambu ghaki atemvika agholokeli wandu ghaki, awapeghi mulyo kwa lipindi lyaki?” <verse eid="MAT 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 24:46" />Itewela maha handa bambu hayu paatehika atemlola mtumikila ghaki akighola nagha! <verse eid="MAT 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 24:47" />Chakaka ninguwalongela, atemvika mtumikila hayu agholokeli hindu ghaki hyogha. <verse eid="MAT 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 24:48" />Ila handa mtumikila wa chakaka ng'ogha pakajilongelela mmoyu, “Bambu ghangu atehika ng'ogha kwa kuloposela,” <verse eid="MAT 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 24:49" />Hinu akatumbula kuwatova watumikila wayaki, akatumbula kulyegha na kunywegha pamonga na walowela, <verse eid="MAT 24:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 24:50" />Bambu ghaki atehika lichuwa limanyika ng'ogha na lipindi alimanya ng'ogha. <verse eid="MAT 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 24:51" />Atemnyokola nesu na kumtaya mlipinga limonga na wandu wambindingu. Haku atelila na kuhyagha malino.<verse eid="MAT 24:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="MAT 25" />
  <para style="s">Mlandano wa wasikana ikumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 25:1" />Yesu akayendelela kulonga, “Lipindi hali, unkosi wa kundumba utelandana na wahinja ikumi wala watolili limbamba, wakayenda kumpokela Bambu wa mhambu. <verse eid="MAT 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 25:2" />Mhanu paghati gha weni wawelili na malangu ng'ogha na wamhanu wawelili na mawachilo gha maha. <verse eid="MAT 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 25:3" />Wala wawelili na malangu ng'ogha watolili mimbamba, ila watolili ng'ogha na mahuta gha kuyongesela. <verse eid="MAT 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 25:4" />Ila wala wawelili na mawachilo gha maha watolili mahuta musupa ghao gha kuyongesela na mula mlimbamba. <verse eid="MAT 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 25:5" />Kwaikiva bambu mweni kuposa pakahika ng'ogha kwa kuloposela, wala wasikana wogha wakasinzila, wakawonja.<verse eid="MAT 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 25:6" />Uhiku wa mandandu kukawela na lilowi, ‘Mloli, hinu! Bambu mweni kuposa, anguhika hayu, myendi mkampokeli.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 25:7" />Pala wala wasikana wogha wakayimuka, wakavika maha mimbamba ghao. <verse eid="MAT 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 25:8" />Wala wenikuwela ng'ogha malangu ng'ogha wakawalongela wala weni mawachilo gha maha, ‘Mtupeghi mahuta gha mwenga mayaghani kwaikiva mimbamba gha twenga ingujimika.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 25:9" />Ila wala weni mawachilo gha maha wakawalongela, ‘Iwesekana ng'ogha kwaikiva twenga yatetukwila ng'ogha Mbaa myendi mduka mkajihemileli mwaweni!’ <verse eid="MAT 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 25:10" />Hinu, wala wahinja wenikuwela ng'ogha na malangu pawayendili kuhemela mahuta, haku kuhyetu bambu mweni kuposa, na wala wasikana wakalivika maha wakayingila pamonga na mweni kulighuta lya mhambu, hinu mlyango ukawopwa.<verse eid="MAT 25:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 25:11" />Kuulongolo wala wasikana ghangi wakahuya wakakema, ‘Bambu, bambu, utufughulili!’ <verse eid="MAT 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 25:12" />Ila mweni akawayanga, ‘Ninguwalongela chakaka, niwamanya ng'ogha mwenga.’”<verse eid="MAT 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 25:13" />Hinu Yesu akayongesa kulonga, “Mlihungi, kwaikiva mmanyang'ogha lichuwa wala lisaa.”<verse eid="MAT 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mlandano wa watumikila waitatu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 19:11-27">Luka 19:11-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 25:14" />“Kangi Ukosi wa kundumba ni handa mundu apalili kuhuka mwanja, akawakema watumikila ghaki na kuvika hindu ghaki kuugholokela ghao.” <verse eid="MAT 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 25:15" />Mmonga akampegha vihaku vimhano vya migwala na ghangi ampeghili vihaku viivili vya migwala na ghangi kihaku kimonga kya ligwala, kila mmonga kwa uweso ghaki. Hinu mweni akayenda mwanja ghaki. <verse eid="MAT 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 25:16" />Yula apeghilwi vihaku vimhamo vya migwala akayenda kwa kuloposela akaghola biasala akayongesa kangi vihaku vimhano vya migwala. <verse eid="MAT 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 25:17" />Hilahila na yula apeghilwi vihaku viivili vya migwala akayongesa kangi vihaku viivili vya migwala. <verse eid="MAT 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 25:18" />Ila yula apeghilwi kihaku kimonga kya gwala hayu akayenda, akahimba liwumba, akahigha ligwala lya bambu ghaki ampeghili.<verse eid="MAT 25:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 25:19" />“Kwalipindi litali, yula bambu akahuya, akatumbula kuvalanga kipungulili na kiyongesekili kuvihaku vya migwala ghaki.” <verse eid="MAT 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 25:20" />Yula mtumikila apokelili vihaku vimhanu vya mingwala akahika, kunu kayegha vihaku vya migwala vighangi mhanu viyongeseka. Akalonga, “Bambu uvikili kuugholokelo ghangu vihaku vya migwala vimhanu uloli, mbata kangi nyongesa vihaku vya migwala vimhano.” <verse eid="MAT 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 25:21" />Bambu ghaki akamlongela, “Ena ughola maha nesu mtumikila ghangu wa maha. Uwela mundu wa maha kumighalu gha mayaghani, nitekupegha makulunga. Uhiki uhekileli pamonga na Bambu ghako.”<verse eid="MAT 25:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 25:22" />“Yula mtumikila apeghilwi vikaku viivili vya migwala akahika, kunu kapapa vihaku vya migwala viivili vya nyongesa, akalonga, Bambu, unipeghili vihaku viivili vya migwala. Utoli vihaku viivili vya migwala iyongeseka, nipata ivili ghangi.” <verse eid="MAT 25:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 25:23" />Bambu ghaki akamlongela, “Ena, mtumikila wa maha na mundu wa maha. Uwela mundu wa maha kumighalu gha mayaghani, nitekupegha makulunga. Uhiki uhekileli pamonga na Bambu ghako.”<verse eid="MAT 25:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 25:24" />Ila yula mtumikila apeghilwi kihaku kimonga kya gwala akahika, kunu akilonga, “Bambu, ningumanya wenga ni mkalipa nesu, wenga ungubena pala ungukulila ng'ogha, na kukungula pala ukweta ng'ogha.” <verse eid="MAT 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 25:25" />Nitilili nikotoho yaghamisa kihaku kyako, hinu nikahigha kihaku kya ligwala kyako pahi pamhanga. “Hinu utoli kihaku kyaku.”<verse eid="MAT 25:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 25:26" />Bambu ghaki akamlongela, “Wenga ni mtumikila mhakata na mfifu! Ungumanya yiwa nenga ningubena mahala nikulila ng'ogha na ningukungula mahala pala nikweta ng'ogha.” <verse eid="MAT 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 25:27" />Hinu, ikupalili kuvika kihaku kyangu kya ligwala lyangu kubanki, ili panihika mbati kutola hila ghangu na nyongesa ghaki! <verse eid="MAT 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 25:28" />Hinu, mumpokoli mkampeghi yula mweni vihaku ikumi vya ligwala. <verse eid="MAT 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 25:29" />Kwaikiva, mwenikuwela na hindu atepokela na kuyongesewa. Ila yula kahela ng'ogha kindu, hata kila kawela nachu kitepokolwa. <verse eid="MAT 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 25:30" />Na hayu mtumikila wa maha ng'ogha akawalongela, “Mumtaghi panji mlwiha! Haku kutewela na kililo na kuhyagha malinu.”<verse eid="MAT 25:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Utoso wa mwihu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 25:31" />“Mwana wa Mundu paatehika kuukwilikihi ghaki na watumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga wogha pamonga na mweni, baha atetama kunani gha kitamilo kyaki kya ukulu ghaki.” <verse eid="MAT 25:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 25:32" />Wandu wa milima hyogha watelikungula kuulongolo ghaki, na mweni atewabagulisa wandu handa mhungaji angubagulisa kondolu na mbuhi. <verse eid="MAT 25:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 25:33" />Atewavika kondolu mbandi ghaki wa kuliyila na mbuhi mbandi ghaki wa shotu. <verse eid="MAT 25:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 25:34" />“Hinu nkosi atewalongela wala wawelili upandi ghaki wa kuliyila, mhiki mwenga mhighililwi na Tati ghangu, mpokeli unkosi mvikiliwi kuhuma kugholwa kwa mlima wogha.” <verse eid="MAT 25:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 25:35" />Kwaikiva niwelili na njala na mwenga mkanipegha mulyo, niwelili niyumililwa na mwenga mkanipegha masi, niwelili mhenja na mwenga mkanipokela, <verse eid="MAT 25:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 25:36" />“Niwelili bila nguu, mkanivwalisa, niwelili mvina na mwenga mkahika kunilola, niwelili mlighuta lya wawopwa na mwenga mkahika kunilola.” <verse eid="MAT 25:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 25:37" />Hinu, wala wandu wa maha watemkonya, Bambu, ni ligha tukulolili mweni njala tukakupegha mulyo, au uwela na kuyumililwa na twenga tuka kupegha masi? <verse eid="MAT 25:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 25:38" />Ni ligha tukulolili ukiwela mhenja na twenga tukakupokela, au ukiwela ng'ogha na nguu, tukakuvwalisa? <verse eid="MAT 25:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 25:39" />Ni ligha tukulolili ukiwela mvina au muwopwa na twenga tukahika kukulola? <verse eid="MAT 25:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 25:40" />Nkosi atewayanga, “Chakaka ninguwalongela, vila muwagholilile wamonga wa hagha walongu ghangu wasokombi, mnigholilile nenga.”<verse eid="MAT 25:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 25:41" />“Hinu akawalongela wala wawelili upandi wa shotu ghaki,” “Mhuki kuulongolo ghangu mwenga mlapililwi! Myendi kulyoto lijimika ng'ogha ayandalililwi kala Lihyukana na mahoka ghaki.” <verse eid="MAT 25:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 25:42" />Kwaikiva niwelili na njala na mwenga mnipegha ng'ogha mulyo, niwelili nyumililwa na mwenga mnipeghili ng'ogha masi. <verse eid="MAT 25:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 25:43" />“Niwelili mhenja na mwenga mmbokela ng'ogha, niwelili mvina na muwopwa na mwenga mhika ng'ogha kunilola.” <verse eid="MAT 25:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 25:44" />Na weni wateyanga, “Bambu, ni ligha tukulolili ukiwela na njala au ukiwela mhenja au ukiwela ng'ogha na nguu, au ukiwela mvina au muwopwa, na twenga tukakutanga ng'ogha?” <verse eid="MAT 25:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 25:45" />Na mweni atewayanga, “Ninguwalongela chakaka, vila pala mlemili kumgholela mighalu hagha mmonga wa hagha wanung'una, mlemili kunigholela nenga.” <verse eid="MAT 25:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 25:46" />Hinu, “Hagha wateyenda kumaghaso gha machuwa hyogha bila mwihu, ila wala wandu wa maha wateyenda kuukomu wa machuwa hyogha bila mwihu.”<verse eid="MAT 25:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="MAT 26" />
  <para style="s">Mghalu wa kumkoma Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Maliku 14:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luka 22:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yohana 11:45-53</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 26:1" />Yesu paayomolili kulonga yala hyogha, akawalongela wavulwa ghaki, <verse eid="MAT 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 26:2" />“Mngumanya yiwa kuulongolo gha machuwa maivili tutewela na mhambu wa pasaka, na Mwana wa Adamu ateyeghwa kwa wahakata ghaki ili ahakilwi.”<verse eid="MAT 26:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 26:3" />Lipindi lila watambika wakulu na wagogolu wa wandu wakonganili pamonga kulighuta lya Mtambika Mkulu, lihina lyaki Kayafa. <verse eid="MAT 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 26:4" />Wakaghola mghalu wa kumkamula Yesu kwa kifisu na kumkoma. <verse eid="MAT 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 26:5" />Ila wakalamula mghalu hula ukotoho kugholeka lipindi lya mhambu wa pasaka, ili kukotoho kuhumila maghasu paghati gha wandu.<verse eid="MAT 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu unguyitilwa mahuta haku ku Besania</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Maliku 14:3-9</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Yohana 12:1-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 26:6" />Yesu paawelili ku Besania ukaya kwa Simoni, awelili na ukalawa, <verse eid="MAT 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 26:7" />mdala mmonga akamhikila akiva na supa yenikugholwa kwa liganga lyenikukemwa alabasita yeni kumema manungilo gha mapesa yatangala, akamuhikila pala alikalili kulyegha mulyo, akamyitila yala manungilo kumutu. <verse eid="MAT 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 26:8" />Wavulwa ghaki pawayalolili ghala wakahyoma, wakalonga, “Kwa kyani tunguyaghamisa vindu nagha? <verse eid="MAT 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 26:9" />Manungilo hagha yangawesili kuuswa kwa mapesa yatangala, na kuwapegha wakapuku mapesa hagha.”<verse eid="MAT 26:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 26:10" />Yesu amanyili mawachilo ghao, akawalongela, “Kwakyani mngumghasa hayu mdala? Hayu kanigholela mghalu wa maha nesu. <verse eid="MAT 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 26:11" />Wandu wakapuku wapabaha machuwa hyogha pamonga na mwenga, ila nenga nitewela ng'ogha na mwenga machuwa hyogha. <verse eid="MAT 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 26:12" />Hayu nyongo anguniyandala nenga kwaikiva gha masiko ghangu. <verse eid="MAT 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 26:13" />Ninguwalongela chakaka, kokosi mumlimawogha hai Habali Maha itetangaswa, mghalu hau augholile nyongo hayu utelongelwa kwa kumkumbwike mweni.”<verse eid="MAT 26:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yudasi angujumila kumhyuka Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:10-11">Maliku 14:10-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Luka 22:3-6</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 26:14" />Hinu, Yudasi Isikalioti mmonga wa wala ikumi na ivili, akayenda kwa watambika wakulu, <verse eid="MAT 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 26:15" />akawalongela, “Mtenipegha kindu kyani ikiva nitewayeghela Yesu kwa mwenga?” Wakampegha vipandi ikumi itatu vya lidini lya feza, <verse eid="MAT 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 26:16" />na kuhumila pala Yudasi akawela anguhaka fwasi maheli gha kumhyuka Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 26:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angulyegha mulyo wa pasaka na wavulwa ghaki</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Maliku 14:12-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:7-13">Luka 22:7-13</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">21-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yohana 13:21-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 26:17" />Lichuwa lya utumbula pambila gha mhambu wa mibumunda itayilwi ng'ogha simika, wavulwa ghaki wamyendilili Yesu wakamkonya, “Ungupala tukuyandalili kugha mulyo wa mhambu wa Pasaka?”<verse eid="MAT 26:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 26:18" />Yesu akawayanga, “Myendi kumbwani kwa mundu mtenu na haku mkamlongeli, ‘Mvula kalonga nagha, lisaa lyangu lihika kala, niteilyegha Pasaka pamonga na wavulwa ghangu kuukaya ghako.’”<verse eid="MAT 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 26:19" />Wavulwa wakaghola handa Yesu awalaghilili, wakayandala mulyo wa Pasaka.<verse eid="MAT 26:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 26:20" />Paihikili lumihi, Yesu pamonga na wavulwa ghaki ikumi na ivili wakatama pahi na kulyegha mulyo. <verse eid="MAT 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 26:21" />Pawawelili wakilyegha, Yesu akalonga, “Ninguwalongela chakaka, mmonga wa mwenga atenihyuka.”<verse eid="MAT 26:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 26:22" />Wavulwa ghaki wakang'ung'ulika nesu, wakatumbula kukonya mmonga mmonga, Bambu! “Ghuli ni nenga?”<verse eid="MAT 26:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 26:23" />Yesu akayanga, “Yula angutavika libumunda mulibakuli pamonga na nenga, ndiwa hayu atenihyuka. <verse eid="MAT 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 26:24" />Mwana wa Adamu anguyenda zyaki handa iyandikiliwi ila atenyokolwa mundu yula atemhyuka Mwana wa Adamu Ingawelili maha kwa mweni angawelekili ng'ogha”<verse eid="MAT 26:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 26:25" />Yudasi, akiwela mweni ndiwa apalili kumhyuka, akamkonya, “Mvula! Ghuli ni nenga?” Yesu akayanga, “Wenga uilongile.”<verse eid="MAT 26:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mulyo wa Bambu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Maliku 14:22-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Luka 22:14-20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1Wakolintu 11:23-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 26:26" />Pawawelili wakilyegha, Yesu akatola libumunda, akamshukwile Sapanga, akametula, akawapegha wavulwa ghaki akilonga “Mtoli mlyeghi, hau ni higha ghangu.”<verse eid="MAT 26:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 26:27" />Hinu akatola kitekelu kya divai, akashukwile, akawapegha akilonga, “Mnyweghi wogha, <verse eid="MAT 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 26:28" />hau ndiwa mwahi wa nenga weni kulangiha yiwa lilaghanu lya nenga ni lya chakaka mwahi weni kumwahika kwaikiva gha wandu watangala ili kuwahumisila sambi. <verse eid="MAT 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 26:29" />Ninguwalongela, nitenywegha ng'ogha kangi divai gha sabibu mbaka lichuwa lila nitenywegha divai hyonu pamonga na mwenga kuunkosi wa Tati ghangu.”<verse eid="MAT 26:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 26:30" />Pawayomolili kuyimba uyimbu, wakahuka wakayenda kulitumbi lya Mizeituni.<verse eid="MAT 26:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anguvika lipala yiwa Petelo atemghalambukila</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Maliku 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luka 22:31-34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yohana 13:36-38</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 26:31" />Hinu Yesu akawalongela, “Uhiku wa lelu, mwenga wogha mtenileka kwaikiva iyandikwa, nitemtova mhungaji, na mwenga wogha mtetula mbilo na kunileka.” <verse eid="MAT 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 26:32" />Ila badili gha nenga kuhinduka, “Nitewalongolela kuyenda Galilaya.”<verse eid="MAT 26:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 26:33" />Petelo akayanga, “Hata ikiva wandu wogha watekuleka, nenga nitekuleka ng'ogha.”<verse eid="MAT 26:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 26:34" />Yesu akamlongela Petelo, “Chakaka ningukulongela, uhiku hau yambila njogholu kaghuta ng'ogha, utenikanila miyanja itatu.”<verse eid="MAT 26:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 26:35" />Ila Petulo akalonga, “Hata ikawela ingupalwa kuhwegha pamonga na wenga, nitekukanila ng'ogha.” Na wavulwa ghangi wogha wakalonga hila hila.<verse eid="MAT 26:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anguyupa kukitawa Getisemani</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Maliku 14:32-42</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Luka 22:39-46</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 26:36" />Hinu Yesu akayenda pamonga na wavulwa ghaki kukitawa Getisemani, akawalongela wavulwa ghaki, “Mtami baha na nenga ninguyenda kula kuyupa.” <verse eid="MAT 26:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 26:37" />Akawatola Petelo na wana waivili wa Zebedayu, Yesu akatumbula kuwela na mang'ung'uliko na kunyengemala. <verse eid="MAT 26:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 26:38" />Hinu akawalongela, “Niwela na mang'ung'uliko makulu mmoyu hata pabehi gha kuhova. Mtami baha mkotoho kuwonja.”<verse eid="MAT 26:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 26:39" />Hinu, akayenda kuulongolo mayaghani, akaguwila mtima, akayupa, “Tati ghangu, ikiwela inguwesekana, kitekelu kya mahakilo haki kinihuki, ila ikotoho kuwela handa nipala nenga, ila handa ungupala wenga.”<verse eid="MAT 26:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 26:40" />Akawayendela wala wavulwa, wala awalolili wawonja, Akamlongela Petelo, “Ndiwa kulonga muwesa ng'ogha kutama mihu ili muweli pamonga na nenga hata lisaa limonga? <verse eid="MAT 26:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 26:41" />Mtami mkotoho kuwonja ila kuyupa ili mkotoho kuyingila kumayesu. Kwaikiva Mpumulo ungupala ila higha ulepelela makakala.”<verse eid="MAT 26:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 26:42" />Akayenda kangi lyanja lya ivili, “Akayupa wenga Tati ghangu, handa inguwesekana ng'ogha kuhyeta mahakilo hagha makulunga hinu ugholi handa ungupala wenga.” <verse eid="MAT 26:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 26:43" />Akawayendela kangi, akawalola wawonja, kwaikiva wawelili na luwonu.<verse eid="MAT 26:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 26:44" />Hinu, akawaleka, akayenda kangi kuyupa lihanja lya itatu kwa milando hilahila. <verse eid="MAT 26:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 26:45" />Hinu akahuya kwa wavulwa ghaki, na akawalongela, “Mkali mkawonja na kupumulila? Mloli, lisaa lihika kala Mwana wa Adamu angukamulwa na kuyeghwa kwa wandu wahakata. <verse eid="MAT 26:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 26:46" />Myinuki tuyendi, uloli anguhika yula atenihyuka nenga!”<verse eid="MAT 26:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angukamulwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:43-53">Maliku 14:43-53</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luka 22:47-53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">Yohana 18:3-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 26:47" />Yesu paawelili angulongela na weni, Yudasi mwenikuwela mmonga wa wala ikumi na waivili, akahika akiwela angukovekelana na lipinga likulunga likiwela na mipanga na vimbonga wenikuyeghwa na vilongosi wa watambika na vilongosi wa Wayahudi. <verse eid="MAT 26:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 26:48" />Yula apalile kumhyuka Yesu, awelili kawapegha kala kilangihi akilonga, “Yula nitemjambusa kwa kumkusukila ndiwa mumkamule.”<verse eid="MAT 26:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 26:49" />Hinu Yudasi akamyendela Yesu, akamlongela, “Habalee, Mvula!” na akamkusukila.<verse eid="MAT 26:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 26:50" />Yesu akamlongela, “Ghanja, ughole kila ukihikila kukighola.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:50">Pala wala wandu wakamyendela, na kumkamula Yesu na kumuwopa. <verse eid="MAT 26:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 26:51" />Na mmonga paghati gha wala wawelili pamonga na Yesu paalola vila, akakola lipanga lyaki, akauhomola na kumtova mhusutu wa Mtambika Mkulu, akamhinja lipulikilo. <verse eid="MAT 26:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 26:52" />Yesu akamlongela, “Uhuyisi lihimbi lyaki mumhaku ghaki, kwaikiva yeyose angutumila lipanga, atehova kwa lipanga. <verse eid="MAT 26:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 26:53" />Ghuli, mmanya ng'ogha yiwa ninguwesa kumluwa mtanga Tati ghangu na mweni akawesa kuniyeghela kwa kuloposela mapinga yapiti ikumi na ivili gha watumikila ghaki wa kundumba kwa Sapanga? <verse eid="MAT 26:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 26:54" />Ila handa paniteghola nagha yatetimilaghuli Mayandiko yala yenikulonga ingupalwa ihumili nagha?”<verse eid="MAT 26:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 26:55" />Lipindi lila Yesu akawalongela lila lipinga lya wandu, “Mnguhika kungamula na mihimbi pamonga na vimbonga handa vila nenga ni mpokola? Machuwa hyogha niwelili ku Lighuta lya Sapanga nikivula, na mnikamula ng'ogha! <verse eid="MAT 26:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 26:56" />Ila hagha hyogha yahumila ili ghala wayandikile walota kweni Mayandiko gha Sapanga yapati kutimila.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:56">Hinu watumikala wogha wakamleka, wakabhutuka.<verse eid="MAT 26:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kuulongolo gha Njengakaya</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:53-65">Maliku 14:53-65</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54-55">Luka 22:54-55</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:63-71">63-71</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:13-14">Yohana 18:13-14</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">19-24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 26:57" />Hinu wala wandu wamkamulili Yesu wakamyegha ukaya kwa Kayafa mwenikuwela mtambika mkulu, pala walikungulile wavula wa laghililo na vilongosi wa Wayahudi. <verse eid="MAT 26:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 26:58" />Petelo amkovekelili kwa utali mbaka mulyugha lya lighuta kwa Mtambika mkulu, akayingila mghati pamonga na wagholokela ili awese kulola mighalu itegholeka. <verse eid="MAT 26:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 26:59" />Hinu, watambika wakulu na njengakaya hyogha wakahakula kilangihi kya uhwangi kwa Yesu ili wapati kumkoma, <verse eid="MAT 26:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 26:60" />ila wapata ng'ogha kihighilisu chochose, pamonga na kuhika wahighilisa watangala wa uhwangi. Kuulongolo ghaki badili gha ghala wakahika walangihi waivili, <verse eid="MAT 26:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 26:61" />wakalonga, “Mundu hayu ailongile, ‘Ninguwesa kuyaghamisa Lighuta lya Sapanga na kuchenga kangi kwa lichuwa machuwa itatu.’”<verse eid="MAT 26:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 26:62" />Mtambika mkulu akagholoka, akamkonya Yesu, “Ghuli, wenga kwahela kya kuyanga kwa kila wangulongela wandu hagha?” <verse eid="MAT 26:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 26:63" />Ila Yesu atamili nuu. Mtambika Mkulu akamlongela, “Ningukulapila kwa lihina lya Sapanga ghako, utulongeli yiwa wenga ndiwa Kilisito, Mwana wa Sapanga.”<verse eid="MAT 26:63" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 26:64" />Yesu akamlongela, “Wenga uilongile! Ila ninguwalongela, kuhumila hinaa mtemlola Mwana wa Mundu kalikala upandi wa kuliyila wa yula Bambu Mweni Makakala, na akihika kunani gha mahindu gha kundumba.”<verse eid="MAT 26:64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 26:65" />Ndiwa Mtambika mkulu akalalula nguu zyaki, akalonga, “Hayu kalighu! Tungulindila uhighilisu ghani? Hinaa myoghanila mwaweni malighu ghaki. <verse eid="MAT 26:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 26:66" />Mwenga mnguliwachila kyani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:66">Weni wakamyanga, “Angupalwa ahovi!”<verse eid="MAT 26:66" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="MAT 26:67" />Hinu wakamuhunyila mata kuwuso, wakamtova ndwangisa. Ghangi wakiva wangumtova mimbandi, <verse eid="MAT 26:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="MAT 26:68" />wakalonga, “Ulote hinaa, wenga kwa mlota ng'ogha, ni ghani kakutova!”<verse eid="MAT 26:68" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petelo angumkanila Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">Maliku 14:66-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Luka 22:56-62</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">Yohana 18:15-18</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MAT 26:69" />Petelo awelili kalikala panji mlyugha. Hinu, mtumikila mmonga mdala Mtambika Mkulu, akamyendela, akalonga, “Wenga uwelili pamonga na Yesu wa Galilaya.”<verse eid="MAT 26:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="MAT 26:70" />Petelo akalema kuulongolo gha wogha akalonga, “Nimanya ng'ogha hata kila ungukilongela.” <verse eid="MAT 26:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="MAT 26:71" />Paawelili akihuka panji kuhika kumlyangu, mtumikila ghangi mdala amlolile, akawalongela wandu wawelili pala, “Hayu mundu awelili pamonga na Yesu, Mnazaleti.”<verse eid="MAT 26:71" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="MAT 26:72" />Petelo akalema kangi kwa kilapo, “Nimmanya ng'ogha mundu hayu.”<verse eid="MAT 26:72" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="MAT 26:73" />Kuulongolo mayaghani, wandu wawelili pala wakamuyendela Petelo, wakamlongela, “Kwa chakaka, wenga hilahila ni mmonga wa weni, kwaikiva vila ungulongela ni handa weni.”<verse eid="MAT 26:73" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="MAT 26:74" />Ndiwa Petelo akatumbula kujilapila akilonga, “Ningulapa yiwa kila ningukilonga ni chakaka! Handa ningulongela uhwangi Sapanga anidumuli mawoku! Nimmanya ng'ogha mundu hayu!” Bwitu njogholu akatova lilowi. <verse eid="MAT 26:74" /><verse number="75" style="v" sid="MAT 26:75" />Petelo aikumbwiki milando alongelilwi na Yesu, “Pambila njogholu kukuwa lilowi, utenikanila mihanja miitatu,” akahuma panji, na kulila kwa lusungu.<verse eid="MAT 26:75" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="MAT 27" />
  <para style="s">Yesu anguyeghwa kwa Pilatu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 15:1">Maliku 15:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-2">Luka 23:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-32">Yohana 18:28-32</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 27:1" />Malawila pee, watambika wakulu wogha na vilongosi wa Wayahudi wakakonganika kangi kuhakula njila gha kumkoma Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 27:2" />Wakamuwopa mawoku na maghulu, wakamtola, wakamyegha kwa Pilatu, mkulu wa mmbwani.<verse eid="MAT 27:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhova kwa Yudasi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="ACT 1:18-19">Matendu 1:18-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 27:3" />Hinu, Yudasi, yula mweni kumhyuka, palolili yiwa Yesu wa mlamula kala, akaijutila akawahuyisila watambika wakulu vila vipandi vya lidini vya feza vigwala iselasini. <verse eid="MAT 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 27:4" />Yudasi Akawalongela, “Nenga ngosa kwa kuwayeghela mundu mwenikuwela ng'ogha na mahakata akomwi.” Ila weni wakalonga,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:4">“Hai ingututanga kyani twenga? Hau ni mghalu ghako.”<verse eid="MAT 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 27:5" />Hinu Yudasi akatagha vila vipandi vya lidini lya feza magwala iselasini Mlighuta lya Sapanga , akahuma panji, akayenda akajipopotola mweni.<verse eid="MAT 27:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 27:6" />Watambika wakulu wakatola vila vipandi vya magwala, wakalonga, “Maha ng'ogha kuhanganya magwala hagha kuluhanja lwa Lighuta lya Sapanga kwaikiva hagha yahipwa ili mundu akomwi.” <verse eid="MAT 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 27:7" />Hinu, wakalongelana, wakayatumila kwa kuhemilela litawa lya mimambi, ili liweli lya kusikila wahenja. <verse eid="MAT 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 27:8" />Ndiwa kwaikiva hata lelu wandu wangulikema litawa hali litawa lya Mwahi.<verse eid="MAT 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 27:9" />Hinu milando gha mlota Yelemia ikatimila nagha, “Watolile ghala magwala iselasini handa bei apeghilwi na wandu wa Izilaili kuhemelelela. <verse eid="MAT 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 27:10" />Wakatumila kuhemelelela litawa lya mimambi handa Bambu alaghilili.”<verse eid="MAT 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pilatu angumkonya Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 15:2-5">Maliku 15:2-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:3-5">Luka 23:3-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:33-38">Yohana 18:33-38</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 27:11" />Lipindi Yesu kagholoka kuulongolo gha Pilatu mwenikuwela kilongosi wa mbwani wa Waloma, mlongosa hayu akamkonya, “Wenga ndiwa nkosi wa Wayahudi?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:11">Yesu akalonga, Wenga walonga nagha.” <verse eid="MAT 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 27:12" />Ila watambika wakulu na vilongosi wa Wayahudi pawawelili wakimsitaki, mweni kayanga ng'ogha lilando.<verse eid="MAT 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 27:13" />Hinu Pilatu akamkonya, “Ghuli, unguyughanila ng'ogha masitaka hagha hyogha wangukusitakila wenga?”<verse eid="MAT 27:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 27:14" />Ila Yesu kayanga ng'ogha hata lilando limonga, hata hayu mlongosa akalikangasa nesu.<verse eid="MAT 27:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angutoswa kuhova</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Maliku 15:6-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luka 23:13-25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Yohana 18:39-19:16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 27:15" />Wawelili wasyowilela lipindi lya mhambu gha Pasaka kilongosi wa Waloma kuwafughulila Wayahudi muwopwa mmonga wampalili. <verse eid="MAT 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 27:16" />Lipindi hali kuwelili na muwopwa mmonga mhakata, na lihina lyaki wamkema Yesu Balaba. <verse eid="MAT 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 27:17" />Hinu, wandu pawalikungulili pamonga, Pilatu akawakonya, “Mngupala nimuwoposoli ghani paghati gha hagha waivili, Yesu Balaba na Yesu wamkema Kilisito?” <verse eid="MAT 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 27:18" />Mweni ailongile nagha kwaikiva amanyili yiwa Yesu awelili kayeghwa kwa mweni kwaikiva gha wifu weka hela.<verse eid="MAT 27:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 27:19" />Pilato paawelili kalikala kukikalilo kya utoso, mdala ghaki akamyeghela ujumbi, “Ukotoho kughola kindu chochosi kwa mundu hayu mlungwana, kwaikiva uhiku wa lelo nihakilwa nesu panilota kwaikiva gha mweni.”<verse eid="MAT 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 27:20" />Ila watambika wakulu na vilongosi wa Wayahudi wakawatumisila wandu wamluwe awoposolwe Balaba na Yesu akomwe. <verse eid="MAT 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 27:21" />Kilongosi akawakonya kangi, “Ni ghani paghati gha hagha waivili mngupala nimuwoposoli?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:21">Wakamuyanga, “Balaba!”<verse eid="MAT 27:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 27:22" />Pilato akawakonya, “Hinaa, nigholi kyani na Yesu wamkema Kilisito?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:22">Wogha wakayanga, “Awambwi kulipingika!”<verse eid="MAT 27:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 27:23" />Pilato akakonya, “Kwa kyani? Kaghola uhakata liki?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:23">Weni wakayendelela kutova lilowi. “Awambwi kulipingika!”<verse eid="MAT 27:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 27:24" />Hinu Pilato paamanya kawesa ng'ogha kughola lolosi, ila mkologhanyiko unguyendelela akatola masi, akakuwa mawoko kuulongolo gha weni, akalonga, “Nenga napamonga ng'ogha na mwenga kukumkoma mundu hayu, hinu hau ni mghalu wa mwenga!”<verse eid="MAT 27:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 27:25" />Wandu wogha wakalonga, “Mwahi ghaki uweli kunani gha twenga na kunani gha wana wa twenga!”<verse eid="MAT 27:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 27:26" />Hinu akamuwoposola Balaba, na pawayomola kumtova Yesu hilatu igholwa kwa ngosi, akamyegha ili awambwi.<verse eid="MAT 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Watovangondo wangumsifila Yesu kiuhwangi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 15:16-20">Maliku 15:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:2-3">Yohana 19:2-3</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 27:27" />Kuulongolo watovangondo wa Pilato wakamyegha Yesu mghati gha likuta lya lighuta lya wakulu, na wakakungula lipinga likulu lya watovangondo. <verse eid="MAT 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 27:28" />Wakamuwoposola nguu zyaki zyogha, wakamvika lihabiti lya sambalau. <verse eid="MAT 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 27:29" />Wakapotanga likokoma lya mihomi, wakamvikila kumutu ghaki, wakamvikila mkongocho kuliwoku lyaki lya kuliyila, wakatundamila manung'una kulongolu ghaki, wakamkinila wakilonga, “Kayimuka nkosi wa Wayahudi!” <verse eid="MAT 27:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 27:30" />Hinu wakamhunyila mata, wakautola hula mkongocho, wakamtovela mmutu. <verse eid="MAT 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 27:31" />Pawayomolili kala kumgholela ghala, wakamwoposola lila lihabiti, wakamvwalisa nguu zyaki, na wakamyegha ili akavambwi kulipingika.<verse eid="MAT 27:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anguvambwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Maliku 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luka 23:26-43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yohana 19:17-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 27:32" />Pawawelili wakiyenda mnjila, wamuwonili mundu mmonga lihina lyaki Simoni, mkola mlima wa Kilene. Na watovangondo wakampapusa kutola lipingika lya Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 27:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 27:33" />Pawahikili mahala pakemilwi Goligota, pangumaanisa mahala palifufu lya Mutu, <verse eid="MAT 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 27:34" />wakampegha Yesu divai ihanganyilwi na nyongu, ili anyweghi, ila Yesu paayesili akakanila kunywegha.<verse eid="MAT 27:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 27:35" />Wakamvamba mlipingika, na wakapeghana nguu zyaki kwa kukinisa mihu gha mlungu. <verse eid="MAT 27:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 27:36" />Wakatama, wakawela wangumugholokela. <verse eid="MAT 27:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 27:37" />Kunani gha mutu ghaki kulipingika, wavikile kibau kyeni kuyandikwa sitaka lyaki, “Hayu ndiwa Yesu, Nkosi wa Wayahudi.” <verse eid="MAT 27:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 27:38" />Hinu wapokola waivili wavambilwi bahala, mmonga mbandi gha shotu na ghangi mbandi gha kuliyila.<verse eid="MAT 27:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 27:39" />Wandu wawelili wakityanga mahala pala wakamlighu malighu wakitika mutu ghao na kulonga, <verse eid="MAT 27:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 27:40" />“Wenga upalili kubomola lighuta na kuchenga ghangi kwa machuwa maitatu, ujilokoli hinaa umweni! Na uhuluki kuhuma kulipingika, ikiwela wenga ni Mwana wa Sapanga, ujihulusi kunani gha lipingika!”<verse eid="MAT 27:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 27:41" />Hilahila, vilongosi na watambika pamonga na wavula wa laghililo na vilongosi wa Wayahudi wakamkinila,wakilonga, <verse eid="MAT 27:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 27:42" />“Awalokolili ghangi, ila kujilokola mweni kawesa ng'ogha! Ghuli mweni ni nkosi wa Wayahudi! Hinu hinaa uhuluki mlipingika, na twenga tutemkwinila. <verse eid="MAT 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 27:43" />Amkwinilili Sapanga na akulonga yiwa mweni ni Mwana wa Sapanga hinu hinaa na Sapanga amlokoli handa angumpala!”<verse eid="MAT 27:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 27:44" />Hilahila na wala wavambilwi pamonga na mweni wakamlighu.<verse eid="MAT 27:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anguhova mlipingika</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Maliku 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luka 23:44-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yohana 19:28-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 27:45" />Kuhumila isaa isita pamuhi mbaka isaa itisa, lwisa totolo likagubika kunani gha mlima hula wogha. <verse eid="MAT 27:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 27:46" />Paihikili isaa itisa Yesu akalila kwa lilowi likulunga, “Eloi, Eloi, lama sabakatani?” Ingumaanisa, “Sapanga ghangu, Sapanga ghangu, kwa kyani ungunileka?”<verse eid="MAT 27:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 27:47" />Ila wala wagholokili pala pawayughanilili nagha, wakalonga “Angumkema Eliya.” <verse eid="MAT 27:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 27:48" />Bwitu mmonga wa wala akayenda kwa kutula mbilo na kuyegha siponji akainjwika msiki. Akaivika mlidengi akampegha Yesu ili afyembi.<verse eid="MAT 27:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 27:49" />Waghangi wakalonga, “Uleki tuloli handa Eliya kanguhika kumlokola.”<verse eid="MAT 27:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 27:50" />Hinu, Yesu akalila kangi kwa lilowi likulunga akahova.<verse eid="MAT 27:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 27:51" />Lipindi halihali lipasia lya nguu lya lighuta likabaluka vipandi viivili, kutumbulila kunani mbaka pahi. Mlima wogha ukahihimila na mighomba gha maganga ikabaluka. <verse eid="MAT 27:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 27:52" />Mamambi yakagubutuka lipala na wandu watangala wa Sapanga wahovili wakahindulwa. <verse eid="MAT 27:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 27:53" />Na weni, badili gha kuhinduka kwa Yesu, wakahuma mmimambi, wakayenda kummbwani wa Yelusalemu, na wakawoneka na wandu watangala.<verse eid="MAT 27:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 27:54" />Hinu, mkulu wa watovangondo na wala wawelili wakimgholokela Yesu pawawonili mhihimilu wa mlima na hila mighalu ihumilili, wakatila nesu,na wakalonga, “Chakaka mundu hayu awelili Mwana wa Sapanga.”<verse eid="MAT 27:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 27:55" />Mahala pala pawelili na wadala watangala wakilola kwa utali. Na ndiwa wala wamkovekelili Yesu kuhuma ku Galilaya wakimtanga. <verse eid="MAT 27:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 27:56" />Wamonga gha weni wawelili Maliya, mundu wa kuhuma mbwani wa magidala, Maliya nyongo ghao Yakobu na Yusufu, pamonga na nyongo ghao wana wa Sebedayu.<verse eid="MAT 27:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kusikwa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Maliku 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luka 23:50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yohana 19:38-42</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 27:57" />Paihikili lumihi, akahika mundu mmonga mnaisa kuhuma Alimataya, akemilwi Yusufu na mweni awelili mvulwa wa Yesu, <verse eid="MAT 27:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 27:58" />akamyendela Pilato, akamluwa apeghwi higha gha Yesu. Pilatu akawalongela wampeghi. <verse eid="MAT 27:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 27:59" />Yusufu akatola hula higha, akabindilila sanda mbuleti gha maha, <verse eid="MAT 27:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 27:60" />akauvika mghati mwa limambi lyaki lya hyonu awelili kalihimba kwa kulihongola kumghomba. Hinu akalibilibisa linganga likulunga kuulongolu gha mlyango wa limambi, akayenda zyaki. <verse eid="MAT 27:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 27:61" />Maliya ahumili mbwani wa magidala na yula Maliya ghangi wawelili mahala pala, watama wangulola kulimambi.<verse eid="MAT 27:61" /></para>
  <para style="s">Limambi lingugholokelwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 27:62" />Kilau ghaki, ingumanisa lichuwa lya kuulongolu lila lya mayandalilo, watambika wakulu na Mafalisayo wamyendelili Pilatu, <verse eid="MAT 27:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 27:63" />Wakalonga, “Mtundamilwa, tukumbwike yiwa yula mhwangi yambila gha kuhwegha ailongile, ‘Badili gha lichuwa lya itatu nitehinduka.’ <verse eid="MAT 27:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 27:64" />Kwaikiva gha nagha limambi ligholikelwi mbaka lichuwa lya itatu ili wavulwa ghaki wakotoho wakamhija na kuwalongela wandu uhwangi yiwa kahinduka. Uhwangi hau wa mwihu utewela wauhakata nesu, kupiti hula wa kuhyetu.”<verse eid="MAT 27:64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 27:65" />Pilatu akawalongela, “Ena, muwela na wagholokela. Hinu myendi mkagholokeli handa muwesa mwenga.”<verse eid="MAT 27:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 27:66" />Hinu, wakayenda, wakaligholokela limambi, wakamatika lami kumalanga na kuvika ugholokela mkalipa.<verse eid="MAT 27:66" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="MAT 28" />
  <para style="s">Kuhinduka kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 16:1-10">Maliku 16:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luka 24:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yohana 20:1-10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 28:1" />Hinu paliyendili lichuwa lya kupumulila, na paihikile malawila pee, lichuwa lya ijumapili, Maliya ahumili mmbwani wa magidala na yula Maliya ghangi wayendili kulola lila limambi. <verse eid="MAT 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 28:2" />Bwitu kukahumila na mhihimilu mkulunga wa mlima, Mtumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga akahuluka kuhuma kundumba, akalibilibisa lila liganga na akalikala kunani ghaki. <verse eid="MAT 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 28:3" />Awonekanili handa umemi na nguu zyaki ziwelili mbulete pee handa sufi. <verse eid="MAT 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 28:4" />Wagholokela wa lila limambi wakahihimila kwa holu ngulu, hata wakawela handa wahova.<verse eid="MAT 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 28:5" />Ila yula mtumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga akawalongela wala Wadala, “Mwenga mkotoho kutila! Ningumanya yiwa mngumhaka Yesu yula awambilwi. <verse eid="MAT 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 28:6" />Kabaha ng'ogha kahinduka handa ailongili. Hinu mhiki mloli mahala paawelili kawonja. <verse eid="MAT 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 28:7" />Hinu, myendi kwa kuloposela mkawalongeli wavulwa ghaki yiwa kahinduka, na hinu anguwalongolela ku Galilaya, haku mtemlola. Mkumbwiki niwalongilile.”<verse eid="MAT 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 28:8" />Hinu wala wadala wakahuka pala kulimambi kunu wamema holu, ila wakiwela na luheku nesu, wakahuka kwa kuloposela mlimambi, wakatula mbilu kuyenda kuwalongela wavulwa ghaki.<verse eid="MAT 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 28:9" />Bwitu, Yesu akakongana na weni akalonga, “Kayimuka.” Wala wadala wakamyendela pabehi, wakamtundamilila manung'una kuulongolo ghaki, wakakamula maghulu ghaki. <verse eid="MAT 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 28:10" />Hinu Yesu akawalongela, “Mkotoho kutila! Myendi mkawalongeli walongu ghangu wayendi Galilaya, na haku ndiwa watenilola.”<verse eid="MAT 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wagholokela wanguyenda kwa wakulu ghao kuwalongela ghala wayalolile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 28:11" />Hinu wala wadala lipindi pawawelili mnjila wakiyenda zyau, wamonga wa wagholokela wa lila limambi wayendili kumbwani kulongela ghala wayalolile kwa watambika wakulu. <verse eid="MAT 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 28:12" />Hinu, wakulu wa watambika wakakongine na vilongosi wa Wayahudi wakayandala njila kwa kuwapegha mapesa yatangala wala wagholokela, <verse eid="MAT 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 28:13" />wakiwalongela, “Mwenga mngupalwa kulonga nagha, ‘Wavulwa ghaki wahika uhiku, wakamuhija twenga patuwonjili.’ <verse eid="MAT 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 28:14" />Na paikawela kilongosi wa mbwani kamanya mghalu hau, twenga tutelongela na mweni na mwenga mteghaswa ng'ogha.”<verse eid="MAT 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 28:15" />Wala wagholokela wakatola hila migwala, wakaghola handa wavulilwi. Habali hila ikalandala kwa Wayahudi mbaka lelu.<verse eid="MAT 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anguwahumila wavulwa ghaki</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Maliku 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luka 24:36-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yohana 20:19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Matendu 1:6-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 28:16" />Wala wavulwa ikumi na mmonga wakayenda ku Galilaya handa vila awalaghilili Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 28:17" />Pawamlolili wakamtundamila, ila na amonga gha weni wakawela wangukwinila ng'ogha yiwa ndiwa Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 28:18" />Yesu akahika pabehi, akawalongela, “Mbokela uweso wogha kundumba na kumlimawogha. <verse eid="MAT 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 28:19" />Hinu myendi, mkawaghole wandu wa mlima wogha waweli wavulwa, mkiwabatisa kwa lihina lya Tati, na lya Mwana, na lya Mpumulo wa Sapanga. <verse eid="MAT 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 28:20" />Muwavuli kukola malaghililo hyogha niwapeghili. Na nenga niwela pamonga na mwenga machuwa hyogha, ena mbaka mwihu wa lipindi lyogha.”<verse eid="MAT 28:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 28" />
</usx>